ācārya hevajrapañjikā muktāvalī

om namaḥ śrīvajrasatvāya

pādanyāsaiḥ pṛthivyāṃ vihitavighaṭanaṃ bhūbhṛtāmaṭṭahasai
rdṛktejaḥketughaṇṭādhvanibhir api nayannāśasṛṣṭīrjagatri ||
bibhramāṇasyāvaliptapraśamanavidhaye bhīṣaṇānabhyupāyan |
pāyād vo jainaguhyatrayahṛdayahṛdas pāṇḍavaṃ herukasya || 1

darśitasūtranugamā pramāṇavṛttaprasādhitā viśadā |
muktāvalīva hṛdyā hevajre panjikā kriyate || 2

aśraddhā mūlaripuḥ praṇāśapadamekamiyamatiśraddhā |
nanu sarvavit pramāṇānna gauravāt sarvavid bhavati || 3

kṛtamapyakṛtam jinena yastadanuktaṃ taduktamāha yaḥ |
kṣipataḥ samameva tāvubhau paramāptaṃ jagatastathāgatam || 4

hitamuktamanekadhā jinaiḥ pratigṛhṇanti yathāśayaṃ janāḥ |
tadihāpi rucipravartanī pravaraṇetyarthamiyaṃ tu pañjikā || 5

śrutamasati na bodhe nāśrute cāsti cintāa 
dvayavipadi na yogo yogahānau na siddhiḥ |
iti ciramiha tantre tāpam utkaṇṭhitānām 
haratu hṛdi nibaddhā hanta muktāvalīyam || 6

evaṃ mayetyādi nidānavākyam yatastantrāntarameva saṃkṣiptametadityeke | vistaratantrāt kalpadvayametadākṛṣṭam | tatra yathāsaṅgītameveti vivedanārthaṃ nidānavākye mayākṛṣṭam ityapare | anya evāsya paramarahasyo 'rtha ityanye |

tadasat | tasyādau vaktumayogāt paścādeva vakṣyamāṇatvāt anakṣarārūḍhatvācca | tadamī vakṣyamāṇamarthamanyārthe granthe haṭhena ghaṭayanti mūḍhavismāpanārtham | tasmādihāpi nidānavākyamevedam uktaṃ ca bhagavatā evaṃ mayā śrutamiti bhikṣavo mama dharmaḥ saṅgātavyaḥ ityataḥ saṅgītikāra āha evaṃ mayā śrutamiti |

svayamabhisaṃbuddho dharmo deśyate | daiśikācchrutaḥ saṅgīyate | ataḥ śrutam ityanena saṅgītiṃ sūcayati | asākṣācchrute 'nyathāśrute ca saṅgītirapramāṇam vipralambhasambhavāt | tadanayorvyudāsāya dve pade evaṃ mayeti |

tatra mayeti mayaiva daiśikācchrutam na śrutiparamparāyāmapyāgatam | evamiti yathā saṅgāsyāmi evameva mayā śrutaṃ nānyathetyarthaḥ |

anurūpe sthāne kādācitko daiśikasya vihāro 'nurūpaśca pariṣatsannipāto deśanāyā nidānam tadāha ekasminnityādi | samayaḥ kālaḥ | bhagavān iti hevajramūrtirvajradharaḥ | aiśvaryādayaḥ ṣaṭ samagrā bhagāḥ | yathoktam

aiśvaryasya samagrasya jñānasya yaśasaḥ śriyaḥ |
rūpasyārthaprayatnasya ṣaṇṇāṃ bhaga iti smṛtiḥ || iti || 
bhagā asya santīti bhagavān | vijahāra iti buddhavihārairviharati sma | catvāro buddhavihārāḥ īryāpathavihāraḥ deśanāvihāraḥ samāpattivihāraḥ pratisaṃlayanavihāraśceti | samāhito hi cāro vihāraḥ |

nityasamāhitāśca bhagavanto buddhāḥ | tasmād yatkiñcid buddhānām bhagavatāṃ kāyakarma sa teṣām īryāpathavihāraḥ | yatkiñcit teṣāṃ vākkarma sa deśanāvihāraḥ | yat teṣāṃ samādhisamāpattau prakṛtisamāhitaṃ vā manaskarma sa samāpattivihāraḥ | yad buddhānām dṛṣṭadharmasukhavihāre devatādyupasaṅkramaṇe ca manaskarma sa teṣāṃ pratisaṃlayanavihāraḥ |

kva vijahāra sarvatathāgatākāyavākcittavajrayoṣidbhageṣu sarvatathāgatānāṃ kāya vāk cittaṃ triguhyasaṃhāraḥ | kāyaścāsau vākcittañceti kṛtvā | tatpunarbhagavato vajradharasya rūpaṃ dharmodayākhyam teṣāmeva tathāgataguhyāanāṃ suviśuddhatathatātmakam | taddhi yasmāt triguhyasaṃhāraḥ tasmāt trikoṇam yasmāt suviśuddhā tathatā tasmāccharadindudhavalamantaḥśuṣiraṃ ca | yasmād uttarottaraviśālena pramuditādibhūmikrameṇa viśuddham tasmād uttarottaraviśālaṃ tadeva ca vajrayoṣitāṃ locanādīnāṃ bhagāni anāsravānandadharmadharmatāśarīratvāt tāsām | ata eva sarvatathāgatakāyavākcittañ ca tad vajrayoṣidbhagāni ceti viśeṣaṇasamāsaḥ | teṣviti tatrasthe kūṭāgāra ityarthaḥ | tadyathā nagare vasatyādya iti nagarasthe prāsāda ityarthaḥ | guhyātiguhyatare sthāne bhagavato vihāramupalabhya nūnamatra bhagavān guhyātiguhyataraṃ dharmaṃ deśayiṣyatīti anurūapapariṣatsannipātaḥ sāmarthyāduktaḥ | sā punaḥ pariṣad vajragarbhādayo bodhisattvāḥ locanāadayo gauryādayaśca vajrayoginyaḥ || 1 ||

tatreti tasmin vihāre | āheti kimarthamāha śrotṛjanasyotkaṇṭhanārtham | kimāha sarvetyādi | yathā gantavyaṃ tathaiva gatā iti tathāgatāḥ savāsanasarvāvaraṇaprahāṇāt | athavā gataśabdo jñānārthaḥ | yathaiva dharmāstathaiva gataṃ jñānameṣāmiti tathāgatāḥ sarvadā sarvākārasarvajñeyasamyagjñānāt | athavā vyatyayena dakārasya takāraḥ | yathā gaditavyaṃ tathaiva gadantīti tathāgatāḥ yathāśayaṃ yathāgotraṃ yathākālaṃ ca vineyajanebhyaḥ samyagdharmadeśanāt | sarve ca te tathāgatāśca teṣāṃ kāyavākcittaṃ sa eva vajradharaḥ | tasya hṛdayaṃ sāraṃ bhaṭṭārakamiti paramadaivatam niṣprapañcajñānātmanāṃ mantradevatānāṃ sarvāṇyeva kāyavākcittāni guhyāni durabhiśraddhānatvāt | teṣvatiguhyāni guhyātiguhyāni | yāni raudrāṇi saṃyuktāni vā | hevajrākhyaṃ tu kāyavākcittaṃ paramaraudram udriktarāgaṃ ca | tasmād guhyātiguhyataram | tadasya durlabhatarāḥ śraddhātāra iti bhāvaḥ |

iti iti evamityarthaḥ | ittham utkaṇṭhitānāṃ pāriṣadyānāṃ trayo vitarkā utpannāḥ | yadi guhyātiguhyataramidaṃ tadā yādṛśaḥ puruṣo bhavyaḥ sa vaktavya iti prathamo vitarkaḥ | nāsti vajradharāt para iti siddhāntaḥ tat kiṃ tasyaiva sāramidam kiṃ vā tato 'nyasya kāyavākcittanāmna iti dvitīyaḥ | kiṃ nāmakaṃ caitad bhaṭṭārakamiti tṛtīyaḥ |

tadeteṣāṃ vitarkāṇāṃ nirākaraṇāyāha aho ityādi | ihāpyante pūrvavākyād iti śabdo 'nuvartayitavyaḥ | cārtho gamyate iti ceti evaṃ cāhetyarthaḥ | iti śabdaḥ kvacit pustake prāgapi na paṭhyate | vināpi tena tadarthagateḥ |

(           ) 

aho vajragarbha iti sarva eva bodhisattvāḥ vajragarbhāstathāgatagotrā ityarthaḥ | pañcaiva ca mohadveṣamānarāgerṣyāḥ kulatathāgatāḥ | tatra yo dveṣagotraḥ sa vajragarbha iti nāmedamanvartham | bodhisattvasya durlabhaṃ caitad gotram | ata eva savismayamāmantraṇam aho iti | sādhu sādhu mahākṛpa mahābodhisattva iti | paramaraudrādibhiḥ sarvopāyaiḥ parārthakaraṇāśayatvānmahākṛpaḥ | taireva niravadhi viśvārthasādhanī bodhirmahābodhiḥ tasyāṃ sattvamabhiprāyo 'syeti mahābodhisattvaḥ | yasyedṛśaḥ parahitāśayaḥ svahitāśayaśca sa paraḥ puruṣasiṃhānām | ata eva sādhu sādhviti ślāghādvayam | śṛṇu iti śrute niyojayati | iyatā evaṃgotra evamāśayaśca satpuruṣo 'smin bhavya iti sūcayati | 
ayamevaṃgotra iti kathaṃ jñāyate 
tadguṇeṣu śraddhāruciviśeṣādibhirliṅgaiḥ | 
uktaṃ ca āryalaṅkāvatāre 
dhūmena jñāyate vahniḥ salilaṃ ca balākayā | 
nimittairjñāyate gotraṃ bodhisattvasya dhīmataḥ || iti || 
(tattvasaṃgraha pṛ 16 vasantatilakaṭīkā pṛ 8) 
iyatā prathamavitarko nirastaḥ |

dvitīyasya nirāsārthamāha vajrasattvasya mahāsattvasya samayasattvasya hṛdayam iti satyaṃ nāsti vajradharāt paraḥ | kintu mahākaruṇāpradhānatvād vajrakulasya hevajro vajradharasya paraṃ rūpam | tasmādayaṃ tasya hṛdayamucyate | sārārtho hi hṛdayārtha iti bhāvaḥ | ityanena dvitīyavitarkanirāsaḥ |

hevajrākhyam ityanena tṛtīya vitarkanirāsaḥ || 2 ||

uvāca iti | kimuvāca praśnatrayam | kimarthamuvāca pādatrayasūcitasya vajradharamāhātmyasya vivaraṇārtham || 3 ||

āha iti | kimāha yathāpraśnamuttaratrayam | abhedyam iti bhettumaśakyam | vajramityuktam iti vajrasādharmyāt | trayo bhavāḥ sarve buddhadharmāḥ | bhavantīti bhavāḥ | kasmādatra buddhadharmā eva bhavāḥ prādhānyāt | kutaḥ sarve vyāpternyāyāt | kathaṃ trayaḥ kāyavākcittabhedena | traya eva bhavāstribhavam tasyaikatā samatā sā sattvam | kathaṃ tasyaikatā sarvasāsravadharmabījakṣayāt pratiṣṭhādehabhoganirbhāsānāṃ vijñānānāṃ nirodhāt kevalavimalānandanabhastalanibhe cittamalatyaktālayavijñānalakṣaṇe anāsravadhātulakṣaṇaprāpte śaktilakṣaṇe sarvabuddhadharmabījādhāre nirābhāsena prakāśarūpeṇa mahāsukhamayatribhavasya yāvadākāśameva sthānaṃ tribhavasyaikatā |                                                                                  
sā kutaḥ sattvamucyate yato 'syaiva suviśuddhatā | atra hi sato bhāvaḥ sattavamiti praśastapadavācī sattvaśabdaḥ prakarṣagateḥ suviśuddhatāyāṃ vartate dharmakāya ityarthaḥ | viśuddhatā hi puruṣasya vimuktakāyaḥ | suviśuddhatā dharmakāyaḥ  buddhadharmāṇāṃ kāyo nivāsa āśrayastadbījādhāratvāditi dharmakāya ityucyate | dharmakāyasya ca pradhānaṃ śarīramanādinidhano dharmadhāatuḥ prakṛtiprabhāsvaraḥ sarvakālaṃ tathaiveti kṛtvā tathatākhyaḥ |

ata eva na kadācid bhidyata iti abhedyatvād vajraḥ | prakṛtinityatayā nitya ityarthaḥ | kevalamāgantukamalaśuddhistasya bhidyate pūrvamabhāvāt pramuditādibhūmiṣu krameṇopacayāt buddhabhūmau yāvadākāśaṃ sākalyena bhāvāt |

anayā prajñayā iti padārthayoḥ pravibhajyajñānena yuktyā iti yogena tayoreva sāmānādhikaraṇyajñānena |

vajraścāsau sattvaśceti anena vajrasattva iti smṛtaḥ uktaḥ | chāndaso liṅgavyatyayaḥ | ārṣaṃ hi vacanaṃ | sarvametacchando na vā kiñcidapi || 4 ||

mahājñānarasairityādi | mahājñānāni mahāyānasvabhāvāḥ śuklā dharmāḥ teṣāṃ rasā āsvādāḥ saṃbhogāḥ | paramojjvalasaptaratnamaye 'nantalokadhātvantarasphuraṇamahāraśmipramokṣe pariśuddhabuddhakṣetre vividhaguṇavyūhālaṅkāre nirūpamalakṣaṇānuvyañjanavirājitena dehena | āryabodhisattvaiḥ saha saṃbhūya bhogāḥ saṃbhogāstaiḥ pūrṇastaireva bodhisattvaḥ saha pratikṣaṇatṛptaḥ |

yato 'sau na kadācid vinaśyati asraṃsanatayā nityo bhavatītyarthaḥ | asraṃsanamaṇidharaḥ pravāhaḥ | tathāhi pariśuddheṣu buddhakṣetreṣu mahādharmarasaprītisukhairupastambhaḥ sattvānāṃ na kavalīkārādyāhāraiḥ | kaḥ punarasau mahājñānarasaiḥ pūrṇaḥ sāmbhogikaḥ kāyo buddhānāṃ sa mahāsattveti nigadyate mahāsattva ityucyate | kathaṃ sīdati tiṣṭhati na vinaśyatīti sattvaḥ | mahān sattvo mahāsattvaḥ | atyantaṃ na vinaśyatītyarthaḥ |

nityam ityādi | atra samayaśabdena mahāsamayo draṣṭavyaḥ | padaikadeśena padasaṃsūcanāt bhīmo bhīmasena iti yathāa | sphuraṇayogena samantād gamanaṃ samayaḥ yathāśayaṃ viśvavinayanopāyaiḥ | sarvairākāraiḥ samayo mahāsamayaḥ | mahāsamayena sattvo mahāsamayasattvaḥ | satatapravṛttatvāt sattva iti nairuktena varṇānāṃ lopena | ata evāha nityaṃ samayapravṛttatvād iti |

yo buddhānāmanantaprabhedo nirmāṇakāyaḥ | prabandhanityatayā nityaḥ sa mahāsamayasattvaśabdenocyata ityarthaḥ tadyathā mahatyaraṇye lagnāgniḥ kvacijjvalati dvacijjvalita evāste kvacinnirvāti evaṃ buddhānāṃ nirmāṇakāyo 'nyeṣu buddhakṣetreṣūtpadyate anyeṣūtpanno viharati anyeṣu parinirvāti na ca sarvalokadhātavastena śūnyāḥ kathañcid bhavantīti prabandhanityatārthaḥ | evamete trayaḥ kāyāḥ prabhedenānantā ekaikasya buddhasya | ye sarvabuddhānāṃ te sarva ekasyaiva vajradharasya | sarvaṃ hi teṣāṃ tadadhīnaṃ tanmayañ ca | tadayaṃ bhagavān vajradharo dharmakāyena vajrasattva iti | sambhogakāyena mahāsattva iti | nirmāṇakāyena mahāsamayasattva ityucyate | iyatā ca vajradharasya māhātmyavivaraṇena hevajrasyāpi māhātmyamarthād vivṛtam taddhṛdayatvāttasya || 5 ||

vajragarbha uvāca iti | kimuvāca aparaṃ praśnatrayam | kimarthamuvāca hevajrasya vajradharahṛdayatve kāraṇaṃ nāmnaiva yat sūcitaṃ tasya vivaraṇārtham na tu śabda iti śabdasyārthe | hevajra iti īdṛśaṃ nāmasaṅgraham iti samastam keneti kena vigraheṇa bhavet vajreṇa iti vajraśabdena || 6 ||

mahākaruṇā iti bhaṇyata iti sambandhaḥ nairukto malopa itvaṃ ca karuṇāśabdasyeti bhāvaḥ | atyantaduṣṭaraudrāṇāṃ vinayanāya | paramaraudrakāyavākkarmasandarśanī tu mahākaruṇā |

(     ) 

(                       ) 

prajñā ca vajraṃ bhaṇyate vajraśabdena bhaṇyata ityarthaḥ | prakṛṣṭaṃ jñānaṃ prajñā advyajñānamityarthaḥ | iha tu śūnyataiva prajñetyucyate prajñālambanatvāt | tathā coktaṃ śrīmadguhyasamāje 
yā niḥsvabhāvatā prajñā upāyo bhāvalakṣaṇaḥ | 
(guhyasamājatantra 18 32) 
sā kathaṃ vajramucyate 
dṛḍhaṃ sāramasauṣiryamacchedyābhedyalakṣaṇam |
adāhī avināśī ca śūnyatā vajramucyate || 
(a va saṃ pṛ 23 he paṃ yo ra mā pṛ 108) 
iti vajraśekhare vacanāt |

prajñopāyātmakam iti | prajñā ca śūnyatā upāyaśca mahākaruṇā prajñopāyau tāvātmā svabhāvo 'syeti prajñopāyātmakam | etena heśca vajraśca hevajram iti vigrahaḥ sūcitaḥ | sarvadharmaśūnyatālambanā mahākaruṇā hevajra ityarthaḥ |

tantram iti prabandhastantram | tacca trividham hetutantraṃ phalatantram upāyatantraṃ ca | ata eva hevajro 'pi trividhaḥ hetuhevajraḥ phalahevajra upāyahevajraśca | heturgotraṃ kulamiti paryāyāḥ | iha tu vajrakulameva mahākaruṇāprajñāpradhānānāṃ kuśalānāṃ bhājanatvena hetuhevajro hetutantraṃ cocyate | tatkathaṃ hevajraḥ hevajrahetutvāat | kathaṃ prabandhaḥ vajrakulināṃ sattvānāṃ bahutvād hetuhevajrabalād upāyahevajracirābhyāsalabhyaṃ mahāvajradharapadaṃ phalahevajraḥ phalatantraṃ cocyate |

tatkathaṃ hevajraḥ hevajraphalatvāt | kathaṃ prabandhaḥ anantabuddhadharmamayatvāt | mahākaruṇāprajñāpradhānaṃ tu kuśalaprabandho mukhyo hevajro mukhyamupāyatantram | tatra hetuphalatantre prāgeva nirdiṣṭe || 7 ||

upāyatantraṃ tu na jñāyate tatastadadhikṛtyāha dṛṣṭītyādi | sāmarthyam śaktiḥ bahuvidham iti varṣāpaṇameghasphāṭanādi || 8 ||

yathānyāyaṃ yathāyogam | utpattiḥ ākāracihnādi | sthitiḥ ādhāramaṇḍalam | kāraṇaṃ candrasūryādi | sāmarthyaṃ japabhāvanotkarṣaprabhāvaḥ | jñānaṃ jyotiṣādi | vijñānaṃ sarvācāryakarmakauśalam | devatānāmiti śrīherukasya saparivārasya nairātmyāyā vā | yathodayamiti yathāyogamutpattiḥ || 9 ||

ekamiti yathoktaṃ dṛṣṭākṛṣṭyādi | herukaḥ phalahevajraḥ tasyotpattiḥ tatpadaprāptiḥ tasyāḥ kāraṇam upāyatantramityarthaḥ | kasmādidaṃ prathamaṃ devatādyākāramahopāyabahulasyopattikramasya prakṛṣṭataratvāt |

nanu mahāyānamidam mahāyāne ca vijñaptimātraśarīrāḥ sarvadharmāḥ uktaṃ cāryadaśabhūmake cittamātramidaṃ yaduta traidhātukam iti | prakāśo hi vijñapteḥ svarūpam yasyāsau svabhāvo na bhavati na sa prakāśate virodhāt | tasmāt prakāśamānaṃ nīlapītādi na vijñānabāhyo 'rthaḥ | kiṃ tarhi vijñānasyaivātmabhūtaḥ pratibhāsa ābhāsa ākāraḥ sajātīyavikalpāhitavāsanopahatāccittādeva nānā''kārasya vijñānasyotpatteḥ tadyathā svapne | uktaṃ cāryalaṅkāvatāre


bāhyo na vidyate hyartho yathā bālairvikalpyate |
vāsanāluṭhitaṃ cittamarthābhāsaṃ pravartate || iti || 
laṅkāvatārasūtra 10 284 
luṭhitamupahatam | api ca nedaṃ nīlādikaṃ bāhyo 'rthaḥ ekānekasvabhāvavirahāt | na hi tadekaṃ bhāgabhedena pratibhāsanāt | nāpyanekaṃ paramāṇuśaḥ paramāṇoryo rayo gāt | tathā hi yadyasau sāṃśaḥ sa kathaṃ paramāṇuḥ | atha niraṃśaḥ tadā saṃyuktāḥ paramāṇavaḥ sarvātmanā saṃyogāt parasparamabhinnadeśāḥ syuriti sarvaḥ piṇḍaḥ paramāṇumātraḥ syād gajo 'pi girirapi sāgaro 'pi pṛthivyapi | uktaṃ cāryalaṅkāvatāre 
yathaiva darpaṇe rūpamekatvānyatvavarjitam |
dṛśyate na ca tatrāsti tathā bhāveṣu bhāvatā || iti || 
laṅkāvatārasūtra 10 709 
tasmānnāsti vijñānabāhyo grāhyo 'rthaḥ | tadabhāvāttadapekṣakaṃ grāhakatvamapi vijñānasya nāstīti sarvarthā dvayaṃ nāsti grāhyaṃ grāhakaṃ ca | asati dvaye dvayapratibhāsā bhrāntirasti | saiva bhrāntirabhūtaparikalpaḥ | tasya vābhūtaparikalpasya tena dvayena śunyatā rahitatā vijñaptimātratā nityamasti | tadeva dvayaṃ parikalpitaḥ svabhāvo bhāvānāṃ yathālakṣaṇamasattvāt | abhūtaparikalpaḥ paratantraḥ svabhāvaḥ paraistantryate hetupratyayairutpādyata iti kṛtvā | dvayaśūnyatā pariniṣpannaḥ svabhāvo nityaṃ tathaiva bhāvāt | uktaṃ cāryamaitreyanāthena 
kalpitaḥ paratantraśca pariniṣpanna eva ca |
arthādabhūtakalpācca dvayābhāvācca deśitaḥ || iti || 
madhyāntavibhāga lakṣaṇapariccheda 10 6 
tatra bodhisattvena trayaḥ samādhayo bhāvayitavyāḥ na santi sarvabhāvāḥ parikalpitaiḥ skandhāyatanadhātulakṣaṇairiti śūnyaḥ samādhiḥ parikalpitaskandhādināstitālambanatvāt | 
duḥkhaṃ duḥkhahetuśca traidhātukaṃ satā paratantreṇa svabhāvena abhūtaparikalpitatvādasatā dvayarūpeṇa prakhyānāditi apraṇihitaḥ samādhiḥ punarbhavapraṇidhānaparipanthitvāt | dvayaśūnyatā sarvadharmāṇāṃ prakṛtiranāgantukatvāt | saiva tathatā nityaṃ tathaiva

bhāvāt | saiva bhūtakoṭiḥ sarvatattvānāmagratvāt | saivānimittaṃ bhrāntinimittānāmākārāṇāṃ parivarjane sati tasyāḥ prakhyānāt | saiva paramārthaḥ paramasya lokottarajñānasya gocaratvāt | saiva dharmadhātuḥ āryadharmāṇāṃ balavaiśāradyādīnāṃ hetutvāt tāmevālambamānānāmāryadharmotpatteḥ |

sā ceyaṃ dvayaśūnyatā na bhāvo nāpyabhāvaḥ | kuto na bhāvaḥ dvayābhāvalakṣaṇatvāt | kuto nābhāvaḥ sarvadharmāṇāṃ prakṛtitvāditi | ayamānimittaḥ samādhiḥ animittālambanatvāt | etacca samādhitrayaṃ gauṇī prajñāpāramitā tatprayogatvāt |

tata evamupaparīkṣeta | yo 'yaṃ nīlapītādirākāraḥ khyāti na sa bāhyamāntaraṃ vā vastu ekānekasvabhāvavirahāt pūrvavat | kevalamanādyavidyābhyāsavāsanābalaviplutānāṃ bālānāṃ buddhirasataiva tenākāreṇa khyāti | tameva cākāraṃ nimittīkṛtyālambanīkṛtya lokasya dvayakalpanā dvayagrāhakaśca sarvānarthanidānabhūtaḥ pravartate | yāvaccāyamākāraḥ khyāti tāvat paramārtho na dṛśyate keśamaśakādidarśibhistaimirikaiḥ keśādiśūnyatāvaditi | sa evamupaparīkṣya sarvanāmāni sarvanimittāni ca parivarjayati | tatastasya sarvadharmālambane samādhau nirjalpe nirābhāse sthitasya pūrvaprayogavāsanābalādanābhogato 'nabhisaṃskārataḥ sarvaprapañcanimittānāmastaṅgamādavikalpamanābhāsaṃ sarvadharmaśūnyatādarśanam kevalavimalānandagaganopamaṃ lokottaraṃ jñānam |

pāramārthikaṃ bodhicittaṃ mukhyā prajñāpāramitā sarvāvaraṇapratipakṣo mārga utpadyate | tena pratipakṣeṇālayavijñānasaṃniviṣṭānāṃ sarvasāṅkleśikadharmabījānāṃ vāsanānāṃ parikṣayāt pratiṣṭhādehabhoganirbhāsānāṃ vijñānānāṃ nirodhāt tadālayavijñānalakṣaṇatyāgādanāsravadhātulakṣaṇaṃ parigṛhṇāti | sa evānāsravo dhāturbuddhānāṃ dharmakāyaḥ | tatprāptau datadhīnā sambhoganirmāṇakāyaprāptiriti siddhāntaḥ |

etasmin siddhānte prajñāpāramitaiva buddhatvāya bhāvyate | sā ca dvayaprabhedānāmarthānāṃ samyagabhāvajñānam | dvayābhāvaniścayād dvayākārāṇāmalīkānāmasatamayādanantaprakāśamātrakhyātiḥ | tato yeyamākāravatī herukasya yoginīnāṃ mantracihnāsanakūṭāgārādīnāṃ ca bhāvanā sā prapañco viparyāsaḥ saṃsārāvahaḥ |

prayāso na mokṣāvaha iti kasyacidāśaṅkā syāt atastāmapākartumāha bhāvenaiva vimucyanta iti | bhāvayatyatyantaṃ sthāpayati sarvabuddhadharmān prāpayatīti bhāvaḥ ṣaṭ pāramitāḥ | tenaiva mucyante mahākāruṇikāḥ | ata evāmantraṇaṃ mahākṛpeti |

ekayā hi prajñāpāramitayā mucyamānāstathā laghulaghveva sarvakleśaprahāṇādarhattvaṃ sākṣātkuryuḥ tataḥ śrāvakabodhimadhigaccheyur na punarbuddhabodhim | mahākāruṇikāstu bodhisattvāḥsattvārthānāṃ paraṃ sādhanamanuttarāṃ bodhimabhilaṣanti na hīnām | tadamī ṣaḍbhireva pāramitābhirmucyante naikayā || 10 ||

yadi tarhi ṣaḍbhireva mucyante kiṃ teṣāṃ pañcabhiḥ kriyate kiṃ ca ṣaṣṭhyā ata āha badhyante ityādi | atra bhāvaśabdena pañca pāramitā ucyante sthāpane prāpaṇe ca tāsāmeva prādhānyāt | bhāva eva bandhaḥ sthāpakatvāditi bhāvabandhena | tena badhyante muktānāmapi teṣāṃ tadbalena niravadhi sarvākārajagadarthakaraṇāya kāyatrayeṇa yāvadākāśamavasthānāt |

tasya bhāvasya parijñā paramārthajñānaṃ tatparijñā | sā ca prajñāpāramitā tayā mucyante | tayaiva savāsanasarvāvaraṇaprahāṇāt saha bījena sarvasāṅkleśikadharmaparikṣayāt | evameṣāṃ nirvāṇamapratiṣṭhitanirvāṇamucyate saṃsāranirvāṇayorapratiṣṭhānāt |

upasaṃharannāha bhāvamityādi | bhāvam iti pañcapāramitāmayaṃ kuśalam | bhāvyam iti svacittasantatau prayatnādutpādya bhāvanābalena sātmīkarttavyam | abhāvaṃ ca parijñayā iti grāhyagrāhakasvabhāvābhyāmabhāvaṃ ca tasya bhāvasya parijñayā prajñāpāramitayā |

yo hi bhāvaṃ na bhāvayati sa mucyamānaḥ śrāvakabodhau patati yastu na parijānāti saṃsāra eva tiṣṭhatītyubhayathā jaḍaḥ syāt | prājñastu bodhisattva ubhayaṃ karoti | ata evāmantraṇaṃ prājña iti | iyatā mahāyāne yat karaṇīyaṃ tat samāsato vyavasthāpitam mahāyānābhisaṃgrahatvānmantranayasya |

tadeva hevajre 'pyatinirdiśannāha tadvad ityādi | herukam iti herukataccihnāsanakūṭāgārādi | pradhānagrahaṇena paricchadasyāpi grahaṇāt | tadyathā

ko 'yaṃ yāti rājeti | atamarthaḥ yāvantaḥ kuśalā dharmā mahāyāne bhāvyante tāvatāmekarasaḥ samyagbodho maṇḍalādhipatiḥ prabhidya samyagbodho maṇḍalam taireva jagadarthakriyā maṇḍalasphuraṇam | trayametadatra kāyatrayasya sukhamāśu ca prāptaye bhāvanīyam | pariśiṣṭaṃ tu kuśalamasyā eva bhāvanāyāḥ sukhamāśu niṣpattaye | sarvañcaitaccittamātratayā yathāpratibhāsamasattayā ca parijñeyam | evamekamupāyatantramutpattikramamāśritya nirdiṣṭaṃ prasādhitaṃ ca || 11 ||

idānīmutpannakramamāśritya dvitīyamupāyatantramākhyātumāha dehasthamityādi | mahacca tat sarvabuddhadharmabījādhāratvāt jñānaṃ ca prakāśanijarūpatvāditi mahājñānam | dehastham iti dehasyādhiṣṭhāyakam tatkarmaphalabhūtānāṃ vedanānāṃ dehāvinirbhāgena saṃvedanādi indriyāṇām ca vedanāśrayāṇāṃ dehāvinirbhāgena vṛtteḥ |

yadyapi tajñānamasmin dehe vyavasthitam tathāpi tanmahājñānam | tathā hi yā tasya dharmatā tathatā tadeva buddhānāṃ gotram | yacca buddhagotraṃ tat sarveṣāṃ buddhadharmāṇāṃ gotram | tena ca dharmatāśarīreṇa tajñānaṃ prakṛtinirmalam tataśca sarvasaṃkalpavarjitam | pratiṣṭhādehabhogādinirbhāsānāṃ sarvavikalpamalānāmatanmayatvena tatrāgantukatvāt abhratamastuhinādimalānāmiva nabhastale | ata eva ca dharmakāyaḥ prakṛtinityatayā nitya ucyate | yathā hi buddhānāṃ dharmadhāturanādinidhanastathāgatasya śuddhirapi sarvabuddhaguṇabījabhājanatā'pi | hevajra iti prakṛtam | tadeva mahājñānaṃ hevajraḥ |

vyāpakaḥ sarvavastūnām iti madīye vijñāne sarvavastūnāṃ prakhyānāt | dehastho 'pi na dehaja iti | kasmānna dehajaḥ jñānabāhyasya dehasyābhāvāt jñānākāradehasyāpyalīkatvāt asataśca janakatvāyogāt | arthāduktaṃ bhavati vyāpako 'pi na sarvavastuja iti dvayasaṅgṛhītānāṃ sarvavastūnāmabhāvāt tattatpratibhāsānāmapyalīkatvāt |

dehādipratibhāsāni jñānānyeva vastuto dehādivastūni teṣāmayaṃ hetuphalabhāvo loke śātre ca prasiddhaḥ | uktaṃ cāryalaṅkāvatāre 
hetupratyayavyāvṛttiṃ kāraṇasya niṣedhanam |
cittamātravyavasthānamanutpādaṃ vadāmyaham || iti 
