nāgārjunapādairapyuktam 
dharmo notpadyate kaścinnāpi kaścinnirudhyate |
utpadyante nirudhyante pratyayā eva kevalāḥ || iti 
cittamātraṃ vijñaptimātram | dharma iti vijñaptibāhyo 'rthaḥ | pratyayā eveti arthākāravijñaptaya eva | nāgārjunapādamate jñānākāra eva jñānamiti cet na te hyāhuḥ 
mahābhūtādi vijñāne proktaṃ samavarudhyate |
tajñāne vigamaṃ yāti nanu mithyā vikalpitam || iti 
