atra hi yathā prathamayoginī nairātmyā tisro nāḍikāstathā'nyayoginī khecarī tisro nāḍikā ityarthāduktaṃ bhavati anyathā tu nāḍīdvayasya yoginībhiḥ saṅgraho na syāt iṣṭaśca dvātriṃśad bodhicittāvahā iti vacanāt | yoginītantreṣu hi bodhicittasya dvātriṃśat prabhedāḥ | teṣāṃ mahāsukhacakrameva pratiṣṭhā | tasmāt pratyekameva bodhicittavahā dvātriṃśadeva nāḍyo mahāśukhacakraprabhavāḥ | tāsāṃ tato vahantīnāṃ yeṣu sthāneṣvādhipatyaṃ tāni tāsāṃ sthānāni paṭhyante | yoginīsvabhāvabhedastu tāsāṃ tantrabhedād bhidyate na sarvatantreṣu tulyaḥ pratināḍikāsañcāreṇa ca tāsāṃ parasparānugamo 'pi yathāsthānaṃ karmadarśanād veditavyaḥ | uktaṃ ca sampuṭe 
dvau nāḍī nāḍyau yonimadhye tu vāmadakṣiṇatastathā |
vāme śukraṃ vijānīyād dakṣiṇe raktameva ca || iti || 
sampuṭatantre ṣaṣṭhe prathamaṃ prakaraṇam 
sampuṭe vajraḍāke coktam 
kaṇṭhādārabhya vāmena nāḍī sambhogakāyikī |
nābhimadhye tu viśrāntāpyadhomukhī madāvahā || 
nābherurdhvaṃ tu yā nāḍī vahantyūrdhvamukhī tathā |
kaṇṭhamadhye tu viśrāntā raktā kta vahā prakīrtitā |
madaścandra iti khyāto raktaḥ ktaṃ sūrya iti smṛtaḥ |
etau hi candrasūryau dvau nāḍīdvayaṃ prakīrtitau || iti || 
samputatantre ṣaṣṭhe tṛtīyaṃ prakaraṇam 

uktaṃ ca sampuṭe 
hṛnmadhyagataṃ padmamaṣṭapatraṃ sakarṇikam |
tasya madhyagatā nāḍī tailavahnisvarūpiṇī ||
kadalīpuṣpasaṅkāśā lambamāna tvadhomukhī |
tasya madhye sthito vīraḥ sarṣapasthūlamātrakaḥ || 
hūṃkāro 'nāhataṃ bījaṃ sravattuṣārasannibham |
gatyāgatiṃ karotyeṣa sarvadehe vyavasthitaḥ || 
nābhāvakārarūpeṇa hrasvastu parikīrtitaḥ |
hṛdaye 'pi ca hūṃkāro dīrghamātrādvayasthitaḥ |
kaṇṭhe coṃkārarūpeṇa trimātraḥpluta ucyate || 
lalāṭe tu haṃkāro 'sau nādo binduranāhataḥ |
śrīvajrasattvarūpeṇa krīḍatīha yathāsukham || 
dalānāṃ ca catuṣke 'pi caturdikṣu vyavasthitāḥ |
catasro bhūtanāḍyastu tailavahnisvabhāvataḥ | iti || 
sampuṭatantre ṣaṣṭhe dvitīyaṃ prakaraṇam

tadasya tantratrayasya nāḍīnirdeśe kathamekavākyatā yad yatra noktaṃ tasya tatrānyataḥ siddheḥ | tasmādayamatra bhāvārthaḥ lalanārasane eva kaṇṭhādārabhya yāvannābhiratrāntare vāmetarapārśvanāḍyau candrasūryākhye nābheradhaste eva yonināḍyau lalanārasanākhye eva | hṛdayanāḍyastu pañca trivṛttā kāminī gehā caṇḍikā māradārikā yadapi sampuṭe paṭhyate 
śatamekaṃ dvidaśādhikaṃ catuścakraprabhedataḥ |
bodhicittasvarūpeṇa nāḍyo dvātriṃśaduttamāḥ || iti || 
sampuṭatantre prathame dvitīyaṃ prakaraṇam 
tenāpi na kaścid virodhaḥ saṃlakṣyate | na hi tatra padmadalāśrayasaṃkhyayā tā vivakṣitāḥ padmadalāśrayasaṃkhyayeti vacanābhāvāt hṛtpadmamadhye ca nāḍīpāṭhāt | tatra lalanaivākṣobhyaṃ vahati rasanaiva raktaṃ prādhānyena vahati | ata evāha tāsāṃ madhye ityādi || 13 ||

prajñāsvabhāvena iti prādhānyena candravahatvāt | upāyeneti upāyasvabhāvena raktavahatvāt | avadhūtī grāhyagrāhakavarjitā iti avadhūtavikalpatvād avadhūtī advayabodhicittamātravahatvād grāhyagrāhakavarjitā | madhyadeśe tviti saṃsthiteti vartate |

kaḥ punaratra madhyadeśaḥ śiraḥkaṇṭhahṛnnābhiyonimadhyam | idamiha pradhānanāḍītrayaṃ nairātmyayoginī | antimaṃ gehādināḍītrayaṃ khecarī | śeṣāṇi trayodaśanāḍīyugalāni gauryādiyoginyaḥ | tatra yā nāḍī yaṃ prasūte puṣṇāti gacchati vā sā tadvahā yathāyogam || 14 ||

abhedyā śirasi sthitā nakhadantavahā sūkṣmarūpā śikhāyāṃ keśaromavahā divyā dakṣiṇakarṇe tvaṅmalavahā vāmā pṛṣṭhavaṃśe piśitavahā vāmanī vāmakarṇe snāyuvahā kūrmajā bhrūmadhye asthimālāvahā bhāvakī cakṣuṣorvukkavahā sekā bāhumūle hṛdayavahā doṣā iti doṣāvatī kakṣayoścakṣurvahā viṣṭā iti mahāviṣṭā stanayoḥ pittavahā mātarā nābhau phuṣphusavahā || 16 ||

śarvarī nāsāgre antramālāvahā śītadā mukhe pārśvatantuvahā ūṣmā kaṇṭhe udaravahā lalanā avadhūtī rasanā iti imāstisraḥ prāgeva vyākhyātāḥ pravaṇā hṛdaye viṣṭāvahā hṛṣṭā iti hṛṣṭavadanā sā liṅge sīmāntamadhyagā svarūpiṇī meḍhre śleṣmavahā sāmānyā gude pūyavahā hetudāyikā ūrvoḥ śoṇitavahā || 17 ||

viyogā jaṅghayoḥ prasvedavahā premaṇī pādāṅgulīṣu medāvahā siddhā pādapṛṣṭhe 'śruvahā pāvakī aṅguṣeṭhe kheṭavahā sumanā jānudvaye bālasiṅghāṇakāvahā | hṛtkamalasya karṇikādigdaleṣu yathākramam 
trivṛttākāminīgehācaṇḍikāmāradārikāḥ || 18 ||

etā dvātriṃśannāḍyo bhagavan kīdṛśāḥ iti praśnaḥ | pṛcchataścāyamabhiprāyaḥ yadi nāḍyo lokaprasiddhena rūpeṇa bhāvyeran tadā tadbhāvanaṃ kuśalamātramapi na syāt kiṃ punarbodhimārgo bhaviṣyati athādvayaprakāśarūpeṇa bhāvyeran tadāpi sambhogakāyalakṣaṇaṃ yoginīmaṇḍalaṃ naiva bhāvitaṃ syāditi || 19 ||

ata āha tribhavapariṇatā iti | sarvabuddhadharmāṇāmekarasaḥ svabhāvo dharmakāyastribhavaḥ tasmin pariṇatā antargatāḥ | sarvā iti sarvanāḍyaḥ yasmād grāhyagrāhakavarjitāḥ advayaprakāśarūpā ityarthaḥ | athavā iti vāśabdaścārthe tathāpi satītyarthaḥ |
bhāvalakṣaṇaṃ lokaprasiddhaṃ nāḍīrūpaṃ tena kalpitā mudritā apyetāḥ sarvatathāgataiḥ | kena tattvena sarvopāyena sarvākārajagadarthahetavaḥ sambhogakāyaprapañcitā buddhadharmāḥ sarvopāyaḥ tena tattvena | yadeva hi tattvaṃ yoginīnāṃ tadeva nāḍīnām ataśca nāḍīcakramevātra yoginīmaṇḍalamiti prasādhitametat | tadeva svadehasthameva mahājñānaṃ hevajraḥ | svadehanāḍīcakrameva tasya yoginīmaṇḍalamiti || 20 ||

paramagambhīra utpannakrama uktaḥ | idānīṃ nātigambhīramutpannakramaṃ bahuprakāramākhyātumāha saṃvarabheda ityādi | bāhyānāṃ dharmāṇāṃ rūpāntaramadhyātmagataṃ yad yogī paśyenniścinuyād vā tatteṣāṃ saṃvaraṃ kāyena saṃvṛtatvāt saṃkṣepavaratvād vā tasya bhedo 'nekaprakāraḥ |

ālikālicandrasūryaprajñopāyeti paṅcadaśa svarāḥ āliḥ catustriṃśad vyañjanāni kāliḥ | iha tu tatsaṅgrāhakā vakārahūṃkārau nābhihṛdayasthau maṇīśikharaṃ gatau yathākramamālikālī | tāveva candrasūryau prajñopāyau nairātmyāherukasvabhāvau tāveva bolāgrasaṅgatau hevajrayogināṃ samayamahāmudre prakṛṣṭe na dehadvayamityarthaḥ |

dharmasambhoganirmāṇeti dharmacakraṃ sambhogacakraṃ nirmāṇacakraṃ ca kāyavākcittamiti | tānyeva trīṇi cakrāṇi yathākramaṃ sarvabuddhānāṃ cittavākkāyaguhyarūpāṇītyarthaḥ | teṣāmeva trayāṇāṃ tathāgataguhyānāṃ niruttarasukhaikarasatvena parijñānaṃ mahāsukhacakraṃ caturtham |

atha tāni katameṣu dehasthāneṣu draṣṭavyāni yathākramaṃ hṛtkaṇṭhayoniśirassu | vakṣyati hi sarvatantramudraṇapiṇḍārthapaṭale 
yoginyā dehamadhyasthamaṃkārasaṃvaraṃ sthitam |
tathā bāhyaṃ tathādhyātmaṃ saṃvaraṃ samprakāśitam ||
bolasaukhyaṃ mahāmudrā vajrāyatanamupāyakam |
anayā guhyasamāpattyā bāhyadvandvaṃ vidarśitam || 
trikāyaṃ dehamadhye tu cakrarūpeṇa kathyate |
trikāyasya parijñānaṃ cakraṃ mahāsukhaṃ matam ||
dharmasambhoganirmāṇaṃ mahāsukhaṃ tathaiva ca |
yonihṛtkaṇṭhamasteṣu trayaḥ kāyā vyavasthitāḥ || iti || 
