atra ca trayaḥ kāyā ityasyānantaraṃ saparijñānā ityadhyāhāryam |
athaitāni cakrāṇi kiṃ svabhāvānītyāha evaṃ mayā iti nirmāṇadharmasambhogamahāsukhacakrāṇi yathākramameva mayāsvabhāvāni locanādicaturdevīsvabhāvānītyarthaḥ || 21 ||

ata evāha ekāreṇa ityādi || 22 || 
kimākārāṇi tānītyāha nirmāṇetyādi | prathamārthe saptamī catuḥṣaṣṭidalaṃ padmaṃ nirmāṇacakramityarthaḥ | evamuttaratrāpi | aṣṭeti aṣṭadalam ṣoḍaśeti ṣoḍaśadalam dvātriṃśaditi dvātriṃśaddalam | athaiṣāṃ padmānāṃ madhye katamā devatā draṣṭavyāḥ akārahūṃkārapraṇavahaṃkārā yathākramam |

tatra mahāsukhapadmamadhomukhaṃ haṃkāro 'pi tanmadhye gato 'dhomukhaḥ kṣaradamṛtadravaḥ | cakretyādi cakrāṇāṃ saṃkhyākramaścakrasaṃkhyākramaḥ tena vyavasthāpanam keṣām anantaravaktavyānāṃ kṣaṇādicatuṣkāṇām | saṃkhyāgrahaṇaṃ kim gaṇanākrameṇa vyavasthā nāvaśyaṃ kramāntareṇeti khyāpanārtham || 23 ||

tatra vicitrādikṣaṇānāṃ lakṣaṇaṃ dvitīyasya kalpasya tṛtīyapaṭale || 24 ||

caturāryasatyeiti caturāryasatyaviṣayaṃ yoginaḥ karma | tadevāha duḥkhetyādinā duḥkhaparijñānaṃ samudayaprahāṇaṃ nirodhasākṣātkriyā mārgabhāvanā cetyarthaḥ || 26 ||

ātmatattvetyādi | ātmaiva tattvaṃ vijñaptimātratā devataiva tattvaṃ hevajrādi mantra eva tattvam akārādi jñānameva tattvaṃ niṣprapañcamanuttarasukhajñānam || 27 ||

caturṇāmānandānāṃ lakṣaṇamaṣṭame daśame ca paṭale || 28 ||

nikāyā iti bhikṣusaṃghāḥ | vakṣyati hi dvitīyakalpasya caturthe paṭale 
sthāvarī nirmāṇacakre tu nirmāṇaṃ sthāvaraṃ yataḥ |
sarvāstivādo dharmacakre dharmo vādasamudbhavaḥ |
saṃvidī sambhogacakre ca kaṇṭhe saṃvedanaṃ yataḥ |
mahāsaṃghī sukhacakre ca mahāsukhaṃ ke sthitaṃ yataḥ || iti || 
