iṭa kiṭa iti dhāturgatyarthaḥ | tāṃ tāṃ gatiṃ gacchantīti kiṭayaḥ sarvasattvāḥ | teṣāṃ kiṭiḥ gatiḥ śaraṇam | kiṭikiṭiścāsau sarvānugrāhakatvād vajraśca duṣṭanigrāhakatvāditi kiṭikiṭivajraḥ || 9 || 
