ete ca stambhanādayo japahomamantratantrādiprayogairyathāyogaṃ karttavyāḥ | te ca prayogāḥ śrīsamājaśrīvajraḍākādiṣu draṣṭavyāḥ | yogapradhānamidaṃ tantram nātra karmaprasarasya vistaraḥ | tantrāntarasulabhatvādasmābhirapīha nākhyāta iti || 19 ||

āḥ phuḥ kāram iti etadevākṣaradvayaṃ manasā'bhilikhya tatpariṇāmatvena bhāvitāṃ mṛttikāmityarthaḥ | anantapratikṛtiṃ kṛtvā iti tāmeva mṛttikāmanantasya nāgarājasya pratikṛtiṃ kṛtvetyarthaḥ | pūrayed anantam veṣṭayet śarāvasampuṭam puṣkariṇīṃ kṛtvā iti khanitvā jalena ca pūrayitvā sthāpayed iti | kva tasya eva jalamadhye | 
anantākrāntam iti ananta ākrānto yena sa tathoktaḥ | adhyātmaṃ sadarthaṃ krūraṃ baddhakrodhaṃ cetaścittaṃ tena om ityādi | 
