mahāpaṇḍitācāryaratnākaraśāntikṛtāyāṃ muktāvalyāṃ hevajrapañjikāyāṃ mantrapaṭalo dvitīyaḥ ||

devatāpaṭalaḥ tṛtīyaḥ

devatāpaṭalamiti hevajro vajrayoginyaśca devatāḥ tāsāṃ paṭalaḥ | tāsāmiti kutaḥ hevajrasyotpattikayogānāṃ yathottaravistīrṇānāmiha sākṣādākhyānāt taireva devīyogānāmapi sāmyataḥ sūcanāt | tatra hevajrasyādyaṃ yogamadhikṛtyāha prathamamityādi | karuṇādyapekṣyaṃ prathamatvam |

sarvaprathamaṃ tu sthānātmayogarakṣāṃ kṛtvā devagṛhaṃ praviśya sukhāsane niṣadya paṭādigatamūrtiṃ bhagavantamagrataḥ kṛtvā tamabhyarcya arghyaṃ parijapya paryaṅkamābhujya smṛtimupasthāpya pāpadeśanāṃ puṇyānumodanāṃ triśaraṇāgamanaṃ ca kṛtvā bodhau citamutpādya tataḥ prathamaṃ bhāvayenmaitrīṃ sarvasattveṣu divyasukhopasaṃhārākārāṃ maitrīm prathame kṣaṇe bhāvayet | dvitīye kṣaṇe karuṇāṃ vibhāvayet | teṣveva sarvaduḥkhāpahārākārām | tṛtīye bhāvayenmuditāṃ teṣveva yathopasaṃhṛtasya sukhasya yāvatsaṃsāramavasthāpanākārām | upekṣāṃ sarvaśeṣataḥ teṣveva kleśādi sarvākuśalapakṣakṣayāya pāralaukikalokottarāśeṣakuśalapakṣopasaṃhārākārām | bhāvayed iti vartate |

evametāni catvāryapramāṇāni bhāvayet | kimartham bodhicittādisarvakuśalamūlopastambhārtham vyāpādavihiṃsādīnām anavakāśārtham duḥkhadurgatimārebhyo hīnayānāccātmano rakṣārtham | ayamādyasya yogasya parikaraḥ sarvayogasādhāraṇaḥ | ādyasya yogasya śarīraṃ vajracatuṣkam tadāha tasmādityādinā || 1 ||

tasmāt punarapīti | tato 'pi paścād bhāvayed iti vartate | kiṃ bhāvayed ityāha śūnyatābodhim ityādi | vijñaptimātraśarīraṃ viśvam tasya dvayena grāhyagrāhakeṇa rahitatvaṃ śūnyatā tasya bodhirabhrāntaṃ darśanaṃ śunyatābodhistāṃ bhāvayet | kathaṃ bhāvayet nātra kiñcid grāhyaṃ vā grāhakaṃ vā vicārāsahatvāt | kevalamasati dvaye dvayapratibhāsatvād bhrāntaṃ cittameva mamedaṃ viśvapratibhāsamutpadyate svapnādivaditi vicintya bhrāntinimittaṃ dvayapratibhāsamapanīya tadviśvapratibhāsaṃ svacittameva śuddhasphaṭikasaṃkāśaṃ prakāśamātramanantamadvayaṃ paśyet |

dvitīyaṃ bījasaṅgrahamiti | tadeva svacittamanantamadvayaṃ svahṛdaye saṃhṛtya bālārkamaṇḍalībhūtaṃ dṛṣṭvā tadupari saparaṃ ṣaṣṭhasvarārūḍhamindubinduvibhūṣitaṃ jvalatkiraṇamālibījākṣaraṃ dhyātvā tasmād bījād vajrāgauryādiyoginīranantāḥ sphārayitvā tāsāṃ tasminneva bīje saṃhāro bījasaṃgrahaḥ taṃ bhāvayet |

tṛtīyaṃ bimbaniṣpattimiti | tena bījena hevajrarūpasya svadehasya bṛhatkamalakarṇikāvasthitaśavahṛtsūryārūḍhasya sūryaprabhāmaṇḍalino niṣpattirbimbaniṣpattistāṃ bhāvayet |

caturthaṃ nyāsamakṣaramiti | tataḥ svahṛdi sūryamaṇḍalaṃ dṛṣṭvā tadupari nyastaṃ bījākṣaram  hṛtsūryārūḍhabījākṣarākāreṇa svadevatācittarūpeṇa niṣpannaṃ svacittaṃ bhāvayedityarthaḥ | atra ca dvitīyamitādi kriyāviśeṣaṇam || 2 ||

dvitīyaṃ yogamadhikṛtyāha repheṇetyādi | atra śūnyatābodhiparyantaḥ parikaraḥ pūrvavat | adhikaṃ repheṇetyādinā ślokadvayenāha | tatra maitryādibhāvanaṃ prathamā rakṣā | śūnyatābodhirdvitīyā | tṛtīyāṃ rakṣāṃ rephādiślokenāha | 
asyāyamarthaḥ purastādagnivarṇena repheṇa sūryaṃ maṇḍalaṃ dhyātvā tanmadhye hūṃkāreṇa viśvavajraṃ vicintya tatkiraṇasūkṣmavajraiḥ sphuradbhiścaturdigantairatyantaṃ ghanībhāvāt prākāraṃ bhāvayet | uparigataiḥ prākāraśikharodgataṃ pañjaram | tābhyāmapi sphuradbhiḥ sīmābandhaṃ cakārādadhogatairvajramayīṃ bhūmimārasātalāt | raviviśvavajrābhyāṃ ca raśmībhūya samantataḥ prasṛtābhyāṃ tatsarvaṃ dṛḍhīkuryāditi || 3 ||

tataḥ kiṃ kuryād ityāha prathamamitādi | prathamamiti yogaśarīrāt pūrvamityarhaḥ | mṛtakaṃ bhāvayediti | prākāracatuṣṭayamadhye vajramayamahīpṛṣṭhābhyudgatavistīrṇāṣṭadalakamalakarṇikāyāṃ śavaśarīraṃ dhyāyādityarthaḥ | kasmādasau bhagavata ādhāra ityata āha dharmadhātvātmakaṃ viduriti | mṛtako hi nirātmakaḥ nairātmyaṃ ca dharmadhātuḥ dharmadhātvālambanaṃ ca bodhicittam bodhicittasvabhāvaśca bhagavān | tasmādasau bhagavata ādhāra iti bhāvaḥ | upari sthitveti sthitamātmānamadhimucya | tathādhimokṣasya mahābodhicittarūpatvāt | iti yogaparikaraḥ | yogaśarīraṃ sūryavajrakramaḥ tameva prastauti herukatvamityādinā herukatvamātmanaḥ || 4 ||

tatkathaṃ bhāvayedityāha
svahṛdityādi | hūṃ kṛtimiti | hūṃkāraṃ prajñopāyasvabhāvakamiti śūnyatākaruṇābhinnabodhicittasvabhāvatvāttasya || 5 ||

vajrasambhavamiti vajrasyotpattim | varaṭako madhyayolakaḥ | hūṃkāraeva tattvaṃ hūṃtattvam || 6 || 
hūṃkārasya pariṇataṃ pariṇāmam | vajrajanmamiti hevajram | dṛṣṭvā vibhāvayediti prathamacittakṣaṇena dṛṣṭvā uttarottarakṣaṇairbhāvayet | dveṣātmānamiti duṣṭānāṃ doṣakṣayāya kṛtrimakrodharasam | ata eva mahākṛṣṇam antantakṛṣṇam | paṅkajamutpalam | 
nīlāruṇābhamiti nīlamaruṇacchāyaṃ mahākaruṇārāgasaṃsūcanārtham | śraddhayeti rucyā | yadi nīle rucirnīlameva bhāvayed atha nīlāruṇo tadā tameva || 7 ||

tṛtīyayogamadhikṛtyāha vyomnītyādi | yathā dvitīye parikarastathā tṛtīye | adhikastvārambhe taṃ vyomnītyādinā sārddhaślokatrayeṇāha | 
dhyānagṛhaṃ praviśya puṣpādipūjāṃ bhagavataḥ kṛtvā'kṛtvā vā paryaṅkamābhujya samāhitena manasā bhagavantamākāśe dṛṣṭvā pūjayed aṣṭadevībhiḥ || 8 ||

mṛgalācchanaḥ śaśī | mārtaṇḍo 'ruṇaḥ | vajro vairocanaḥ | raso madhu | ḍombyeti ḍombyā ca pūjyate | katham āliṅgitakandharam āśliṣṭakaṇṭhaṃ yathā bhavati | evaṃ bhagavataḥ pūjāṃ kṛtvā pāpadeśanādikaṃ sarvaṃ mṛtakāsanasthātmādhimokṣaparyantaṃ yogaparikaraṃ dvitīyayogavat kuryāt || 9 10 ||

yogaśarīraṃ pañcākārābhisambodhiḥ tānāha candrālītyādinā | āliḥ paṅktiḥ akārapramukhā āliḥ ālireva | kakārapramukhā āliḥ kāliḥ śavahṛtsūryamadhye akārādipañcadaśasvarapaṅktiṃ maṇḍalībhūtāṃ kiraṇamālinīṃ dṛṣṭvā tāṃ śaratpūrṇacandrarūpeṇa pariṇatāṃ paśyet | sā candrabhūtā āliścandrālīti ādarśajñānam tadupari kakārādicatustriṃśadvyañjanapaṅktiṃ tathaiva dṛṣṭvā sūryamaṇḍalākārapariṇatāṃ paśyet | asau kālipariṇāmo mārtaṇḍaḥ | kālimārtaṇḍeti samatājñānam | bījaṃ madhyagataṃ bhavediti mārtaṇḍamadhyāvasthitatvānmadhyam mārtaṇḍaparijātena bījena janitaṃ nīlavajram tasmin gataṃ sthitaṃ tad varaṭakamadhyasthamityarthaḥ | īdṛśaṃ bījaṃ hūṃkārākāraṃ cittaṃ bhaved utpadyeta | sa eva sattvamityāhuḥ | tadeva bījaṃ tathotpannaṃ vajrasattvamāhuḥ | kīdṛśam paramānandasvabhāvakaṃ prajñopāyasvabhāvayoścandrālikālimārtaṇḍayoḥ saṃyogajam | prayogamaulapṛṣṭhabhedāttrividhamahāsukhasvabhāvamiti pratyavekṣaṇājñānam || 11 ||

visphurantīti tata eva bījād viśvataḥ sphuranti svadehābhā iti hevajradehasannibhāḥ tadvannīlavarṇāḥ krodharasāḥ pañcadaśayoginīrūpasaṃkṣiptāḥ sarvajagadvinayanopāyabhūtāḥ sarvamantradevatādehāḥ | gaganamaṇḍalacchādakāḥ saṃhāryānayed hṛdaye iti | tāneva sarvadevatādehān saṃhṛtya tasminneva bīje praveśayet | itīdaṃ sarvamantrairekībhūtaṃ svabījaṃ kṛtyānuṣṭhānajñānam | tataḥ sa yogī dveṣātmako bhavet candrasūryavajrabījapariṇāmena hevajrarūpo bhavet || 12 ||

vakṣyamāṇavarṇākāraveṣarasacihnādiriti suviśuddhadharmadhātujñānam āśrayaparāvṛttiviśeṣarūpāyā mahābodheradhigamaḥ | evamebhirādarśādijñānaiḥ pañcabhirabhisambodhiḥ pañcākārābhisambodhiḥ | tathā'ṣṭame vakṣyati 
ādarśajñānavāṃścandraḥ samatā saptasaptikaḥ || 
bījena cihnaṃ svadevasya pratyavekṣaṇamucyate |
sarvairekamanuṣṭhānaṃ niṣpattiḥ śuddhadharmatā || 
ākārān bhāvayet pañcavidhānaiḥ kathitairbudhaḥ || iti || 
he ta 1|8|67
dveṣātmako bhavedityuktam | dveṣo hevajraḥ ||

kīdṛśaḥ nīlāruṇābhavarṇena mahākṛṣṇo veti viśeṣaḥ | bandhūkamiva raktaṃ yannetraṃ tad raktabandhūkanetram tadvān | piṅgānyūrdhvakeśavartmānyasyeti tathoktaḥ | mudrairiti ābharaṇamudrābhiḥ || 13 ||

cakrītyādi | caturbhyaḥ sorluk | vajrāṅkitaṃ kapālaṃ vajrakapālam dadhāna iti śeṣaḥ | uccāraṇātmaka iti uccāraṇaśīlaḥ | ete traya ekavīrayogāḥ | 14~15 |

caturthaṃ yogamadhikṛtyāha śmaśāna ityādi | pañcāvasthā yogasya śamathaḥ vipaśyanā ubhayam ubhayābhyāsa ubhayābhiratiśca pañcamī | tasyā abhiratermudrā krīḍā na vikṣepaḥ | ata āha krīḍata iti | aṣṭau yoginyo gauryādayaḥ | yathā tṛtīye yoge parikarastathā caturthe 'pi | yogaśarīraṃ tu catuṣprākārābhyantare aṣṭau śmaśānāni | digvidikṣu vicintya teṣāṃ madhye vakṣyamāṇaṃ dvipuṭamādhāramaṇḍalaṃ vibhāvya tanmadhye śrīherukasya yathaiva ṣoḍaśabhujasya samādhitrayaṃ vakṣyati tathaiva hi dvibhujasya bhāvayet | tadayamaṣṭayoginīparivṛtasya bhagavataścaturtho yogo naikavīrasya |

kasmāt punaḥ śmaśāne krīḍata ityāha śvasatītyādi | padeṣu padaikadeśā vartante tadyathā bhīmo bhīmasenaḥ aḥ acyutaḥ uḥ umāpatiḥ evamihāpi śakāraḥ śavavācī | vasantyasyāmiti vasatiḥ śāṃ vasatiḥ śvasatiḥ ityanayā yuktyeti evamanenārthayogena śmaśānetyabhidhīyate śmaśānamityucyate | atra ca śvasatītyanena vigrahārthaḥ ucyamāno vigrahaṃ sūcayati |

ayaṃ tvatra vigrahaḥ vasantyasminniti vasanaṃ nivāsa ityarthaḥ | śavānāṃ vasanaṃ śmaśānamiti pūrvapade 'vabhāgasya matvam uttarapade vasabhāgasya śābhāvaḥ | nairuktena varṇavikāreṇa | kā tatra teṣāṃ vāsakriyā caṅkramaṇasthānaśayananiṣadyāaḥ kabandhodbaddhaśayitaśūlabhinnādīnāṃ yathākramam | yadyapi śvasatītyanayā yuktyā śmaśānaṃ tathāpi kasmāt tatra krīḍati |

ayamabhiprāyaḥ yathā śmaśāne nirātmakāḥ sattvāstathā sarvatreti | nirātmakasarvasattvāvāsamudrā śmaśānam | sattvāḥ sattvasvabhāvena śūnyāḥ sattvāvāsā api sattvāvāsasvabhāvena śūnyā iti śmaśānārthaḥ | atastasminnevālambane nirālambanamahākṛpāamahāprajñātmakamahābodhicittamahāmudrāsvabhāvasya bhagavataḥ krīḍā yujyata iti | evaṃ tāvad dvibhujasya hevajrasya catvāro yogā uktāḥ | yathā ca dvibhujasya catvārastathā caturbhujaṣaḍbhujaṣoḍaśabhujānām evaṃ nairātmyāyāḥ | śeṣayoginīnāṃ caturdaśānāṃ pratyekaṃ trayo yogāḥ caturthābhāvāt | sarvaikatvena dvāṣaṣṭiyogāḥ || 16 ||

caturbhujasya hevajrasya viśeṣaṃ vaktumāha caturbhuja ityādi | itaḥ prabhṛti sādhye yastaṃ bhāvayet | tasyeti padatrayaṃ yathāyogamadhyāhāryam | caturṇāṃ mārāṇāṃ bhagavatā nirjayo nirjitam tadeva viśuddhistattvam tayā viśuddhyā tena tattvena caturbhujaḥ pūrvoktarūpavarṇaścāsau hūṃbhavaśca || 17 ||

ṣadbhujasya viśeṣamāha ṣaḍbhujamityādi | pāramitāviśuddhiriti ṣaṭ pāramitāstattvamityarthaḥ | ghaṇṭeti vajraghaṇṭā samāpattyeti sthitaḥ sa iti śeṣaḥ | savyāpasavye karttīkapālamiti | hevajrāliṅginīnāṃ prajñānām | dvibhujasya ḍombī prajñā | tadāliṅgitatvenaiva tasya prāgabhidhānādityeke | vayaṃ punarbrūmaḥ iha tantre pūjādevyeva ḍombī mahāmahiṣī tu dvibhujasyāpi nairātmyā | utsargapaṭale ṣoḍaśe tasyā evaṃ virdeśāt | dvibhuje tu tasyā apavādāvacanāt | nairātmyena traidhātukamudrako mṛtakaḥ traidhātukamṛtakaḥ sa ākrānto 'neneti traidhātukamṛtakākrāntaḥ sa bhagavāniti |

mahāpaṇḍitācāryaratnākaraśāntikṛtāyāṃ muktāvalyāṃ hevajrapañjikāyāṃ devatāpaṭalastṛtīyaḥ |

devatābhiṣekapaṭalaḥ caturthaḥ

devatābhiṣekapaṭalamiti pūrvoktānāṃ kramāṇāmanyatamena niṣpādito hevajrādirdevatā | tasyā abhiṣeko jñānāmbubhiḥ savāsanasarvāvaraṇamalakṣālanam | tadyotakaḥ paṭalaḥ |

svahṛdi bījād iti devatārūpaniṣpāditasyātmano hṛdaye yad bījaṃ sūryastham sūryavajrasthaṃ vā candrasthaṃ candracihnasthaṃ vā yathāyogam | kṛṣṇadīptamiti hevajrapakṣe devīnāṃ yathāyogam | aṣṭamātṛbhiḥ iti gauryādibhiḥ | saṃpūjya ityākāśasthāne ca tān buddhān pūjayitvā | anunāyyataṃ iti teṣāmadhyeṣaṇaṃ kriyate | tadevāha abhiṣiñcantu mām ityādi || 1 ||

hevajrarūpaiḥ iti herukarūpāpannaiḥ | abhiṣicyamāne iti saptamyarthe prathamā | mūrdhāyāṃ svakuleśo bhavatīti mūrdhni akṣobhya utpadyate | abhiṣeko niṣpatteḥ paryantaḥ | 
tenāha etena ityādi | trisandhyā iti samdhyātraye | adhiṣṭhānabhāvanām iti prabhātasamdhyāyāmutpattikramaniṣpannaṃ madhyāhnasāyāhnasandhyayorjhaṭiti niṣpannaṃ hevajramātmānamadhyālambya tasyābhiṣekabhāvanādhiṣṭhānabhāvanā | tāṃ kṛtveyi uttiṣṭhet | utthāya kiṃ karttavyam ityāha devatetyādi | devatā svadevatā saiva mūrtiḥ tayā pratikṣaṇamadhimucyamānayā || 2 3 ||

mahāpaṇḍitācāryaratnākāśāntikṛtāyāṃ muktāvalyāṃ hevajrapañjikāyāṃ divatābhiṣekapaṭalaścaturthaḥ |

tattvapaṭalaḥ pañcamaḥ

uktau dvau devatāyogau samāhitaḥ sandhyāsu asamāhitaḥ sandhyāntarāleṣu tattvayogo vaktavyaḥ | yatastribhirvinā nāsti śīghrataraṃ bodhiḥ ata āha tattvetyādi | tattvasya dyotakaḥ paṭalastattvapaṭalaḥ | rūpaṃ nīlapītādi tannāsti na didyate | kathaṃ nāsti svarūpeana | yadasya svarūpaṃ bālaiḥ kalpyate darśanagrāhyavastubhūtaṃ tena nāsti ekānekasvabhāvavirahāt | kevalaṃ bhrāntā buddhirbālānāṃ asataiva tena tenākāreṇa khyāti svapnādāviva rūpābhāve na kaścid rūpaṃ paśyatīti draṣṭā'pi nāsti tenāha

na draṣṭā ca iti | na draṣṭetyarthaḥ | draṣṭā cakṣurdhātuḥ draṣṭā puruṣaḥ dvāvapi svarūpeṇa na staḥ | yadanayoḥ svarūpaṃ vastugrāhakaṃ vālairvikalpyate tena na staḥ | evaṃ yāvat na sparśo nāpi spraṣṭā ca | iyatā daśāyatanāni rūpacakṣurādīni | draṣṭādirūupaśca pudgalo nāstītyuktam |

na cittam iti | vijñānalakṣaṇaṃ cittam vijānātīti vijñānaṃ ṣaḍ vijñānakāyāḥ cakṣurvijñānadhāturyāvanmanovijñānadhātuḥ | etānyeva samanantarātītāni manodhātuḥ | saptaite vijñānadhātavo mana āyatanam | yaśca ṣaḍvijñānairvijñātā pudgalaḥ so 'pi vijānātīti vijñānam tataḥ so 'pi cittaśabdenoktaḥ | tadubhayaṃ nāsti tayorgrāhakalakṣaṇatvāt | grāhyābhāve ca grāhakāyogāt |

kasmād grāhyaṃ nāsti ekānekasvabhāvavirahāt | siddha eṣa hetuḥ sāvayaveṣu daśasvāyataneṣu niraṃśeṣu ca paramāṇuṣu | paramāṇumātre 'pi sthūlapratibhāsāyogāt | dharmāyatane tu yāni dravyāṇi teṣu niraṃśeṣu pratibhāsamānarūpasyotpatterasiddho hetuḥ tasmānna dharmāyatanaṃ nāstītyata āha

na caittikam iti | cittasya viṣayaścaittikaṃ dharmāyatanam tadapi nāsti | akṣaṇikānāmanyatra nirākṛtatvāt kṣaṇikānāmapi grāhyatvāyogāt atītānāgatānāmasattvena vartamānānāmakāraṇatvenāgrāhyalakṣaṇatvācca viṣayasya | yadi tarhi dvayarūpeṇa na santi dvādaśāyatanāni pudgalaśca | kena rūpeṇa santi dvayapratibhāsinā bhrāntirūpeṇa dravyataḥ santi tena pratītyasamutpannatvāt | yat punareṣāṃ rūpaṃ  dvayaśūnyatā vijñaptimātratā prakāśamātratā sarvatra samarasā tenaite paramārthataḥ santi | taddhi paramārthaḥ paramasya lokottarajñānasyārtho viṣayaḥ | tatra dvayasaṃgṛhītaṃ rūpaṃ nāstīti parijñeyam | tadastitvābhiniveśasyaiva sarvānarthamūlatvāt | dvayapratibhāsi bhrāntirūpaṃ prahātavyam bhrāntiprabhedatvāt sarvānarthānām | dvayaśūnyatārūpaṃ punareṣāṃ pratyakṣīkarttavyam tatpratyakṣasyaiva samyagjñānarūpatvāt tasya c sarvabhrāntipratipakṣatvāt krameṇa mahāsukhamahāmokṣasakalabuddhaguṇavaśitvasādhanatvācca | so 'pi mahāmokṣaḥ paramārthaḥ paramaphalatvāt tadapi samyagjñānaṃ paramārthaḥ paramo 'rtho 'syeti kṛtvā | iyatā tathatātattvamuktam || 1 ||

kulatattvam prastotumāha 
jananītyādi | jananīti hitaiṣiṇī | bhaginīti sthirasnehā | ubhe sattvakulavātsalyāt | naṭīti paṭuḥ prajñā ca | rajakīti śuklakarmaratā | vajrīti dhyānapriyā | caṇḍālīti nihitamānatvāt kṣamāśīlā | brāhmaṇīti avadyabhīruḥ |

prajñetyādi nairātmyādīnāmanyatamā prajñā | upāyo hevajraḥ | anayoreva rūpeṇa vidhiniṣpāditena dehadvayasya darśanaparirambhaprativedhavicāraṇāni prajñopāyavidhānam tena pūjayet | tattvavatsala iti tattvasaṃvedanapriyaḥ san || 2 ||

prayatneneti guptau yatnaḥ prayatnaḥ | tameva āha yathā bhedo na jāyate iti bheda udbhedaḥ svayameva pareṣāṃ yuktibalādabhyūhaḥ mantrabhedaśca bhedaḥ madauddhatyakopādibhiḥ svayaṃ tathā sahāyena vā parasmai kathanaṃ mantrabhedaḥ | aguptau narakapātādiradṛṣṭadoṣaḥ prasiddha eva | dṛṣṭadoṣamapyāha agupte ityādinā vyāḍādibhiḥ duḥkhaṃ kriyata iti sambandhaḥ | vyāḍāḥ sarpavyāghrādayaḥ | bhūcarāḥ śāsakā narapiśācādayaḥ || 3 ||

mudryate yeneti lakṣyate yataḥ | kulaṃ caitaditi vajrapadmādikam || 4  7 ||

tathatāyāṃ gata iti suviśuddhatathataikarase dharmakāye sthitaḥ | śrīmān iti sarvabuddhadharmeśvaraḥ na tu śrāvakādiḥ | āgataśceti tasyā eva tathatāyāḥ sakāśādāgatastanniṣyandābhyāṃ sambhoganirmāṇakāyābhyāṃ jagadarthakaraṇāya | evaṃ tathatāgataśabdayorekaśeṣaḥ | madhyatakārasya nairukto lopaḥ | evaṃ tāvat sarve tathāgatāḥ | teṣāmādarśajñānādīni pañcakulāni || 8 ||

nanu sarvabuddhāḥ pañcajñāninastatkathaṃ kulabhedaḥ gotrabhedāt ādarśādīnāmekaikasya hicchāyo gotramanādisiddhaṃ bodhisattvānām anekasya tucchāyā sattvagotraṃ paṣṭham | ata evāha kulāni ṣaḍvidhānyāhuḥ iti | saṃkṣepeṇa tu pañcadhā iti anekasthā yasyāpyekacchāyā balīyastvāt | trividhamiti traividhyam kāyavākcittabhedanairiti vacanāt | svakāyavākcitteṣu sarvatathāgatakāyavākcittādhimokṣastattvayoga iti gamyata eva || 9 ||

evaṃ pañcakulānyadhikṛtyāha 
kulānāmityādi | pañceti pañcakam svakāye bhūtānāṃ yat pañcakam tat kulānāṃ draṣṭavyam pañcasu bhūteṣvayaṃ kulādhimokṣāt | pañcaskandhasvarūpiṇām iti ātmanaḥ skandhapañcake 'pi kulapañcakādhimokṣāt | kulyate iti asaṃkhyāto buddhabodhisattvānāṃ rāśirekaikena gotreṇa kulyate saṃkhyāyate | tasmāt pañcakulānītyārthaḥ || 10 ||

satyadvayamadhikṛtyāha nāsti ityādi | nāsti bhāvako na bhāvo 'sti iti bhāvanaṃ bhāvaḥ bhāvakaḥ kartā bhāvanā kriyā dvayamidaṃ bhāvanīyāt pṛthag naiva draṣṭavyam | devatāmantrābhyāmanyo nāham bhāvanā 'pi tayoḥ prakāśarūpataiva nānyetyeṣa tattvādhimokṣaḥ karttavya ityarthaḥ | tattvaṃ satyaṃ bhūtamiti paryāyāḥ | atastattvapaṭale satyadvayaṃ vaktavyam |

tatra sarva eṣa vistaraḥ saṃvṛtisatyaṃ paramodāryasādhanamadhikṛtyoktam | paramagāmbhīryasādhanaṃ paramārthasatyamadhikṛtyāha mantram ityādi | tāvapi devatāmantrau paramārthato na staḥ | kutaḥ yathāpratibhāsamasattvāditi bhāvaḥ | paramārthatastarhi kathaṃ tau sta ityāha santiṣṭhete ityādi | prapañcairviparyāso bhrāntirityeko 'rthaḥ | tatra sarvabhrāntīnāmagocaratvād dharmadhāturaprapañcaḥ | tanaiva samyagjñānena sabījasaṃkleśakṣayāt pratiṣṭhādehabhoganirbhāsānāṃ ca vijñaptīnāṃ prahāṇādanāsravo dharmadhāturaprapañcaḥ | trayamidaṃ viśuddhākāśanibhamanantamaprapañcam dharmakāyamityarthaḥ | tadeva svabhāvaḥ tena svabhāvena sākṣātkarttavyāviti bhāvaḥ || 11 ||

tathāhi sa eva vairocanaḥ prakāśamātratayā prakhyānāt sa eva akṣobhyaḥ nirābhāsatvāt sa eva amoghaḥ viśvārthakaraṇāt sa eva ratnaḥ sarvabuddhadharmāṇāṃ lābhāt sa eva ārolikaḥ teṣāmātmani samyak paricchedāt | evaṃ pañcajñānamayatvāt sa eva sāttvikaḥ vajrasattva ityarthaḥ || 12 ||

brahmetyādi | sa eva brahmādirucyate | kathamityāha brahmā ityādi | yata eva suviśuddhabodharūpatvād asau buddhastadeva paraṃ brahma tasmāt sa eva brahmā | nirvṛttitaḥ iti mokṣarūpatvādityarthaḥ | nirvṛtirnirvāṇaṃ mokṣo niḥśreyasaṃ buddha iti paryāyāḥ | viṣaṇād iti tādātmyena praveśāt | kva paramagambhīre dharmakāye | viśateḥ ktapratyayaḥ ṣatvaṇatve ca | sadā sukalyāṇād iti dhruvakalyāṇatvāt paramakalyāṇatvācca | sarvaḥ ityādi | yasmādasau sarveṣāmātmani dharmadhātau vedakatvena sthitastasmāt sarva vaḥ || 13 ||

satsukhatvena iti anāsravadhruvottamasukhatvena | bodhanād rateḥ iti tasyaiva niruttarasya sukhasya vedanād yo hi taṃ na vedayate nidrāṇa evāsau | 
brahmāditvaṃ yaduddiṣṭaṃ tadiyatā nirdiṣṭam | deha ityādinā anyadapyāha sa eva devatā dehasambhavādityarthaḥ | pūrvapade halopaḥ uttarapade sambhalopaḥ | svārthe talā deva eva devatā | dehasambhavatvena sulabhatvamasya sūcayati || 14 ||

buddhaḥ sa iti saṃbuddha ityarthaḥ | aiśvaryādayaśca te guṇāśca akhilā iti samagrāḥ | tathā coktam 
aiśvaryasya samagrasya jñānasya yaśasaḥ śriyaḥ | 
rūpasyārthaprayatnasya ṣaṇṇāṃ bhaga iti smṛtaḥ || iti || se ṭī pṛ 3 
etasmin pakṣe bhagā asya santīti vigrahaḥ kāryaḥ | uktaṃ paramārthasatyam || 15 ||

punarapi saṃvṛtisatyam āśu sambhāropacayārthamāha jananī ityādi | jananyādi śabdaiḥ prajñāmātramuktam nāvaśyaṃ bāhyā viśeṣā iti saṃkṣepaḥ | jagajjanam iti āryalokam anyeṣāṃ niśceṣṭatvāt | vibhāgam iti jñeyanānātvam || 16 ||

rajakī ityādinoddeśaḥ | rañjanād ityādinā nirdeśaḥ | sattvānām iti vijñānām | guṇasya iti satsukhasya | cañcalatvād iti jñeyeśvāśusañcārāt || 17  18 ||

jalpanaṃ japam iti hevajrāhaṅkāriṇo hanmantrodbhavaḥ sa eva jalpo japa iti saṃkṣepaḥ | pādalekhaḥ pādapratibimbaṃ rajaḥpaṅkajalādibhiḥ tanmaṇḍalalikhanamiti mahān saṃkṣepaḥ | malanād iti hevajreṇākramaṇād hevajradhāraṇād vā | mala iti dhāturakāraḥ pratyayo ṇḍāgamaśceti bhāvaḥ || 19 ||

sphoṭo vikāśaḥ | moṭanaṃ saṅkocaḥ | te ubhe mudre | hevajreṇa kṛtatvāditi mahān saṃkṣepaḥ | tad dhyeyamityādi | hevajrāhaṃkāriṇo yā kācit cintā tadeva dhyānamityarthaḥ | yasmāditi dhyai cintāyāmiti dhātupāṭhādityabhiprāyaḥ | ukto mahāmokṣasukhalakṣaṇaḥ paramārtho yaḥ sākṣātkarttavyaḥ | tasya sākṣātkaraṇaṃ bhāvanayā | bhāvanāpariniṣpattiḥ sukhaṃ dhyānam || 20 ||

ato vaktavyaṃ kā tasya bhāvanā kiṃ vā tasya dhyānamityata āha 
pitari ityādi | pitā vajradharo guruśca | pañcamyarthe saptamī | pituḥ sakāśāt prāptaṃ laukikasukhena dṛṣṭāntena pitrā yadupadiṣṭaṃ mahāmokṣasukhamityarthaḥ | anupadiṣṭānāṃ devamanuṣyādīnāṃ śrutirapi tasyā durlabhā kiṃ punaranubhava iti bhāvaḥ ||

tatsukhaṃ bhujyate svayam iti | tadeva nirābhāsamanantaṃ niruttaramakṣayāvyayaṃ mahāmokṣasukhaṃ bhujyate | svayamiti sākṣādiva | kutaḥ bhujyamāne laukikasukhe tadeva yathālakṣaṇamadhimucya tathādhimokṣādālambanīkṛte tasmin ālambanāntarasaṃcāraprasāraniṣedhena niścalasūkṣmīkṛtasya cetasastathaiva nirantaramādareṇa sābhogamanābhogaṃ ca vahanāt | iyatī yattasya bhāvanā |

dhyānamākhyātumāha sukham ityādi | maraṇam ityādi | tathaiva ciraṃ bhāvyamānena mahāsukhena | yena iti yadavasthena iha maraṇaṃ bhavati tad iti tadavasthaṃ tanmahāsukhadhyānamucyate bhāvanāpariniṣpatteḥ |

iha maraṇamiti ko 'rthaḥ iheti tato mahāsukhādanyasmin bahiradhyātmaṃ cālambane maraṇamapratisaṃvedanaṃ bhavati ekadvaubahūn vā praharān divasān māsān varṣān vā daṃśamaśakādikṛtairapi capeṭamuṣṭikaśābhighātairapi paṭupaṭahaśaṃkhabherīmahāmeghasvanairapi tāvantaṃ kālamapratibodhanāditi |

athavā na yuktā sahajā bhāvanā dṛṣṭāntasahajasya pratyakṣatvena dārṣṭāntikasahajasya cānubhūtatvena dhyeyatvāyogāt | ata āha pitarītyādi |

pitari prāptaṃ dṛṣṭāntasahajaṃ bhujyate svayamiti sākṣādanubhūyate | maraṇaṃ mokṣaḥ | yena sukheneti dārṣṭāntikasahajena | iha tatsukhaṃ dhyānamiti | dṛṣṭāntasukhe tādātmyena bhāvyamānaṃ dārṣṭāntikasukhaṃ dhyeyamucyate | anubhūyamānetarayoḥ sādharmyasukhena ekarasībhāvagamanāditi bhāvaḥ |

mahāpaṇḍitācāryaratnākaraśāntikṛtāyāṃ muktāvalyāṃ hevajrapañjikāyāṃ tattvapaṭalaḥ pañcamaḥ ||

caryāpaṭalaḥ ṣaṣṭhaḥ

ubhayatattvayogādapi samayairvinā na śighrataraṃ bodhiḥsyādataścaryāpaṭalamāha ataḥparam ityādinā | sarvabuddhoktā yā duṣkaravratacaraṇaścaryā tāṃ pravakṣyāmi | pāraṅgatām iti lokātikrāntām | varām iti śreṣṭhām apunarāvṛtteḥ | gamyate yena iti yena liṅgena jñāyate | siddhāntam iti yagino duratikramā pratijñā | kimarthaṃ pratijñā hevajrasiddhahetunā hevajratantroktasiddhyarthamityarthaḥ | divyaṃ niraṃśumayatvāt || 1  3 ||

daśārdhāmṛtaṃ pañcāmṛtam | pañcamo varṇo nīcataraḥ || 4 ||

ekavarṇam eva bimbaṃ pañcavarṇasamāyuktaṃ tu bālaiḥ kalpitam | kutaḥ ityāha anekenaiva varṇena yasmād bhedo na lakṣyate iti | bhinnajātīyā hi prāṇino bhinnākṛtayaḥ tadyathā gobhyaḥ karituragavarāhāḥ || sajātīyāstulyākṛtayaḥ tadyathā gāvo gavām kariṇaḥ kariṇām | evaṃ gavādibhyo bhinnākṛtayo varṇāstebhya eva vijātīyāḥ na parasparamākārasāmyāt | tadevamatyantavyaktayā lokasaṃvṛtyāpyekavarṇatā siddhā kiṃ punaryogisaṃvṛtyā | anādimati saṃsāre sarveṣāṃ sarvavarṇatvāt | kaḥ punarvādaḥ paramārthataḥ | tathatā hi sarveṣāṃ paramārthaḥ | sā ca prakṛtyaiva pariśuddhā tāmevādhimucya pañcavarṇavihāraḥ || 5 ||

caryānurūpaṃ sthānamāha ekavṛkṣa ityādinā | avicchinnayogapradhāneyaṃ caryā vijaneṣveva yujyata iti bhāvaḥ || 6 ||

na ceyamauddhatyāt sahasaiva kartavyeti darśayitumāha kiñcid ityādi | yadā kiñcidūṣmā īṣad yogaprabhāvaḥ samyak prāpto bhavati yenāyaṃ yogarucirbhavati na pramattaḥ | sarpavyāḍamanuṣyādayaścāsmai na prabhavanti rakṣanti ca | na cāyaṃ tebhyo bibheti | śītoṣṇakṣutpipāsādibhiśca na khidyate | lobhamohabhayakrodhaiśca na vikriyate tadā caryayā tvanayā cared iti sambandhaḥ | yadīṣyata iti | yadi rucirasti tadā caret anyathā hi paścāttāpe sati yogahāniḥ syāt | siddhiṃ gantum iti | arvāg yogacaryāyā na śauthilyādihaiva janmani hevajratāṃ prāptaḥ yadīdṛśaṃ vīryamastītyarthaḥ || 7 ||

budhyata iti yujyate | tasyāḥ kulātiśayatvāt parairasaṃhāryataratvācceti bhāvaḥ || 8 ||

sveṣṭeti yā sādhyā | anyakulodbhavām iti | sveṣṭadevatāyā anyāyā devatāyā devatā tatkulodbhavām | saṃskṛtām iti samyagabhiṣiktām | tāṃ gṛhya caryā kriyata iti sambandhaḥ || 9 ||

ānandād iti yogajānandād | vajrānvitam iti vajramabhedyatvāt satyadvayaṃ tenānvitaṃ tatsūcakaṃ vajragītamityarthaḥ | vajrapadaiḥ iti tattvadyotinībhiḥ pāṇipādamukhadṛṣṭinarttanamudrābhiḥ || 10 ||

cakrarūpeṇa iti cakrīrupeṇa | haste iti prakoṣṭhagataṃ rucakam | dveṣaviśuddhitaḥ iti hevajrarūpeṇa || 11 12 ||

mantraviśuddhyā iti mantrādhimuktyā | gītā iti gītiḥ | narttanā iti nṛtyam | bhāvanā kṛtā iti bhāvanātvenādhimokṣāt | sadā gītaṃ sadā ca nāṭyamiti saṃbandhaḥ | nityatām iti nityam | mṛtyuriti mṛtyuśca | rakṣābhūtāḥ iti rakṣāprāptāḥ || 13  14 ||

hūṃ bhavo 'kṣobhyaḥ | akṣobhyetyādisvabhāvāni kapālāni buddhakapālāni || 15 ||

kacaḍorī keśaḍorī bhasma iti udvartanabhasma | keśapavitraṃ keśayajñopavītam || 16 ||

lobhamohādīn yogavighnān varjayed | vrīḍā lajjā | nidrā mahān yogavighnaḥ | kāyajīvitāpekṣā'pi yogavighnānāṃ mūlam tenāha nidrām ityādi | ātmānam iti kāyajīvitāpekṣām | na saṃśayaḥ iti nātra saṃśayaḥ karttavyaḥ || 18 ||

śarīraṃ dānaṃ datvā iti ādita eva sarvabuddhebhyaḥ sarvasattvebhyaśca | yata evaṃ tasmāt | siddhau bhāgyābhāgyavicāreṇa na dīyate nirapekṣadānāt || 19 ||

abhivandayati iti vandet | avandyamāno hyavīicau patet | ata evāha avīcyā ityādi tyājyahetuneti parihārārtham || 22 ||

kālabhojanādiḥ śikṣāḥ | śiromuṇḍanādi dīkṣā | sarvabhāvasvabhāvena iti sarvāvasthāsu hevajrādhimokṣeṇa || 23 ||

homeityādi | hevajrādhimokṣa eva dṛḍhaḥ suyogaḥ bāhyahomādivarjitaḥ | kutaḥ yato 'sya hevajrātmanā bhakṣaṇameva homaḥ | pādalekha eva yāgaḥ | sarvaṃ kāyakarma tapaḥ | sarvaṃ vāṅmanasaḥ karma mantradhyāne damarudhvanikhaṭvāṅgadhāraṇe 'pi mantradhyāne vajragītavajranṛtte api mantradhyāne | tathā yadeva karoti sa evāsya samayaḥ yadeva na karoti sa evāsya saṃvaraḥ || 24 ||

hevajrasya satyadvayaṃ karuṇā tasya pānaṃ sānandena tadyogena yogadvayasamutthitāyāḥ prīteḥ pānaṃ yogapānam anyaṃ pānaṃ madirādi | majjanaṃ madaḥ || 26 ||

mahāpaṇḍitācāryaratnākaraśāntikṛtāyāṃ muktavalyāṃ hevajrapañjikāyāṃ caryāpaṭalaḥ ṣaṣṭhaḥ ||

chomapaṭalaḥ saptamaḥ

chommā milicchāyoginīnāṃ saṅketaḥ | sā'pi samayāṅgatvād vijñeyā | ata āha atha chommetyādi | chomādyotakaḥ paṭalastathoktaḥ | mantramudrāsamādhīn mantramudrārthau devatātattvaṃ maṇḍalatattvaṃ ca kathañcidasāmayikāya kathayan mantrī na sidhyati ityupadravanarakapātādibhiśca pīḍyate | ataśchommā tadarthāvapyasāmayikebhyo na sandarśayitavyau |

bhrāteti yogī | bhaginīti yoginī | ekāṅgulim iti svāgatārtham | yaḥ iti liṅgamatantraṃ yetyapi draṣṭavyam | dvābhyām ityaṅgulībhyām || 1  2 ||

pradeśikā tarjanī paṭṭi ṭṭiṃ sandarśayediti | kaniṣṭhānāmike aṅguṣṭhenākramya śeṣāṅgulīdvayena lalāṭopari paṭṭabandhābhinayāt | triśūlam iti kaniṣṭhāmaṅguṣṭhenākramya śeṣābhistriśūlābhinayāt | sīmām iti lalāṭamadhyopari sīmāntaṃ vaktraṃ vivṛtamukham || 3  5 ||

dṛṣṭirlocanam | nanduko yogī | mudrām iti ekāṅgulyādidarśanam | pratimudreṇa iti dvyaṅgulīdarśanādinā | bhedayed iti udghāṭayet | samayena iti saṅketena || 6  7 ||

tatreti mudrābhedane kṛte | keśagarbhāt mālākarṣaṇaṃ mālāhastam tasyā abhimukhapreṣaṇaṃ mālābhipreṣitam ubhayamidaṃ sākṣād abhinayena vā | sarvaṃ caitad vāmahastena darśayed | mālābhipreṣitasyārthamāha samaye ityādi || 8  9 ||

etā dvādaśa iti pīṭhādayaḥ | bhavantyasyāmiti bhūmayaḥ | ke bhavanti | buddhabodhisattvāḥ | pṛthagjanabodhisattvabhūmimekām buddhabhūmiñcaikāṃ vihāya daśabhūmīśvaro bodhisattvaḥ kathyate | nāthaḥ iti buddhaścetyarthaḥ | buddhaścaikādaśabhūmīśvaraḥ kathyata iti sambandhaḥ | katamābhirbhūmibhirityāha ebhiḥ iti pīṭhādibhirbhūmibhirityarthaḥ | adhimukticaryāpramuditāvimalādīnāṃ samantaprabhāsāparyantānāṃ jñānabhūmīnāmeva yathāyogaṃ mudrāpīṭhādaya iti bhāvaḥ | nānyaiḥ iti na pīṭhādivyatiriktābhiḥ mudrātanmudritayorabhedāditi bhāvaḥ || 11 ||

nagaraṃ pāṭaliputram | harikelasya viśeṣaṇam lavaṇetyādi || 13 15 ||

cāmīkarānvitamiti suvarṇadvīpam || 16 ||

tatsanniveśadeśamiti pīlavasaṃniveśam | vāpikā dīrghikā || 17  18 ||

pretapakṣaḥ kṛṣṇapakṣaḥ || 20 ||

dhvajaṃ udvadhaḥ | kṛpāmutpādyeti tasyaivaṃ duḥkhaṃ vicintya | viduriti viduṣā || 21 ||

duṣṭā mantranayavidviṣṭāḥ teṣāmavatāraṇaṃ mantrayāne tannimittaṃ sarvam vidhiriti sarvaṃ kurvanmukhyāditi mukhyavṛttyā | uktā kṛpā || 22 ||

prajñāmapyāha tatretyādinā | mantavyamiti draṣṭavyam | dvāveva kālau tau ca hevajratatprajñe atastābhyāṃ sarvakarmasaṃgrahāt | sarvaṃ karma kuśalam | upāyāntaramapyāha nākāryam ityādinā | atra iti hevajrāhaṅkāre sati || 23  24 ||

yathātmanyadhimokṣastathā sattveṣvapi | tathā iti samuccaye ātmani ca ityarthaḥ ahaṃ param iti ahamasau bhagavān hevajra ityarthaḥ || 25 ||

pade sthita ityahaṅkāre dṛḍhe || 26 ||

advayaṃ jñānaṃ nirābhāsam | sā śrīḥ paramaṃ jyotirityarthaḥ | hetuḥ svabhāvaśca hetvādiḥ tābhyāṃ śūnyatā rahitatā sā'tra heśabdasyārthaḥ śūnyatā'nimittatā cetyarthaḥ | apagatavyūham iti rahito 'ham | rukāreti ruśabdārtha ityarthaḥ | nairuktaḥ śeṣalopo hrasvatvaṃ ca śūnyatā ānimittamanabhilāpyatā ca | tadadvayaṃ jñānaṃ śūnyatādyālambanatvāditi madhyākṣaradvayasyārthaḥ |

yadi śūnyatādyālambanaṃ tajñānam ālambyālambakabhāvāt kathamadvayam ataścaturthamakṣaram ka iti | na kvacit sthitamiti kvacidapi na sthitamiti kakārārthaḥ śeṣalopāt | yaiva sarvadharmāṇāṃ śūnyatā saivānimittamanabhilāpyatā ca | sā ca svacittapratibhāsināṃ sarvadharmāṇāṃ dvayabhrāntiparikṣaye sati prakāśamānā na tasmāccittād bhidyata iti svasaṃvinmātraṃ nālambyālambakabhāva iti bhāvaḥ | kathaṃ tarhi śūnyatādyālambanamucyate tatsaṃvedanāt || 27 ||

iyatā śrīherukasya paramaṃ tattvamuktam | tadapyantarantarā manasi karttavyamiti sūcanārtham | yeṣām ityādinā anuśaṃsāmāha | vaśaṃ yānti iti janmāntare vineyā bhavantītyarthaḥ || 28 ||

mahāpaṇḍitācāryaratnākaraśāntikṛtāyāṃ muktāvalyāṃ hevajrapañjikāyāṃ chommāpīṭhanirṇayapaṭalaḥ saptamaḥ ||

yoginīcakro nāma mahāyoginīnāṃ melāpakapaṭalaḥ aṣṭhamaḥ

cakramaṇḍalaṃ mahāmokṣapuraṃ paramādyabhavanam ityekārthaḥ | tad dvividhamādhārādheyabhedāt | tena vinā nāsti samādhitrayayogaḥ | sa cāyaṃ yogo devatāpaṭale 'nuktatvād iha vaktavyaḥ ata āha atha ityādi | yoginī nairātmyā tatpradhānaṃ cakraṃ yoginīcakram |

khadhātau iti śūnyatābodhibhāvanayā viśvapratibhāse svacetasi nirābhāsīkṛte pratibhāsamānamanantamākāśaṃ khadhātuḥ tasmin khadhātau | bhagaṃ dhyātvā trikoṇatvena bhagasādharmyāt sarvāvaraṇabhañjakatvācca śaraccandradhavalā mahatī dharmodayamudrā bhagam tad vicintya ityarthaḥ | mdhye kurvāta bhāvanām iti tasya bhagasya madhye ādhāracakrasya bhāvanāṃ kuyāt | kathamityāha cakraṃ pūrvam ityādi | ayamuddeśaḥ || 1 ||

asya nirdeśāḥ cakraṃ kṣoṇī ityādi | dharmasaṅketena cakrādiśabdairmāhendravāruṇāgneyavāyāvyamaṇḍalānyucyante | tathodayaśabdena bhāvakaḥ | 
athavā cakrāṇi maṇḍalāni | iha tu māhendramaṇḍalameva cakramuktaṃ prādhānyāt | tacca pṛthvyeva | tenoktaṃ yathānyāyaṃ cakraṃ kṣoṇīti | kāñcanamaṇḍalāt pūrvaṃ jalamaṇḍalam tenāha jalaṃ pūrvamiti | nyāyaḥ samyagjñānaṃ tad yathā prakāśasvabhāvaṃ tathā jyotirapi | ato nyāyasādharmyād yathā nyāyaṃ jyotiḥ tenāha yathānyāyaṃ hutāśana iti | devatānām mātāpitarau vāyuṃ muñcato na śukram tataste jāyante ato ddevatāḥ pariṇāmayatīti devatā nāma tenāha devatānāṃ mahāvāyuḥ iti | yathā devatānāmudayo bhāvyate tathā bhāvaka eva sidhyati | tenāha bhāvakaśca yathodayam iti || 2 ||

tataḥ kimityāha dharmetyādi | dharmodayaḥ saiva trikoṇā mudrā tasmin udbhavo māhendracaturmaṇḍalapariṇāmenāsyeti tathoktam | kutaḥ caturmahābhautikatvāt | kiṃ tacckram ādhāramaṇḍalam caturasratvādiguṇayuktam | tathā ca vakṣyati 
asmaccakraṃ tvayā kathitaṃ hārārddhahāraśobhitam |
catuṣkoṇaṃ caturdvāraṃ vajrasūtrairalaṅkṛtam || iti || 
he ta 2|5|4  6 
dvipuṭam iti dvipuram | śuddham iti paramojjvalapañcaratnamayam | nirāmayam iti nirdoṣam mahāmokṣapuratvāt | kiñjalkena iti kiñjalkopalakṣitamaṣṭadalaṃ kamalam | trikoṇena iti dharmodayena paricchinnaṃ kamalabāhyaṃ kūṭāgārasthānam tacca puṭadvayabhāvakacittena nirābhāsena śuddhasphaṭikasaṃkāśena vyāptam || 3 ||

tanmadhye iti dvipuṭacakramadhye | mṛtakam iti mṛtakān | pañcadaśāsanātmakam iti pañcadaśānāṃ devīnāmāsanabhutān | pratyekaṃ tāsāmeva sthāneṣu | tasya iti nābhisthasya mṛtakasya | candram iti pūrṇacandram | bījakam iti bījākṣaram || 4 |

kīdṛśaṃ bījam paścānmārtaṇḍamākrāntaṃ candre bhāvite tasyopari yaḥ paścād bhāvitaḥ sūryastamākrāntaṃ tamārūḍham | dvayormelā mahat sukham iti tayooścandrasūryayormelā melakaḥ samarasarūpāntaraṃ sāmantasukhaṃ sarvatāthāgataṃ mahāmokṣasukhamityarthaḥ | tatpunarmahāsukhaṃ caturākāram | sūryasyopari yad bījaṃ tat prayogasukham | tadudbhavaṃ cihnaṃ mūlasukhaṃ cihnagarbhabījaṃ paricchedasukham | tasmāadanantayoginīmaṇḍalasphuraṇaṃ saṃharaṇaṃ parārthasukham |

athātra candrasūryayoḥ kathamutpattiḥ ityāha sthitetyādi | śuddhasphaṭikasaṃkāśasya puṭadvayavyāpino bhāvākacittasya pañcadaśasvarākāraḥ saṃhāraḥ sarvayoginīsvabhāva āliḥ sā candrarūpeṇa sthitā tatpariṇāmaścandra ityarthaḥ | tasyaiva candrasyopari prādurbhūtāścatustriṃśadvyañjanapaṅktiḥ sarvabuddhasvabhāvā kāliḥ sā bhāskararupeṇa sthitā tatpariṇāmaḥ sūrya ityarthaḥ || 5 ||

tayoścandrasūryayormelā yeyamuktāḥ sā gauryādyāḥ tatpariṇāmā imāḥ pañcadaśa yoginya ityarthaḥ | iyatā yoginīnāṃ mahāsukhamayatvena vajradharasvabhāvatā darśitā |

idānīṃ pañcajñānamayatvena pañcatathāgatasvabhāvatāmāsāṃ darśayitumāha ādarśetyādi | samāsataḥ pañcajñānāni buddhānām ādarśajñānaṃ samatājñānaṃ pratyavekṣaṇājñānaṃ kṛtyānuṣṭhānajñānaṃ suviśuddhadharmadhātujñānaṃ ca | atra ādarśajñānena svabhāvena tadvāṃścandraḥ lokaprasiddhaḥ | saptasaptiḥ sūryaḥ samatāvān samatājñānasvabhāva ityarthaḥ || 6 ||

bījena janitaṃ sahitaṃ ca svadevatācihnaṃ pratyavekṣaṇām pratyavekṣaṇājñānasvabhāva ityarthaḥ | sarvaiḥ iti cihnāntargatabījasphāritayoginīsamūhaiḥ sarvavyāpitvāt sarvaiḥ | ekam iti taireva saṃhṛtairekībhūtaṃ tadeva bījam | anuṣṭhānam iti kṛtyānuṣṭhānajñānamityarthaḥ | niṣpattiḥ iti candrārkacihnabījapariṇāmena svadevatākāraniṣpattiḥ | sā śuddhadharmatā suviśuddhadharmadhātujñānamityarthaḥ || 7 ||

ākārān bhāvayet pañca iti ādarśādīn budhaḥ iti prājñaḥ | ālikālisamāyogaḥ candrasūryarūpaḥ | viṣṭaraḥ āsanam | kasya viṣṭaraḥ vajrasattvasya sattvavajrasyetyarthaḥ || 8 ||

ko 'sau sattvavajraḥ akṣarodbhavapiṇḍasya piṇḍasambandhī akṣarodbhavaḥ cihnagarbhe bījotpāda ityarthaḥ | atra hi vajrapiṇḍaśabdau cihnārthau | sattvaśabdo bījārthaḥ | hūṃ ityādi | hūṃphaṭkārau ca cakārādāḥkārapraṇavaprajñopāyadehadravādikaṃ nairātmyāmaṇḍale nāyakotpādanāya neṣyate | yadi jñānadravādasya notpattiḥ kutastadityāha sattvabimbetyādi | bimbaṃ cihnam cihnagarbhākṣaraṃ sattvaḥ sattvagarbhabimbaṃ sattvabimbam tasmāt samudbhūtam | maṇḍaleśam iti maṇḍalādhipatiṃ nairātmyāmityarthaḥ || 9 ||

pūrvavad iti dharmasaṃketena yathā vakṣyamāṇairityarthaḥ | vaktracihnādyaiḥ iti vaktraṃ mukham | cihnaṃ kartrīkapālakhaṭvāṅgāni | ādyaśabdena vastrābharaṇādi gṛhyate | candrakāntamaṇiḥ pūrṇacandraḥ sa eva prabhā'syeti thathoktaḥ | upalakṣaṇaṃ caitat candrāsanaṃ candraprabhamityarthaḥ | evam iti maṇḍaleśavat na punarmaṇḍaleśotpāditacandradravāt | sarve iti vajragauryādayaḥ sarvamāṇḍaleyāḥ || 10 ||

kathaṃ prajñopāyasvabhāva ityāha prajñālītyādi | iti śabdo hetau | yasmādāliḥ prajñā kālirupāya ityarthaḥ | ālikālī api kutastāsāmityāha candrārkasya ityādi | ālikālisvabhāvau candrārkau tayoḥ prabhedanāt nānākaraṇāt | nairātmyā hṛccandracihnasthitabījarūpāt sattvavajrādeva saṃsphārya caturdaśānāṃ candrāṇāṃ caturdaśānāṃ ca sūryāṇāṃ caturdaśadevīśavāsanābjeṣu vinyāsādityarthaḥ | asmād iti svasvāsanasthacandrārkāt | gauryādyāḥ iti vajragauryādayaḥ | yathā tāsāṃ candrasūryau samānau tathā bījamapi kiṃ samānaṃ netyāha varṇetyādi | varṇamakṣaraṃ bījam tasya bhedanaṃ bhedaḥ anyadanyad bījamityarthaḥ | pṛthakpṛthag iti anyasyā anyasyā ityarthaḥ |

tatra nairātmyāyā ādyaḥ svaro bījam | vajragaurīvāriyoginīvajraḍākīnāṃ yathākramaṃ dvitīyasvarāt prabhṛti yāvat pañcamaḥ | pukkasīśavarīcaṇḍālīḍombīnāṃ ṣaṣṭhāt prabhṛti yāvannavamaḥ | gaurīcaurīvettālīghasmarībhūcarīkhecarīnāṃ daśamāt prabhṛti yāvat pañcadaśaḥ | bījodbhavā kartrī | kartrīgarbhe bījam tataḥ sphuraṇasaṃharaṇam | tataścandrasūryabījacihnaniṣpannāḥ sarvadevyaḥ || 11 ||

tāsāṃ sthānabhedamāha adhyātmetyādinā | adhyātmapuṭamabhyantaraṃ pañcaskandhālayatvāt | yoginīḥ iti bhāvayed iti sambandhaḥ || 12 ||

indre iti aindradiśi | yame iti yāmyāyām | bāhyapuṭe gauryādayaścatasraḥ | pūrvādidvāreṣu pukkasyādayaḥ aiśānādikoṇeṣu || 13 14 ||

adhavatyādi | ava rakṣaṇagatiprītyādiṣu atipratyayo vasativat | adho'vatī adhavatī ūrdhvamavatī ūrdhvavatī | avaterādilopaḥ adhaso 'ntalopaḥ adhavati bhūcarī ūrdhvavatī khecarīti sambandhaḥ | sthitāvetau iti ete sthite bhūcarī bhavasvabhāvena sthitā adhogatitvāt ata eva sā adhomukhī | khecarī nirvāṇasvabhāvena sthitā ūrdhvagatitvāt ata eva sā ūrdhvamukhī || 15 ||

kartrīkapālāvṛtau iti āvṛtau vyagrau | viśuddheneti viśuddhyā | śuddheti śuddhāḥ mudrakā iti mudrāḥ || 16  17 ||

evaṃ vidhā iti tathetyarthaḥ | kathamitāha kapāletyādi || 18 ||

jvaladdīptā iti kāyena jvalantyaścetasā dīptāḥ || 19 ||

tathā mānādītyādinā kartryādīnāṃ tattvamāha | śiraseti tattveneti śeṣaḥ || 20 ||

raktaṃ padmastham | laghu śīghram || 21 22 ||

ṣaḍaṅgaṃ yogamiti ṣaḍbhirvarṇaiḥ ṣaḍcakravartisamatāprāptimadasya sūcanāt ṣaḍaṅgam | evaṃ prāpte made punariti paścāt viramāntaṃ bhāvayet sahajānandamātramityarthaḥ | yogo nairātmyāyā bhagavatyāḥ so 'yamaṣṭame paṭale kāyatrayasvabhāvaṃ bhavati samādhitrayaṃ yatra |

iha bhāvanādhikṛto mantrī prātareva svahṛccandramaṇḍale nairātmyābījaṃ kiraṇamālinaṃ draṣṭvā kṛtamukhaśaucādiḥ sthānātmayogarakṣāṃ kṛtvā dhyānālayanaṃ praviśya sukhāsane niṣadya svamantreṇārghaṃ parijapya sarvatathāgatasaṃgrāhakaṃ nairātmyāmaṇḍalamagrato gaganatalagataṃ dṛṣṭvā svahṛdbījanirgatābhiraṣṭābhiḥ pūjādevībhirabhyarcayet |

gaurī mṛgalāñcchanadhartti rtrī caurī mārtaṇḍabhājanam |
vettalī vārihastā ca bhaṣajyadhrtti rtrī ghasmarī || 
pukkasī vajrahastā ca śavarī rasadharī tathā |
caṇḍalī ḍamarukaṃ vādayet ḍombyāliṅgitakandharam || 
