tasyāgrataḥ pāpadeśanādikamiti kuryāt | pratideśayāmi sarvamātmanaḥ pāpam anumode sarvakuśalaṃ sarvāryapṛthagjanānām ābodheḥ buddhaṃ śaraṇaṃ gacchāmi dharmaṃ śaraṇaṃ gacchāmi saṃghaṃ śaraṇaṃ gacchāmi anuttarāyāṃ samyaksaṃbodhau cittamutpādayāmi sarvasattvānāmarthāya hitāya sukhāya yathābhavyaṃ ca teṣāṃ bodhitrayaprāptaye | tataḥ sarvasattveṣu divyasukhopasaṃhārāṃ maitrīṃ bhāvayet | tatasteṣveva karuṇāṃ sarvaduḥkhāpanayanākārām | tatasteṣveva muditāṃ sukhāviyogākārām | tata upekṣāṃ ca teṣveva laukikalokottarasarvakuśalopasaṃhārākārām | tataḥ sarvadharmapratibhāsaṃ cittamutpādya cittamevedamasatyapi grāhye 'rthe 'rthapratibhāsaṃ bhrāntyā utpadyate tadyathā svapna iti niścitya bhrāntiparityāgāya sarvaṃ nīlapītādikamarthapratibhāsaṃ parihṛtya tadbimbapratibhāsam ātmanaścittaṃ śaranmadhyāhnanirmalanabhonibhaṃ nirābhāsaṃ prakāśamātramanantaṃ paśyet | idaṃ tat pāramārthikaṃ bodhicittam iyamasau mukhyā prajñāpāramitā idameva ca paramaṃ śūnyājñānam | etad vibhāvya mantreṇādhitiṣṭhet oṃ śūnyatājñānavajrasvabhāvātmako 'ham iti | tadanu 
repheṇa sūryaṃ purato tasmin ravau hūṃbhavaviśvavajram |
tenaiva vajreṇa vibhāvayecca prākārakaṃ pañjarabandhanaṃ ca || 
