tataḥ śaraccandradhavalāmūrdhvasthitāṃ trikoṇāmantaḥsuṣirāṃ mahatīṃ dharmodayamudrāṃ vibhāvya tadgarbhe māhendramaṇḍalaṃ caturasraṃ pītam tadupari vāruṇaṃ vartulaṃ dhavalam parivarttya bṛhadbimbakamalakarṇikābimbavajrārūḍhaṃ kūṭāgāraṃ vicintayet pramojjvalapañcaratnamayam |

caturasraṃ caturdvāraṃ catustoraṇabhūṣitam |
devīcatuṣṭaye dvyaṣṭapūjādevīkṛtārcanam ||
hārārdhahāraracitaṃ vajrasūtrairalaṅkṛtam |
mārutoddhūtaviśvāgrapatākāghaṇṭānāditam || 
tasya garbhapuṭe kamalamaṣṭadalaṃ vibhāvayet | tasya karṇikāyāṃ digdaleṣu pañca śavāsanāni cintayet | bāhyapuṭe koṇeṣu catvāri dvāreṣu catvāri adhastādekam upariṣṭādekam | tato madhyāsanaśavahṛdaye tatpūrvabhāvitaṃ bhāvakacittamanantaṃ svacchasphaṭikasaṃkāśaṃ pañcadaśasvarāvalīrūpeṇa saṃhṛtya tatpariṇataṃ pūrṇacandraṃ bhāvayet | tadupari catustriṃśadvyañjanāvalīpariṇataṃ sūryamaṇḍalam | tasyopariṣṭādakāram tena kartrī tadgarbhe 'kāram | tasmādakārāt pañcadaśayoginīrūpeṇa sarvatathāgatān saṃsphārya tāṃstatraiva saṃhṛtya candrasūryakartrībījapariṇatāṃ bhagavatīṃ nairātmyāṃ vibhāvayet | 
kṛṣṇavarṇāṃ mahāraudrāṃ pañcamudrāvibhūṣitām |
cakrīkuṇḍalakaṇṭhāṃ ca haste rucakamekhalām || 
vyāghracarmāmbarāṃ dīptāṃ javalatpiṅgordhvamūrdhajām |
dvibhujaikamukhīṃ baddhabhṛkuṭiṃ raktalocanām || 
vāme kapāalakhaṭvāṅgaṃ savye kartrīṃ ca bibhratīm |
ardhaparyaṅkanāṭyasthāṃ candrāsanaśaśiprabhām || 
catuścakrasarojeṣu caturakṣaraśobhitām |
stanāntarendukartrīsthabhāsvadbījavirājitām || 
ayamādiyogo nāma prathamaḥ samādhiḥ svābhāvikaśca kāyaḥ |

tadanu hṛccihnasthitabījāccaturdaśacandramaṇḍalāni niścārya ekaikaśavāsanahṛdaye vinyaset | tata eva bījāccaturdaśasūryabimbāni niścārya teṣu candreṣu sthāpayet | candrasūryasamāyogāt sūryopari bījāni jāyante |

tatrābhyantarapuṭe pūrvādidiksūryeṣu yathākramam ā i ī u bāhyapuṭasyaiśānādikoṇasūryeṣu yathākramam ū ṛ \={\d{r}} ¬ pūrvādidvāre sūryeṣu yathākramam \={\d{l}} e ai o adhaḥ sūrye au ūrdhvasūrye aṃ | pratyekaṃ bījodbhavā kartrī tadgarbhe tadeva bījam | tataḥ sphuraṇasaṃharaṇam |

tataścandrasūryakartrībījapariṇāmāścaturdaśa devyaḥ | sarvāstathaiva yathā nairātmyagoginī | digdaleṣu vajrā gaurī vāriyoginī vajraḍākī ca | koṇeṣu pukkasī śavarī caṇḍālī ḍombī ca | dvāreṣu gaurī caurī vettālī ghasmarī ca | etā dvādaśa nairātmyābhimukhāḥ | adhastād bhūcarī adhomukhī | upariṣṭāt khecarī ūrdhvamukhī | sarvāsāṃ hṛccandrakartrīgarbhe svabījāni | tadanu hṛnmantrakiraṇairjñānamaṇḍalamākṛṣya hūṃkāreṇa vighnānutsārya gaganatalasthāya tasmai pūrvaparijaptamarghapādyaṃ svamantreṇa dadyāt | tato jaḥ hūṃ vaṃ horityebhiḥ samayamaṇḍale jñānamaṇḍalamākṛṣya praveśya baddhvā vaśīkṛtya kṣīrodakavat samarasībhūtaṃ cintayet |

tata ātmīye rūpaskandhe tādātmyena vajrāmavasthitāṃ paśyet | vedanāskandhe gaurīṃ saṃjñāskandhe vāriyoginīṃ saṃskāraskandhe vajraḍākīṃ vijñānaskandhe nairātmyāṃ pṛthivīdhātau pukkasī abdhātau śavarīṃ tejodhātau caṇdālīṃ vāyudhātau ḍombīṃ rūpāyatane gaurīṃ śabdāyatane caurīṃ gandhāyatane vettālīṃ rasāyatane ghasmarīṃ spraṣṭavyāyatane bhūvarīṃ dharmāyatane khecarīṃ cakṣurāyatane vajrāṃ śrotrāyatane nairātmyāṃ ghrāṇāyatane gaurīṃ jihvāyatane vāriyoginīṃ kāyāyatane vajraḍākīṃ mana āyatane nairātmyāṃ dveṣe nairātmyāṃ mohe vajrāṃ rāge vāriyoginīṃ māne gaurīṃ īrṣyāyāṃ vajraḍākīṃ sarvāsāmoṃkāreṇa śirasi kāyādhiṣṭhānam āḥkāreṇa kaṇṭhe vāgadhiṣṭhānam hūṃkāreṇa hṛdi cittādhiṣṭhānam | evamanyāsāmapi skandhadhātvāyatanakleśopakleśaviśuddhimadhimuñcet |

tataḥ svahṛdbījakiraṇairākṛṣya sarvatathāgatān gagane 'vasthāpya svahṛdbījasphāritābhiraṣṭābhirmāgṛbhiḥ sampūjyābhiṣekaṃ prayācayet | tataste pañcajñānamayāmbupurṇairmaṇikalaśairmaṇḍalādhipatimaṇḍalaṃ cābhiṣiñcantaṃ cintanīyāḥ | 
abhiṣekajalodbhūtaiḥ svakuleśaiḥ pañca mudrayet |
cittaśāśvataratneśalokeśāmoghasiddhibhiḥ || 
cittaśāśvataratneśalokeśaiḥ koṇavāsinīḥ |
dvārapālīstathā moharāgābhyāmadharottare || 
tataḥ svahṛnmantrādaṣṭau pūjādevīṃ viścārya saṃsphārya saṃpūjya saṃharet | tatra ṣaḍādyāḥ kiñcidāvarjitaiḥ karasthabhājanaiḥ pūjanāat karakapāleṣu pūjādravyāṇi svaprabhavādupādayeyuḥ | tāśca paribhuñjīran | aṣṭamī cakrādhipateḥ kaṇṭhamāliṅget | asyāmitarāḥ saptamāṇḍāleyayoginyaśca sphuraṇayogena praviśeyuḥ | tāśca sarvāḥ svakamalasthānotpāditakuliśā bhagavatī paribhuñjīta |

kṛṣṇaṃ raktaṃ tataḥ pītaṃ haritaṃ nīlaṃ sitaṃ kramāt |
sahajānandamātraṃ ca dhyāyāccakraṃ sanāyakam || 
iti maṇḍalarājāgrī nāma dvitīyaḥ samādhiḥ sāmbhogikaśca kāyaḥ |

tadanu cakrādhipaticoditāḥ sarvadevyo yathākramaṃ svakāyasphuraṇameghairanurūpaṃ jagadarthamanuṣṭhāya tān svakāyameghān mūlakāye saṃhareyuḥ |

tatra dvārapālībhūcaryo yathākramaṃ śraddhāvīryasmṛtisamādhiprajñendriyeṣu sattvān vyavasthāpayanti | khecarī śraddhāvīryasmṛtisamādhiprajñābaleṣu | pukkasī pramuditāvimalāprabhākarīṣu | śavarī arciṣmatīsudurjayā'bhimukhīṣu | caṇḍālī dūraṅgamā'calayoḥ | ḍombī sādhumatidharmameghayoḥ | pariśiṣṭāḥ pañcabuddhabhūmau |

tatra digdevatīcatuṣṭayamādarśādijñānacatuṣṭaye | svayaṃ bhagavatī nairātmyā suviśuddhadharmadhātujñāne | iti karmarājāgrī nāma tṛtīyaḥ samādhiḥ nairmāṇikaśca kāyaḥ |

khede sati viśramya jvalanti mantrākṣarāṇi hṛccandre akṣaramālākāreṇa manasā'bhilikhya tāni kramād vācayanneva nibhṛtaṃ japet yāvat khedo na bhavet | mantraḥ pañcadaśa svarāḥ svāhāntāḥ | tato gāthādvayena puṇyaṃ pariṇāmayet |
sarvasvaṃ sarvabuddhānāṃ mahāvajrabhṛtaḥ padam |
labheyaṃ kuśalairebhirlabhayeyaṃ ca tajjagat ||
caryā sambodhaye yā ca saṃbuddhānāṃ ca yā punaḥ |
varṇitā bodhivajreṇa sā caryā'stu dvayī mama || 
tataḥ svahṛdbījabindau maṇḍalamantarbhāvya yathāsukhamutthāya svadevatāhaṃkāramudvahan sarvaṃ kuryāt | sandhyāntare devagṛhaṃ praviśya sukhāsane niṣadya nairātmyāmātmānaṃ nirūpya svahṛnmantrāccaturdaśadevīrsṛtya yathāsthāne niveśya paśyet | ātmanastāsāṃ ca samāsataḥ |

skandhādiviśuddhiṃ tryakṣarādhiṣṭhānaṃ cādhimucya pūrvavadabhiṣekādikaṃ pariṇāmanāparyantaṃ kṛtvā tathaiva maṇḍalamupasaṃhṛtya samutthitaḥ svadevatāhaṅkāreṇa sarvaṃ kuryāt baliṃ ca dadyādanena om akāro mukhaṃ sarvadharmāṇāmādyanutpannatvāt om āḥ hūṃ phaṭ svāhā |
paścimasandhyāyāṃ tu ante 'rghaṃ datvā jñānamaṇḍalamutsṛjyet 
om kṛto vaḥ sarvasattvārthaḥ siddhirdattā yathānugā |
gacchadhvaṃ buddhaviṣayaṃ punarāgamanāya tu || 
om muriti | 
tataḥ samayamaṇḍalamantarbhāvya sthānātmayogarakṣāṃ kurvīta | nidrākāle sahajānandamātratāmadhimucya supyāt | evaṃ dine dine kuryāditi || 24 ||

evaṃ dvayoḥ kramayorekaṃ nirdiśya dvitīyaṃ prastotumāha kramaḥ ityādi | kramaḥ prakāro bhāgaḥ pakṣa iti paryāyāḥ | kasya kramaḥ yogasya | mantracihnādikrameṇa devatākāraniṣpattiryogina utpattiḥ sā yasmin yoge 'sti sa utpattikramaḥ | utpannasahajameva sādhakādīnāṃ rūpam tadeva devādi tattvarūpeṇādhimucya yasmin yoge bhāvyate sa utpannakramaḥ || 
etatkramadvayamāśritya vajriṇāṃ buddhānāṃ dharmadeśanā yogadeśanā || 25 ||

tatra khadhātāvityanayā gāthayā utpattipakṣaḥ kathitaḥ | arthāduktaṃ bhavati utpannakrama ucyata iti | tamāha khadhātāvityādinā | padmeṣu iti dharmadhātusvabhāve kamale | jñānam iti prayogamārgasvabhāvaṃ kuliśam | dhyātveti praveśya | etattrayamādiḥ sahajadvayamantaḥ anayormadhye kurvīta bhāvanām | samāhitā pratiprattiranuṣṭhānaṃ parispandaḥ samāpattiḥ sā bhāvanā bhāvanāyāḥ phalaṃ sahajānandadvayam tadgāthāyāmuttarārddhena sūcitam | tasyāyamarthaḥ | yathānyāyaṃ yatsukhamutkṛṣṭatvādabhrāntatvācca pūrvakāraṇatvāt taccakraṃ yoginīcakrasvabhāvamityarthaḥ | yatra punaryathodayaṃ kāraṇabalādutpannaṃ bodhicittaṃ tad devatānāṃ sarvaṃ nāmayatīti nāma sarvonnatā devatetyarthaḥ bhagavān vajradhara iti | yāvadasyaiva vyākhyānaṃ tadityādi | tayā bhāvanayā janitaṃ sukhaṃ tatsukham | cakramucyate yoginīcakramabhidhīyate | paramaprajñāsvabhāvena tāsāṃ saṅgrahāt || 26 ||

kīdṛśaṃ tatsukhamityāha yathānyāyam iti abhrāntamutkṛṣṭañcetyarthaḥ | etadeva vyācaṣṭe svasaṃvedyam iti | atra vedyaśabdena sādhyasukhasya sammukhībhāva uktaḥ | asammukhībhūtasya vedyatvāyogāt | saṃ śabdena samyagarthenotkṛṣṭatvam | svaśabdenābhrāntatvam | svenaiva rūpeṇa vedyaṃ na bhrāntisamāropiteneti kṛtvā | devatānāmityasyānuvādo devateti | arthamāha bodhicittam iti | tadeva svasaṃvedyaṃ dharmakāyasvabhāvaṃ bodhiḥ | bodhiniṣyandaṃ cittaṃ bodhicittam | sāmbhogikakāyasvabhāvaṃ sūkṣmākārayogād vajradharamūrtirityarthaḥ | 
kiṃ tadityāha yathodayam iti | yathārthamutpannaṃ sākāratve 'pyarthānabhiniviṣṭatvāt | tat punaḥ katamadityāha śukram iti | yata evaṃ tataḥ kāraṇāt | dvaividhyaṃ sahajaṃ dvividhaḥ sahajānandaḥ || 27 ||

yadyayaṃ sahajastadā strīpuṃsau kiṃ bhaviṣyata ityāha yoṣit ityādi | anayoḥ iti saptamī  dvaividhyamānandasya kathamityāha vivṛtisaṃvṛtibhedataḥ iti | svasaṃvedyaṃ vivṛtiḥ nirābhāsatvena nirāvaraṇatvāt | yathodayaṃ saṃvṛtiḥ ākāraleśena kiṅcadāvṛtatvāt || 28 29 ||

ata eva iti dvayordvaividhyāt | catasṛṇām iti caturṇām | prabhendanam iti sahajānandasāmānye prabhedanam | 
nanu ca anyathaiva catvāra ānandāḥ paṭhyante ānandaḥ paramānando viramānandaḥ sahajānandaśceti | iha tu anyathaiva varṇyate tatkathaṃ na virodha ityāha sahajam ityādi | ānandaparamānandādayaścatvāra utpattipakṣe bhāvyante | utpannakramapakṣe tu sahaja evaikaścaturvidho bhāvyata ityarthaḥ | tadeva sahajasya dvaividhyaṃ cāturvidhyaṃ ca darśitam || 30 ||

sākalyena traividhyamapyāha ānandam ityādinā | vīra iti sādhakaḥ svaparārthasampadoḥ pāragamanārthamārabdhavīryatvāt | sa evānandaḥ | ānandādanyasya sukhabhoktṛtvāyogāt | paramānandaṃ tu yoginī iti suratānandāya mṛgyatvāt | suratānandastṛtīyaḥ | suratasāmānyenaikīkṛtya gaṇanāt | samastaṃ vai iti sarvameva trayamapītyarthaḥ | tadevāha tad ityādinā | bhāvanājanitaṃ sukhaṃ tatśukham upāyo bhāvanā | sarvavid devatā | utpattikrame catvāra ānandā bhavyante ānandasvabhāvānāṃ teṣāṃ kramādutpatteriti yuktametat || 31 ||

utpannakrame tu sahajānanda evaiko bhāvyata ityatra yuktitrayaṃ ślokatrayeṇāha ānandena ityādinā | ayameṣāṃ samāsārthaḥ iha svasaṃvedyameva sukhaṃ khasamaṃ tatsamaṃ ca sādhyam | tatpunaḥ katamat

yad yathārthamutkṛṣṭamabhimukhībhūtam svaśavdena saṃśabdena vedyaśabdena ca kramād arthatrayasūcanāt etacca trayaṃ sahajasyaivāstīti | sa eva nityaṃ bhāvyo netare sādhyavilakṣaṇatvāditi | tatrānandatrayasya tribhiḥ ślokairyathākramamanutkṛṣṭatvaṃ bhrāntatvamiṣṭāsammukhībhāvaśca kathyate | kiñcid iti stokaṃ hīnatvādanutkṛṣṭamityarthaḥ | adhikam evādhikam tasmād ānandādadhikam na sahajānandāt madhyatvādanutkṛṣṭamityarthaḥ | virāgo vaimukhyam ato hīnameva viramasukhaṃ duḥkhaśabalatvādityarthaḥ | śeṣataḥ iti pāriśeṣyāt | sahajānandastu sahajānanda ev bhāvyata iti pareṇa sambandhaḥ | ākāṅkṣā vāñchā lipseti paryāyāḥ | sā ca vikalpatvād bhrāntiḥ | ataḥ sākāṅkṣatvād ādyau bhrāntau | sparśaḥ kamalasya vāñchayeti yuktamiti śeṣaḥ |

prathamaślokanirdiṣṭena krameṇa tṛtīyo viramānandaḥ caturthaḥ sahajānandaḥ notpattikraneṇa | rāgaśabdenotkṛṣṭaṃ sukhamatroktam āsaktisthānatvāt tasya nāśaḥ tadbhāvastattvam tasmād bhavatīti | tena lakṣyate tallakṣaṇa ityarthaḥ | yasmād viramānanda utkṛṣṭasukhavināśalakṣaṇaḥ satsukhaṃ mayā bhuktam iti tasmādatītasukhasmaraṇavikalparūpatvād bhrānta ityarthaḥ || 32  33 ||

bhavatyasmāditi bhavaḥ | avyavahitaṃ kāraṇamityarthaḥ | nirvāṇaṃ vināśaḥ | madhyamam iti madhyamamantarālam tadasyāstīti madhyam matvarthīto 'c sāntaraṃ vyavahitakāraṇatvādityarthaḥ | 
ayamarthaḥ paramānandakāle 'pi notkṛṣṭasukhasya sammukhībhāvaḥ tatkāraṇatvāttasya | viramānandakāle 'pi na sammukhībhāvo vinaṣṭatvāt | ānandakāle tu sutarāmasammukhībhāvaḥ kāraṇakāraṇatvāditi | 
ebhiḥ iti tribhirasaṃmukhībhāvakāraṇaiḥ utkṛṣṭasukharūpeṇaiva tasyotpatteḥ | yadyevamutpattikrame 'pi catvāraḥ kasmād bhāvyante yo 'yam ānandaḥ sammukhībhavati tasya tasyopalakṣaṇatvāt | utpannakrame tarhi kasmādekaḥ adhimuktipradhānatvādasya kramasya nityaṃ sahajasyaiva sammukhīkaraṇāt || 34 ||

evamupadiṣṭe sahajānande kṛtakṛtyā vayaṃ vyarthā bhāvaneti keṣāñcidāśaṅkā syādatastān pratyāha nānyena ityādi | nānyena iti buddhavajradharādinā'pi | na kasminnapi iti daśabhūmīśvare 'pi pratyātmavedyasya tasya vāgvikalpātītatvāditi bhāvaḥ | kathaṃ tarhi tasyā deśanā śrutaṃ vā udbhāvanāsaṃvṛtyā na svena rūpeṇa suranārakasukhaduḥkhavedanāśrutavat | yadā tu sākṣāttad bhavati tadā svarūpeṇa vedyate tadā cātmanaiva vedyate nānyasya vācā | etadevāha ātmanā jñāyate iti | ato naiva vyarthā bhāvanā | bhāvanāpariniṣpattiṃ vinā tasya sākṣātkartumaśakyatvāt | tathā coktam 
deśito vo mayā mārgastṛṣṇāśalyasya karttanaḥ |

he paṃ yo ra mā bhā 2pṛ 127

nanu yatra laukiko mārgastatraiṣa nyāyaḥ sahajānandastu kāmināṃ pratyakṣa eva tatropadeśo 'pi vyarthaḥ kiṃ punarbhāvanā na hi pratyakṣe 'rthe paropadeśo garīyān ata āha puṇyād ityādi |

evaṃ manyate nātra laukika eva sahajānandaḥ sādhyaḥ siddhatvāt uttarottarasuralokādisukhāpekṣayā ca hīnatvāt sāsravatvena malinatvāt tanmūlatvācca sāṃsārikāaṇāṃ doṣāṇām | kiṃ tarhi tathāgānāmeva yaḥ pratyātmavedyo dharmakāyapraptisahajaḥ khasamastanniṣyandabhūtaśca sambhogakāyasahajaḥ paramotkṛṣṭasuviśuddhadhruvasukhalakṣaṇaḥ sahajānandaḥ | sa iha sādhyaḥ | sa ca gatyantarābhāvādasminneva laukikasahajānande yathopadeśamadhimucya bhāvyamāno bhāvanāpariniṣpattau sākṣādbhūta ātmanā jñāyate na prāk | tato nātra śruticintābhāvanānāṃ vaiyarthyamiti |

upāyo mārgaḥ tasya sevā samyagbhāvanā tasya bahūni parvāṇi bahavaḥ prakārā ityarthaḥ | gurulabhyaṃ parva guruparva yad yogyāya śiṣyāya guruṇā vidhivat dīyate avavāda ityarthaḥ | avagamāya vādo 'vavādaḥ avagamo 'dhigamaḥ vāda upadeśaḥ guruparvaṇā upāyasevā guruparvopāyasevā tayā jñāyate puṇyāt |

etena pratirūpadeśavāsaḥ satpuruṣasamāśrayaḥ cetasaḥ samyak praṇidhānam pūrve kṛtapuṇyatā ceti catvāryadhigamakāraṇānyuktāni | tatra guruparvagrahaṇena satpuruṣasamāśraya uktaḥ | upāyasevāgrahaṇena cetasaḥ samyak praṇidhānaṃ sākṣāduktam | pratirūpadeśavāso 'rthāduktaḥ tena vinā tasyāsambhavāt | puṇyagrahaṇena kṛtapuṇyatoktā | iha tu puṇyādityuktam na pūrvakṛtāt puṇyāditi |

kiṃ kāraṇam ihopacitādapi puṇyādadhigamasya mantranītāvabhimatatvāt upāyaviśeṣeṇa | kaścāsau yathāsamayaṃ yathābhisamayaṃ yat pratidivasamādhārādheyacakrabhāvanādibhirātmasattvabhājanalokānāmasakṛtpariśodhanam so 'sāvupāyaviśeṣaḥ || 36 ||

nanvayamupāyaviśeṣa utpattikrame 'sti notpannakrame sahajānandamātrasya tatra bhāvanāt | ata āha hīnamadhyetyādi || 37 ||

asyaiva vyākhyānaṃ hīnamityādi | sūkṣmapadārtham iti ātmanaścittacaittāḥ | bhāva iti svadehaḥ | varjitaṃ dvābhyām iti svadehāvayavābhyām | ṣaḍindriyam iti svadehādhiṣṭhāyakāścakṣurādayaḥ || 38 ||

sthiracalam iti bāhyāścetanā'cetanāḥ | naivāham iti nāhamev kevalo vajradharaḥ | tulyaceṣṭāni iti abhinnacaitanyāni | kathamityāaha tattvabhāvanaiḥ iti asyaiva vyākhyānaṃ samarasaiḥ iti samarasabhāvanairityarthaḥ || 39 ||

asyāpi vyākhyānaṃ samam ityādi | tulyam iti sadṛśamityarthaḥ | anena pūrvapadārtha uktaḥ | tasya iti hīnamadhyādeḥ | rasaḥ sārastattvaṃ bhāva iti paryāyāḥ | ko 'sau rasaḥ cakraḥ svasaṃvedyasukhalakṣaṇaṃ yoginīcakramityarthaḥ | anenottarapadārtha uktaḥ |samudāyarthamāha samarasamekabhāvaṃ tu iti | samo raso 'syeti samarasaḥ eko bhāvo 'syeti ekabhāvaḥ | anenārthena iti yathoktenāvayavārthena || 40 ||

tatpunaḥ samarasatvaṃ kathaṃ bhāvayedityāha mad ityādi | jagatsarvam iti jaṅgamāḥ sarve | madbhavā hi iti madbhavā eva na hi cittādanyo 'haṃ nāma kaścit | cittodbhavāśca sarve tato madbhavā eva | bhuvanatrayam iti sarve sthāvarāḥ te 'pi madbhavāḥ pūrvavat | idam iti sthāvarajaṅgamam | mayā vyāptam iti cittasvabhāvatvāt | nānyamayam iti nācittasvabhāvaḥ |

bhavatu cittasvabhāvaṃ viśvaṃ mahāsukhasvabhāvaṃ tu kutaḥ yasya svarūpasaṃvedanaṃ cittam dvayaśūnyatā ca cittasya svarūpameva ataḥ sarvacittāni khasamajñānena mahāsukhātmakenānugatāni dvayaśūnyatāsaṃvedanasāmānyāt | etenādhimokṣayoga uktaḥ || 41 ||

asyānuśaṃsamāha evam ityādinā | mandapuṇyo 'pi iti akṛtapuṇyo 'pi pūrvajanmasu sidhyatīti anenaiva yogena puṇyopacayāt || 42 ||

khāne iti bhakṣaṇe | supto 'pi iti sādarābhyāsena tathaiva svapnadarśanāt | sātatyam iti asyaiva yogasya svarasavāhitām | kimanena sātatyenetyāha mahāmudretyādi mahāmudrāsidhyarthamiti bhāvaḥ || 43 ||

evamadhimokṣagranthena kṛtapuṇyatā vyākhyātā | cetasaḥ samyak praṇidhānaṃ vyākhyātumāha bhāvyante hi ityādi | jagat sarvam iti sattvabhājanalokāḥ | te sarve bhāvyanta eva kevalam | avadhāraṇaṃ kasmādityāha manasā ityādi | manasā vikalpavijñānena yato na vikalpyante tata eva etadavadhāraṇamityarthaḥ | yadi na vikalpyante na tarhi bhāvyanta ityāha sarvadharmetyādi | parijñāanameva dharnāṇāṃ bhāvanā | naiva bhāvanā iti na vikalpanetyarthaḥ prakṛtibhrāntatvād vikalpānāmitibhāvaḥ || 44 ||

tattarhi parijñānaṃ kathamityāha sthiretyādi | ādiśabdāt tarugirisāgarādayaḥ prāṇinaśca te sarve | parameva tattvaṃ bhāvyaṃ nādhimuktitattvam nānājalpairnānākāraiśca vikalpitam | kiṃ punastatparaṃ tattvamityata āha ātmetyādi | ātmanaḥ svacittasya bhāvastattvaṃ tadeva svarūpamasyeti || 45 ||

tathoktam 
teṣāmekam iti tattvamiti pūrveṇa sambandhaḥ | paraṃ nāsti iti dvitīyaṃ tattvaṃ nāsti | kiṃ punastadekamityāha svasaṃvedyam ityādi | 
nanu śūnyataiva paraṃ tattvam yathā hi sā bhūtakiṭirucyate | bhūtāni tattvāni teṣāṃ koṭiragram | nātaḥ paratattvamastītyarthaḥ | iha tu svasaṃvedyaṃ paraṃ tattvamucyata iti virodhaḥ 
nāsti virodhaḥ | na hi śūnyatā nāma kācidanyā dharmād dharmatāyāḥ pṛthakcharīrābhāvāt api tu tasyaiva svasaṃvedyasya sarvadharmāṇāṃ bhāvatattvasya yā dvayarahitatā vijñaptimātratā sā śūnyatā | sā cet paraṃ tattvaṃ tadā svasaṃvedyameva paratattvamityuktaṃ bhavati | tatkuto virodhaḥ |

api cālambanatattvānāmeva śūnyatā paramā nālambakāditattvāanām svasaṃvedyaṃ punaḥ sarvadharmaparamatattvātmakam tathā hi svasaṃvedyamapyālambanatattvānāṃ paramam śūnyatādarśanena svarūpasyāpi darśanāt | ālambakatattvaṃ tu paramaṃ svasaṃvedyameva na śūnyatā jaḍatvāt | yāni cānyāni sapta paramatattvānīṣyante phalatattvaṃ hetutattvaṃ mārgatattvaṃ karmatattvaṃ kārakatattvam īśvaratatvaṃ prabhutattvañca tānyapi tadeva svasaṃvedyamiti vedayitumāha mahat sukham ityādi | nirupamasuviśuddhaśāśvatasukhalakṣaṇaṃ hi mahāsukham phalatattvaṃ paramam | tasya nirdeśo mahatsukhamiti svasaṃvedyamiti vartate | svasaṃvedyameva tat bhāvalakṣaṇatvādityarthaḥ | siddhirbodhiḥ sā svasaṃvedyādeva bhavet | tadeva paramaṃ hetutattvam bhāvasyaiva janakatvādityarthaḥ | hi śabdo 'vadhāraṇe svasaṃvedyameva bhāvanā | tasmāttadeva paramaṃ mārgatattvamityarthaḥ || 46 ||

svasaṃvedyamayam iti svasaṃvedyātmakaṃ karma tadeva paramaṃ karmatattvamityarthaḥ | kathaṃ tatkarmetyāha bādhanād ityādi | dvividhaṃ hi karma jñānaṃ prahāṇaṃ ca | kleśajñeyāvaraṇakṣayaḥ prahāṇam jñānaṃ bodhasvabhāvāaḥ sarvabuddhadharmāḥ | tatra  bādhanādityanena prahāṇaṃ sākṣāduktam jñānamarthāduktam | kvacitpāṭhaḥ bodhanāditi tena jñānaṃ sākṣāduktam prahāṇamarthāt | karma jāyata iti karma bhavati svasaṃvedyameva | na hi mārgasya vyāpāro mārgādanyaḥ | mārgaḥkaraṇam karttā bodhisattvāḥ | yastayorāvaraṇayorhartā jñānasya kartā | ataḥ kartṛtvaṃ paramaṃ niṣṭhāgato bodhisattvaḥ | so 'pi svasaṃvedyamevetyāha svayaṃ hartā svayaṃ kartteti tadvyatiriktasya kartturabhāvāditi bhāvaḥ yasya te jñānaprahāṇasampattī bhavataḥ | sa sarvalokottamatvālloke parama īśvaraḥ | so 'pi tadevetyāha svayaṃ rājā iti | yastayā svārthasampattyā sarvadā sarvākāraparārthakriyāyai prabhavati | sa sattvānāṃ paramaṃ prabhuḥ | so'pi tadevetyāha svayaṃ prabhuḥ iti || 47 ||

kaḥ punarasau kiṃ pañcānāṃ tathāgatānāmanyatamaḥ netyāha rāgam ityādi | rāgo 'mitābhaḥ dveṣo 'kṣobhyaḥ īrṣyā 'moghasiddhiḥ moho vairocanaḥ māno ratnasambhavaḥ | tatpade iti ṣaṣṭhyarthe saptamī | tasya svasaṃvedyasya ramyapadasya mahāsukhapadasya mahāvajradharapadasyetyarthaḥ | kalāṃ nārghanti ṣoḍaśīm iti ṣoḍaśamapyaṅgaṃ na labhanta ityarthaḥ sarvatathāgatasampadāntargatatvāditi bhāvaḥ | 
atra ca bhāvyante hi ityādinā ślokena bhāvanāyāḥ svarūpamuktam bhrāntabhāvanāparihārārtham | 
sthiracalāśceti ślokārddhena tasyālambanamuktam prādeśikatvanivṛttyartham | 
bhāvyante vai param ityādinā tasyā ākāra uktaḥ ākārāntaraparihārārtham |
teṣāmekam ityādinā ślokatrayena tasyākārasya māhātmyamuktam ādarotpādanārtham | ādaraḥsatkāro ruciḥ | rucimatī hi bhāvanā satkṛtya bhāvanā rucibalena sātatyabhāvanā'pi bhavati | tābhyāmadhigamaḥ | tadevamupāyasya samyagbhāvanoktā yā cetasaḥ samyak praṇidhānam || 48 ||

idānīṃ guruparva vaktavyaṃ tadarthaṃ satpuruṣasamāśrayaḥ | satpuruṣaḥ kalyāṇamitram samyagavavādadānasamartho gururityarthaḥ |

ato guruparva ślokadvayenāha dharmodayetyādinā | dharmā āryadharmāsteṣāmudayo 'sminniti dharmodayaḥ dharmadhāturityarthaḥ | tanmudrā'pi dharmodayaḥ dharmadhāturityarthaḥ | iha tu tatsādharmyāt padmastathoktaḥ | padme yoginastadadhimokṣasañjananārtham | tasminnudbhavo 'syeti dharmodayodbhavaṃ jñānam | kīdṛśam khasamam | kutaḥ khasamam nirābhāsatvena dvayaśūnyatāniṣṭhatvāt | kuto nirābhāsam paṭīyasi preyasi tasmin vedye pravṛttasyānubhavasya vedyāntareṣvapracārāt | tathāpi na syāt khasamam yadi manasā yadutpādyeta na caitadasti tadā tasya svayambhūtvāt uparatavyāpāre manasi tathotpatteḥ ata eva sahajaṃ taducyate | punaḥ kīdṛśam sopāyānvitam samānaścāsau tata īṣad bhedāt upāyaśca parārthasādhanātvāditi | sopāyaḥ samānasya sabhāvaḥ sapakṣavat | tatpṛṣṭhalabdhaṃ śuddhalaukikaṃ jñānamityarthaḥ | tadapi sahanamev svayambhūtvāt | tenānvitaṃ sahitam | tankiṃ kuryāditi cet bhāvayediti śeṣaḥ | 
nanu jñāndvayameva tatra jātaṃ na kācitd devatā devataiva ca mantranītau bhāvyā na ca jñānamātram ata āha trailokye ityādi | daśadiktryadhvavartināṃ buddhānāṃ kāyavākcittaguhyāni pratyekamanantāni trayo lokāḥ trayāṇāṃ lokānāṃ samāhārastrailokyaḥ mahāvajradharaḥ sa tatra jātaḥ hi yasmāt tasmāttajñānaṃ bhāvayet | kena rūpeṇa jātaḥ prajñopāyasvabhāvataḥ prajñopāyarūpeṇetyarthaḥ | prakṛṣṭaṃ jñānaṃ prajñā dharmakāya ityarthaḥ | tatprasūtayoḥ sambhoganirmāṇakāyayorabhinnaṃ rūpam | niravadhi sarvākārajagadarthasādhanasāmānyamupāyaḥ  tābhyāṃ rūpābhyāṃ jāta ityarthaḥ || 49 ||

tābhyāmapyasau kathaṃ tatra jāta ityāha śukretyādi | bhagavān iti kāyadvayasaṅgrāhaka upāyaḥ | śukrākāra iti yo 'sau dvitīyaḥ sahaja uktaḥ śukraṃ tat khasamajñānaniṣyandatvāt tadevākāro 'syeti tadākāraḥ sa eva bhagavān tenākāreṇotpanna ityarthaḥ | tatkutaḥ khasamajñānaniṣyandatvena tayorabhedāt | tatsukham iti yattat khasamamajñānamuktam tat kāminī prajñetyarthaḥ khasamajñānasāmānyena tayorabhedāt | prajñaivāstu nopāyaḥ sākāratvena vikalpatvāditi cedāha eketyāha | asāvupāya evānekaviyogālambanatvādekānekaviyogaḥ | tatkutaḥ ityāha kṣaṇādeveti tadeva khasamaṃ jñānaṃ kṣaṇaḥ sukhotsavatvāt | yasmādasau kṣaṇādeva jāto nāvidyāabalāt tasmādekānekaviyogālambanaḥ | 
ayamabhiprāyaḥ ekānekasvabhāvavirahādasanta ākārāḥ | tato vijñānaśarīrāṇāṃ sarvadharmāṇāṃ yathākāramasattaiva dvayaśūnyatā sā ca khasamena jñānena paramapadapracāreṇa sākṣād dṛṣṭā | tatastadbalabhāvinā sākāreṇa jñānena saiva paricchidyate | sākāratve 'pi yathākāramasattvena māyādivat prakhyānāt bālānāmarthābhiniveśapāṭavādarthatvenaiva dṛṣṭanīlādyākāraprakhyānavat | yathoktamavikalpapraveśāyāṃ dhāraṇyām 
jñeyanirviśiṣṭena jñānenākāśasamatalān sarvadharmān paśyati tatpṛṣṭhalabdhena māyāmarīcisvapnapratibhāsapratiśrutkā pratibimbodakacandranirmitasamān sarvadharmān paśyatīti | 
ataśca khasamajñānavat tadvupāyo 'pi paramārthadarśitatvād mahāsukhamayaḥ etadevāha aparā ratiriti dvitīyā prajñaivāsau prakṛṣṭajñānatvānmahāsukhāccetyarthaḥ || 50 ||

api ca sarvākārasarvadharmadarśanalakṣaṇānuvyañjanādisarvabuddhadharmasambhogaḥ sarvākārajagadarthakriyā ca buddhānām asatyupāye kutaḥ syāt svasaṃvedyam ityādirupasaṃhāraślokaḥ ātmanā jñāyate ityādinā sarveṇa yadktaṃ tasyopasaṃhāraḥ | 
svasaṃvedyamidaṃ jñānam iti nānyena kathyate sahajaṃ na kasminnapi labhyate iti yaduktaṃ tasyopasaṃhāraḥ| vākpathātītagocaram iti vācāṃ panthāḥ pravṛttirvākpathaḥ tasyātītagocaraṃ tadviṣayātikrāntamityarthaḥ | samagrasyotpannakramasyopasaṃhāraḥ | 
adhiṣṭhānakramo hyeṣaḥ iti sarvatathāgatakāyavākcittasaṅgrāhakaprajñopāyasvabhāvena bhagavatā vajradhareṇa yadātmasattvabhāvanalokānāṃ tādātmyādadhiṣṭhānamadhiṣṭhitaṃ tadālambano bhāvanāprakāro 'dhiṣṭhānakramaḥ | etadevāha sarvajñajñānatanmayam iti | sarvajñānāṃ sarvatathāgatānāmātmani tādātmyena saṃvedanaṃ sarvajñajñānam taskhalu vajradharatvam tatsvabhāvameva carācaraṃ viśvaṃ tanmayam | sarvajñajñānaṃ ca tanmayam ceti samāhāre dvandvaḥ ||| 51 ||

pṛthivītyādinā ślokadvayena dṛṣṭadhārmikamanuśaṃsamāha | kathaṃ pṛthivyādibhirna bādhyate yata ākāṅkṣayā pṛthivyāṃ nimajjati unmajjati tiraḥkuḍyaṃ tiraḥparvatamapyasajjamāno gacchati viṣaśastrādibhiśca na kliśyate apāmupariṣṭādadhasyācca śete niṣīdati tiṣṭhati caṅkramyate vṛṣṭyādibhiśca na kliśyate klidyate evaṃ tejovāyvākāśairyathāyogam | svaparasaṃvittivedanam iti svaparacittānyatītānāgatapratyutpannāni parijānāti | sargetyādiśloko gatārthaḥ || 52 53 ||

āgamāntarebhyo 'sya tantrasya viśeṣapradarśanāya ślokadvayaṃ samastetyādi | vedā bahiḥśāstrāṇi siddhāntāḥ śrāvakapiṭakasya sūtrāntaḥ | punarbhavasyāntare ebhiriti kṛtvā karmaprasarāḥ śāntikādayo mantranītivihitāḥ | ebhiḥ sarvaiḥ siddhirna syāt samyaksambodhirna bhavatītyarthaḥ | pāramitānītau bhavati na vetyāha bhaved ityādi | śuddhyānti kleśajñeyāvaraṇakṣayādanayeti śuddhiḥ ṣaṭpāramitālakṣaṇo mārgaḥ tayā bhavatyeva bodhiḥ kintua punarjanmabhavantare punarjanmani janmaprabandhaḥ sa eva bhavaḥ saṃsāraḥ saṃsāravad dīrghatvāt triṣu kalpāsaṅkhyeyeṣu janmaparamparetyarthaḥ  | tenāntare vyavadhāne sati bhavatītyarthaḥ | yogatantreṣvihaiva janmani bodhiruktāaḥ || 54 ||

tebhyaḥ ko 'syātiśaya ityāha na cetyādi | ihaiva janmani janmāntare vā sannihite yaduttamā bodhistantrāntare 'pi bhavati na sā tena sahajānandena vinā | asya tarhi tebhyaḥ ko viśeṣa ityāha hevajram ityādi | tantrāntarasūcitasya tasya samyak parijñānārthaṃ hevajrameva sādhakairjñātavyamityarthaḥ | idaṃ teṣāmuttaratantramiti bhāvaḥ || 55 ||

durlabhā bodhiḥ sāa kathamekena janmanā sahajānandabhāvanayā'pi sidhyatīti ced āha nadītyādi | dadyāḥsrota oghaḥ tadvat pravāho nirantaraḥ prabandhaḥ tena | dīpajyotirdīpaśikhā tasyāḥ prabandhaḥ tadvat | satataṃ nirāntaram | tattvayogaḥ sahajānandayogaḥ tena |sthātavyam ahorātram | evaṃ satyavaśyamihaiva janmani bodhiḥ sidhyatītyarthaḥ | 
mahāyoginyo nairātmyādayastāsāṃ melāpakaḥ melakaḥ kūṭāgāre sahajānande ca tadyotakaḥ paṭalaḥ ata eva yoginīcakro nāma anena śabdena khyāta ityarthaḥ || 56 ||

mahāpaṇḍitācāryaratnākaraśāntikṛtāyāṃ muktāvalyāṃ hevajrapañjikāyāṃ melāpakapaṭalaḥ aṣṭamaḥ ||

viśuddhipaṭalaḥ navamaḥ

viśuddhipaṭalamiti viśuddhyantyanayeti viśuddhiḥ yayā prakṛttya parijñātayā bhāvāḥ śudhyanti virdoṣā bhavanti parijñātuḥ sādhakasya siddhidānāt sā teṣāṃ viśuddhiḥ | taddyotakaṃ paṭalaṃ viśuddipaṭalam |

tatra vyāpinī viśuddhistathatā | prādeśikī vajrāgauryādiḥ | eatadāha sarveṣām ityādinā | devatānām iti unnatādevatetyarthaḥ || 1| |

atha kiṃ viśuddhaṃ kathaṃ vā viśuddham ityātrāha ṣaḍindriyam ityādi | svabhāvena iti prakṛtyā | 
yadi sarvaṃ prakṛtyaiva śuddham vyarthastarhi śuddhaye yatna ityatrāha ajñānetyādi | akliṣṭamajñānaṃ jñeyāvaraṇam kleśā rāgādayaḥ kleśāvaraṇam tairāvṛtaṃ malinīkṛtaṃ viśodhyate teṣāmevāgantukānāṃ malānāmapakarṣaṇāt malāpakarṣaṇārthaḥ prayatnenāpūrvasvabhāvotpādanārtha ityarthaḥ || 2 ||

yā tarhi tathatātmikā devatātmikā ca śuddhirvastūnāmuktā kīdṛśī sā  ityāha svasaṃvedyetyādi | svasaṃvedyamaṣṭame paṭale vyākhyātam tadrūpataiva śuddhirityarthaḥ | kuta ityāha netyādi | yasmāt svasaṃvedyādanyayā śuddhyā na viśeṣeṇa mucyate savāsanasarvāvaraṇaviśuddhyā na viśuddhyatītyarthaḥ | sā tarhi śuddhiḥ phalabhūtā cirakālabhāvitena mārgeṇa labhyā | nāsau prāgiti katham prakṛtyaiva sarvaśuddham | ata āha viṣayāṇāmityādi | viṣayā indriyādayaḥ svasvajñānālambanatvāt | teṣāṃ svasaṃvedyaṃ sukhaṃ paraṃ paramārtha ityarthaḥ |

kuta ityāha śuddhabhāvatvāditi | śuddhāśca te dvayaśūnyatāsvarūpasaṃvedakatvena śūnyatānubhavarūpatvāt bhāvāśca cittotpādarūpatvāditi śuddhasvabhāvāḥ | tadbhāvastattvaṃ tasmāt śūnyatānubhavasāmānyena phalabhūtāt svasaṃvedyasukhāt sarveṣāṃ jñeyānāmabhedāditi bhāvaḥ | ata eva śūnyatāṃśena tathataiva tattvaṃ bhāvānām | śūnyatānubhavāṃśena yoginīcakram | ālambanabhedānubhavabheedo yoginībhedaḥ pratyekamālambanānāṃ tattvam || 3 ||

yaistarhi nīlapītādibhirākārairyoginīnāṃ bhāvāḥ pratibhānti te kathaṃ viśuddhā itya āha rūpetyādi | rūpaviṣayādīti rūpadāyo viṣayāḥ | anye iti tathatātatsaṃvedanābhyāṃ vilakṣaṇā ityarthaḥ | śuddhabhāvā hīti viśuddhasvabhāvā eva | kutaḥ yasmād buddhamayaṃ jagat | 
tathāhi sarvatāthāgataiḥ kāyavākcittaguhyairyathākramaṃ sarvarūpam sarvaḥ śabdaḥ sarvaśc cittaparispando 'nugataḥ tathāgataguhyanirdeśasūtre tathā vacanāt || 4 ||

yadi te 'pi tathāgataguhyānugatatvena viśuddhāstadā na kiñcidaśuddhamiti matvā pṛcchati he bhagavannityādi | kasmād iti kenākāreṇa || 5 ||

gandhaṃ vettīti sambandhaḥ | svādanaṃ rasam | vastuśabdo viṣayavācī pāriśeṣyāt spraṣṭavye vartate | āpnute iti gṛhṇāti | yadyaśuddhā na tarhi sevitavyā ityata āha sevitavyā ityādi sevyāḥ iti sevārhāḥ ye kalpikāḥ ityarthaḥ || 6   7 ||

ataḥ paraṃ devībhedena pratyekaviśuddhim āha rūpaskandhe ityādinā | viśuddhyā tviti parijñātayeti śeṣaḥ | ata evāha tattvayoginaḥ iti || 8  9 ||

aiśāna ityādinā bāhyapuṭamārabhate | nanu garbhapuṭe gaurī paṭhitā saiva kathaṃ bāhyapuṭe 'pi paṭhyata itāha paścād ityādi | apareti anyā nāmnaiva tulyaṃ svarūpaṃ tu bhinnamanayouriti bhāvaḥ || 10 ||

dvidevate iti dve devyāvityarthaḥ | sthānabhedo devībhedaparijñānārthamuktaḥ viśuddhirupatā punarāsāṃ noktā tāmāha rūpe ityādinā | ṣaḍimāḥ ṣaṇṇāṃ viṣayāṇāṃ viśuddhaya ityarthaḥ || 12  13 ||

bhujānām ityādinā ṣoḍaśabhujasya hevajrasya bhujādiviśuddhimāha | ṣoḍaśānāṃ bhujānāṃ viśuddhistattvaṃ ṣoḍaśa śūnyatāḥ tadyathā adhyātmaśūnyātā bahirdhāśūnyatā adhyātmabahirdhāśūnyatā śūnyatāśūnyatā mahāśunyatā paramārthaśūnyatā saṃskṛtaśūnyatā asaṃskṛtaśūnyatā atyantaśūnyatā anavarāgraśūnyatā anavakāraśūnyatā prakṛtiśūnyatā svalakṣaṇaśūnyatā sarvadharmaśūnyatā abhāvaśūnyatā abhāvasvabhāvaśūnyatā tā eva bhujīkṛtā ityarthaḥ | 
māraśuddhitaḥ iti catvāraścaraṇāḥ caturṇāṃ mārāṇāṃ bhaṅgā ityarthaḥ | mukheti mukhānām trivajriṇeti kāyavākcittavajraiḥ | bhedavivakṣāyāṃ tṛtīyā || 15 ||

pṛthivītyādi pṛthivyādīnāṃ viśuddhiḥ pukkasyādirityarthaḥ || 16 ||

dveṣeityādi cakrīti cakrādhipatiḥ | dveṣādīnāṃ kleśopakleśānāṃ viśuddhirnairātmyādipañcakamityarthaḥ || 17 ||

ata evāha dveṣādīnāṃ viśodhanam iti | etena iti nairātmyādipañcakena | skandha iti pariśiṣṭo rūpaskandhaḥ cakṣurādipañcakamityarthaḥ | mana indriyasyāpi viśuddhirnairātmyā | evamutpattipakṣe | vicitrādiśuddhiruktā || 18 ||

utpannakrame tāmekarasāmāha yena tu iti | yena yenaiva rūpādinā loko badhyate tena tenaivāhaṃ bandhanaṃ muñcāmi na devatādyākārabhāvanayetibhāvaḥ | lokastāvat kathaṃ badhyata ityāha loka ityādi | muhyati abhūtaṃ dvayaṃ kalpayati | vetti na tattvaṃ bhūtamadvayaṃ na jānāti | tattvavivarjitaḥ paramārthabhāvanārahitaḥ | siddhiṃ muktiṃ na labhate || 19 ||

tvaṃ tarhi kathamucyase ityāha tasmāt ityādi | tasmādahaṃ śuddhasahāva iti advayaprakāśamātraṃ jaganmanye jagat paśyāmi | katham yato rūpādiviṣayaṣaṭkaṃ na manye nopalabhe | na ca citteti cittaṃ vijñānaṣaṭkaṃ grāhakam tacca nopalabhe | kiṃ tarhi tava prakhyāti viśuddhiḥ svasaṃvedyaṃ sukhamanantamanābhāsamityarthaḥ | naitāvatā'pi viśuddhirindriyabhrāntisadbhāvāditi cet āha sarvaviśuddhyā iti indriyaṣaṭkasyāpi mayā'nupalambhādityarthaḥ | tathāpi jagad dṛśyatvaṃ tasya draṣṭeti dvayaprakhyānāt | kathaṃ viśuddhirityata āha jaga iti jagadātmakaḥ san paśyāmītyarthaḥ | anantanirābhāsaprakāśamātrarūpeṇaiva pariśiṣṭena jagadātmano mama prakhyānāditi bhāvaḥ | evaṃ tattvabhāvanayā'haṃ bandhanaṃ muñcāmīti śeṣaḥ | viśuddhidyotakaḥ paṭalo viśuddhipaṭalaḥ || 20 ||

mahāpaṇḍitācāryaratnākaraśāntikṛtāyāṃ muktāvalyāṃ hevajrapañjikāyāṃ viśuddhipaṭalaḥ navamaḥ ||

abhiṣekapaṭalaḥ daśamaḥ

śiṣyābhiṣeko vaktavyaḥ | sa ca lekhyamaṇḍale dātavyaḥ tenāha athātaḥ ityādi | yathā iti aviparītam kramam iti vidhiḥ | yena śiṣyo 'bhiṣicyate so 'pi vidhiḥ pravakṣyate iti yojyam || 1 ||

devatātmakaḥ iti svadevatāyoge sthitaḥ | hūṃvajrīkṛtya iti devatāpaṭaloktena krameṇa bodhisattvāḥ hevajrādayaḥ || 2 ||

āgāraṃ gṛham | likhyate aneneti lekhaḥ rajaścāsau lekhaśceti rajolekhaḥ | sa ca divyo viśiṣṭānāṃ ratnānām madhyamo hīnānām | taṇḍulādibhiḥ iti śālitaṇḍulakhaṭikādīnām || 3  4 ||

trayetyādi aṅguṣṭhatrayādhikaṃ ca tadityarthaḥ | iti maṇḍaloddeśaḥ | paścādasya nirdeśo bhaviṣyati | abhiṣekaṃ prastuvannāha vidyā ityādi | praveṣṭavyā iti praveśayitavyā | divyā iti uttamā || 5 ||

athavā iti yadyaśaktaḥ tadā yathālabdhām anyāmapi praveśayet | ṣoḍaśābdām iti yauvanasya prādhānyāt | tathaiva ca iti aśaktau viṃśatyabdikāmapi | mukhabandha ubhayoradarśanārthaḥ || 6  7 ||

śiṣyagocaram iti śiṣyasaṃvedyam | kiṃ teneti ced āha svasaṃvedyād iti | tata eva samarasād bhāvitāt | jñānam iti phalabhūtaṃ mahābodhiśabdavācyam anupalakṣitasya paścād bhāvanā'nupapattau siddhyayogāditi bhāvaḥ | tadeva phalabhūtaṃ jñānaṃ svaparetyādinā viśinaṣṭi | svaparabhedenopalabdhiḥ tayā varjitam || 8 ||

khasama iti ākāśasadṛśanirābhāsaprakāśarūpeṇa samarasena svaparayoḥ prakhyānāt | virajam kleśānāṃ prahāṇāt | śūnyaṃ grāhyapratibhāsānāmastaṅgamāt | bhāvo yoginaḥ śarīram abhāvastasyaiva vedanādayo grāhakākārāḥ tāvātmā'syeti tathoktaḥ tayorapi tenaiva prakāśātmanā prakhyānādādhyātmikenākārabhedenāstaṅgamāt | param iti kevalam tanmātrasya prakhyānāt |

athavā param iti paramārthaḥ prapañcasyāparamārthatvāt | upāyaḥ karuṇā sarvasattveṣvātmasamatānubhavaḥ | sarvadharmeṣu dvayaśūnyatādarśanaṃ prajñā | tābhyāṃ vyatimiśram sattvāsattvānāmekarasena prakāśātmanā prakhyānāt |  rāgārāgavimiśritaṃ tayorapi tathaiva prakhyānāt | tatrādvayajñānasahajaṃ mahāsukhaṃ rāgaḥ arāgastathatā || 9 ||

prāṇaḥ iti jīvaḥ tadviyoge nirjīvatvāt | paramākṣaraḥ anādinidhanatvāt | vyāpī vijñaptimātratvād dharmāṇām | sarvadehe vyavasthitaḥ iti vijñānādhiṣṭhatatvājjīvadehānām || 10 ||

tata eva viśvotpattistadātmakakleśakarmodbhavatvādityetadāha bhāveityādinā | bhāvaḥ iti śarīram abhāvo vedanādiḥ | anyāni ṣaḍindriyāṇi | yāni tāni iti bāhyā bhāvāḥ sthiracalāḥ || 11 ||

tīrthikairapi sa evātmāditvena kalpita ityetadāha sarvam ityādinā | sarvaṃ vijñānamityaupaniṣadikāḥ cidrūpaḥ puruṣa iti sāṃkhyāḥ punaḥ punargatiṣu layanāt pudgala ityeke pudgalavādinaḥ nityānityajñānaḥ pumān īśvara itīti īśvaravādinaḥ ātmaiva jāyate jīvati mriyate badhyate mucyate cetyātmavādinaḥ | evaṃ jīva iti digambarāḥ evaṃ sattva iti sattvavādinaḥ kālaḥ saṃharati prajā iti kālavādinaḥ pūryate karmabhiḥ galati teṣāmeva nirjaraṇādevaṃ pudgala ityapare pudgalavādinaḥ | sarvabhāvā lokasiddhā āgamasiddhāśca | tatsvabhāvaḥ sausaṃsthitaḥ saṃvṛtyā sthitaḥ kalpanābhedena tathā tathā prakhyānāt | māyārūpī ca iti vicitrasvarūpanirmāteva || 12 ||

tatpunaḥ samarasaṃ kathaṃ śiṣyagocaraṃ karttavyamityata āha prathametyādi | prathamaṃ ānandamātram iti nirviśeṣeṇa ānandaḥ | dvisaṃkhyataḥ iti dvitīyam | viramākhyam iti viramānandaḥ chāndaso hrasvaḥ | evaṃ śiṣyagocarīkarttavye sahajānanda eva samarasādiśabdena kṣaṇabhedena ca nirdiṣṭaḥ || 13 ||

tasyāṃ pariṣadi yad vṛttaṃ tadāha evam ityādinā | patiteti patitāḥ | vismayaḥ saṃśayaḥ || 14 ||

tatkathamāpannā ityata āha prathametyādi | jagadrūpaṃ jagadvedyatvāt paramānandaścaiveti sambandhaḥ | evakāro 'vadhāraṇārthaḥ | trividha evānandaḥ paripāṭyā jagadvedyaḥ | tata ūrdhvamānandābhāvāt | na vidyate sahajaṃ triṣu iti nāpyeteṣveva triṣu sahajamasti saṃvedyate vā vilakṣaṇatvādityarthaḥ | itiśabdaḥ saṅgītikārasya evaṃ saṃśayamāpannā ityarthaḥ || 15 ||

bhagavān ityādiślokaḥ saṅgītikārasya | sarvabuddhaiḥ saha ekavigraho 'bhinnaśarīraḥ | apanīyate 'nenetyapanayaḥ | utkṛṣṭatvād divyam | bodhaye iti niścayāya || 16 ||

kimāha na ityādi | rāgaḥ paramānandaḥ utpitsuphalābhilāṣatvāt tadasau nopalabhyate sambodhirūpeṇa | virāgo viramānandaḥ phalavināśatvāt tataḥ so 'pi sambodhirūpeṇa nopalabhyate | madhyamā sukhāvasthā prathamānandaḥ | madhyamānandamātraṃ tu ityaṣṭame he ta 1|8|34 eva vacanāt | sa kathaṃ madhyamaḥ hīnatvāt loke hi kāṅkṣāhīnamapi madhyamamityucyate tad yathā madhyamā vārttā madhyamaṃ śarīramiti sāpi prathamānandarūpā madhyamā sambodhirūpeṇa nopalabhyate tathāhi rāgavirāgau bodhī phalālambanatvānna tu sambodhī | madhyamā tu bodhirapi na bhavati sparśālambanatvāt | tathā ca ṣoḍaśe vakṣyati āḍaṇa antaṇa majja ṇa u nādirnānto na ca madhya ityarthaḥ | evameṣāṃ trayāṇām kṣaṇānāṃ varjanādeva ebhyo 'nyatayaiva sahaja ānadaḥ parijñāto bhavati | phalena svabhāvabhūtena sadotpatteḥ sa ca sambodhirucyate | samyaksammukhaṃ ca phalasya bodhaḥ sambodhiriti kṛtvā |

kathametāvataiva parijñāto bhavati yasmādutpitsuphalābhilāṣaḥ paramānandaḥ phalavināśalakṣaṇo viramānandaḥ | tadasāvanayoreva madhyavartīti sujātametat | lakṣaṇaṃ tu tasya sahajādiśabdaireva svākhyātam | trayāṇāṃ varjanād ityuktam tadayuktam

anādinidhano hi dharmakāyaḥ sambodhiḥ sa eva sahajānandaḥ || 17 ||

sa kathaṃ triṣvānandeṣu nāstītyata āha athaveityādi | athavā iti kenacit paryāyeṇa sarvātmakaḥ saiva iti sahajānandaḥ sarvātmaka eva triṣvādeṣvanugata eva sukhasāmānyena dvayaśūnyatānubhavasāmānyena cetyarthaḥ | athavā iti apareṇa paryāyeṇa sarvairvivarjitaḥ tribhirānandaiḥ parihṛtaḥ svasaṃvedyena viśeṣakṣaṇena teṣvananugatatvāt | etadeva viśeṣaṇamāśritya etaduktaṃ trayāṇāṃ varjanāditi | tata idaṃ nāyuktamuktam | 
iyatā svākhyānamapi sahajānandamuttānīkartumāha virametyādi | viramānandāt pūrvam | tatkiṃ paramānanda evāsau netyāha ānandatrayavarjitam iti | arthāduktaṃ bhavati paramānandādūrdhvamiti | tathāhi ṣoḍaśe vakṣyati 
paramāntaṃ madhyaviramam iti | paramānandāt paraṃ viramānandāpekṣayā madhyamamityarthaḥ | trayodaśe tu sphuṭameva vakṣyati 
sahajānandasvabhāvo 'haṃ paramāntaṃ viramādikam iti | tadanena sarveṇaitaduktaṃ bhavati paramānandastasya prayogaśīrṣam viramānandastu tatpṛṣṭhabhāvī smārto vikalpaḥ tayorantarāle maulamanālambanaṃ viṣprapañcasukhaṃ sahajānanda iti || 18 ||

evaṃ samyagupalakṣite sahajānande tameva bhāvayataḥ krameṇa meghopamamāyopamasvapnopamasvapnajāgaropamākhyāścatvāraḥ samādhayo bhavanti tāneva ślokenāha prathamam ityādinā | yāvat saṃyogabhāvanayā saha bhāvyamānaḥ sahajo na sākṣād bhavati tāvadasau meghacchannavad bhāti tatra meghacchannapūrṇacandravad bhātītyarthaḥ | yadā tu sākṣād bhavati tadā siddhaḥ | siddhe sati māyāvad bhavet manonirmitavidyābalena sākṣād bhāvāt | tata ūrdhvaṃ sahasā svapnavad bhāti | saṃyogabhāvanāmapāsya tameva kevalaṃ yathopadeśaṃ bhāvayato yoganidrāṃ gatasya yogino 'kasmāttasya pratyakṣībhāvāt | tata ūrdhvaṃ svapijāgradabhedavad bhāti svapnajāgarābhyāmaviśiṣṭamityarthaḥ | 
kathaṃ jāgarādaviśiṣṭam dehadvayaparirambhaprativedhādisambhavāt | kathaṃ svapnādaviśiṣṭam satāmapi teṣāmanupalambhena kevalasahajabhāvanayā tasya pratyakṣībhāvāt || 19 ||

evaṃ catuḥsamādhipariniṣpattau kathaṃ yogī sidhyatītyāha abhedetyādi | abhedaḥ svapnajāgarābhyāmaviśeṣaḥ  tena lakṣaṇā sahajabhāvanā tayā siddhiḥ sahajasākṣātkriyā tasyāmavasthito yogī siddhyati mahāmudrāsiddhyā | kīdṛśaḥ mudrāyogī adhikṛtabāhyavidyāsaṃyuktaḥ | mahāmudrāsiddhau lakṣaṇāsiddheḥ pradhānakāraṇatvāt mudrāyogasya ca tatsahakāritvāt | sa hyatra samayaḥ | vidyāpuruṣasiddhiśca mahāmudrāsiddhiriti | nāsau kulavidyayā vinā syāt |

prathamasamādhitraye tu sā neṣyate tadānīṃ vikṣepakāraṇatvāttasyāḥ | iti iti evamabhiṣekā dātavyāḥ | evaṃ ca mudrāyogī sidhyati | ityanena prayojanena śiṣyābhiṣekāya siddhisādhanāya cetyarthaḥ | āha maṇḍalam iti samayamaṇḍalaṃ sādhanamaṇḍalaṃ ca deśitavānityarthaḥ | maṇḍalasya viśeṣaṇaṃ catuṣkoṇam ityādi | sarvaṃ sugamam || 20 ||

dadyāt iti vinyaset || 23 ||

cakreśasya ityādinā pūrvasevāmāha | māṇḍaleyasya iti māṇḍaleyānāṃ pratyekam | pūrvoktana iti om rakṣa hūṃ 3 phaṭ svāhetyanena || 25 ||

prāg iti śodhanāt pūrvam | akārādimantrataḥ iti akāro mukhaṃ sarvadharmāṇāmādyanutpannatvāt om āḥ hūṃ phaṭ svāhā ityanena mantreṇetyarthaḥ | rakṣām iti prākārapañjarādikām | atra ca iti lekhye 'pi || 26 ||

pūjābhyarthanā ca iti guroḥ | atra iti likhitādhāramaṇḍale || 27 ||

dṛḍhaṃ cittaṃ vajrasattvaṃ tena kṛtāṭopaḥ | kṛtamālīḍheti kṛtālīḍhaḥ | pādayoḥ iti jaṅghābhyām | maṇḍaleti maṇḍalam || 30 ||

paścāt tattvam iti utpattikramayogināṃ varṇātītasamādhisaṅgṛhītam | utpannakramayogināṃ tu tadeva yogaśarīraṃ samayamātramanyad | viśuddhaṃ nimittamalānāmastaṅgamāt | jñānarūpiṇam advayajñānarūpaṃ bimbam | saṃsāravyavadānena iti saṃkleśavyavadānayornāstibhedo yatra jñāna iti śeṣaḥ bhedakasya pratibhāsanānātvasyāstamayāditi bhāvaḥ || 32 ||

etadeva spaṣṭīkartuṃ gāthādvayamāha parametyādi | paramaratiḥ paramā prajñā niṣprapañcajñānam tasyāṃ bhāvyamadvayaṃ vijñaptimātraṃ na bhāvakāccittādanyad bhāti | bhāvakamapi cittaṃ na tasmād bhāvyādanyad bhāti ubhayorabhedena prakhyānāt | na ca vigraheti yoginaḥ svaśarīramapi na khyāti | na ca grāhyeti paraśarīrendriyāṇi sthāvarāṇi ca | na grāhaketi svendriyāṇi ca | eṣāṃ khyātau sutarāmātmādi na khyāti | tataśca na ghṛṇā viṣṭhādiviṣayā | na ca moha ātmātmīyādiviṣayaḥ | na śaucapavitram iti na jalasekādikam nāpi jalādikaṃ khyātītyarthaḥ || 33 ||

na rāgādayaḥ teṣām āśrayālambanayorayoniśomanasikārasya cānupalambhāt | evaṃ kleśāvaraṇapratipakṣamuktvā jñeyāvaraṇamāha na dṛśyam ityādinā | dṛśyaṃ jñeyaṃ na khyāti | 
bhāva na bhāvaka iti na vikalpo nāpi vikalpahetuśabdaḥ khyāti | na śatru na mitram iti | na pāpamitram kīdṛśaṃ tīrthikādi nāpi kalyāṇāmitraṃ gurubuddhādikaṃ prakhyāti | kimetadityāha nistaraṅga ityādi | taraṅgā vikalpāścalātvāt tatkṣayānnistaraṅgam | sahajākhya iti sahajaṃ prakṛtiḥ sarvabhāvānām | iha tu sahajālambanatvāt sahajanirābhāsamanantaṃ jñānam | citro nānāprakāro nāmanimittapratibhāsaḥ tasyāstaṅgamād vicitram ekarasā sa iti || 34 ||

iti evamukte nirābhāsaprakāśamātre tattve bhagavatā etadeva paramaṃ tattvaṃ tattvamātramanyaditi khyāpayitum āha iti pṛṣṭavān vajragarbhaḥ | kim āhetyādi | kasmād ityādi | bhūtātmakaṃ deham anantaroktena nyāyena | ādāvevāsvabhāvakam alīkam tat tasmāt prakṛtipariśuddhaṃ vā'nyatra uktamiti praśnārthaḥ || 35 ||

tatra iti tasmin praśne uttaram āha bhagavān | kimāha nistaraṅgetyādi nistaraṅgaprakāśarūpeṇa dehaḥ śuddho na bālagrāhyeṇa rūpeṇetyuttarārthaḥ | svarūpeṇāpi dehaḥ paramaṃ tattvaṃ caturānandasaṅgṛhītapañcamahābhūtamayatvādityeke || 36 ||

tannirāsāya punaḥ pṛcchati 
he bhagavan ityādi | skandhaḥ śarīram sa kenākāreṇa mahābhautikaḥ caturānandamayatvenaiveti bhāvaḥ || 37 ||

bhagavān iti viditābhiprāyo vajrī | sparśād iti āliṅganādeḥ | spṛśyamānaṃ kāṭhinyameva dharmaḥ svabhāvo lakṣaṇam tena | tatra iti ānandakṣaṇe | 38 ||

abdhātośca iti sahajānandakṣaṇe | gharṣaṇād iti paramānandakṣaṇe | gamanād iti viramānandakṣaṇe || 39 ||

saukhyam iti caturṣvāryānandeṣu | kathaṃ saukhyamākāśadhātuḥ arūpitvāt | ebhiḥ pañcabhirmahābhūtaiḥ pariveṣṭitaḥ parighaṭitaḥ skandhaḥ | tasmānmahābhautikamityuttarārthaḥ | 
evamukte pare manyeran asmanmatameva bhagavatoktam mahacchabdaprayogād mahadbhūtaṃ mahābhūtaṃ paramaṃ tattvamityarthaḥ | atastannirāsāya svayameva bhagavānāha tasmād ityādi | na tattvākhyam iti na mukhyaṃ tattvam | etaduktaṃ bhavati ānandā api na tattvaṃ kiṃ punastatsahajāḥ pṛthivyādaya iti | kutaḥ ityāha mahābhūtaṃ yataḥ sukhamiti | 
ayamabhiprāyaḥ nātra bhūtaśabdastattvārthaḥ kiṃ tarhi bhūtamutpannam utpattiśca nāhetukā nāpyekahetuketi saṃskṛtārtho bhūtaśabdaḥ | sambhūya hetupratyayaiḥ kṛtaṃ saṃskṛtam yacca saṃskṛtaṃ tadanityam | mahāśabdastu prakarṣārthaḥ | tasmādatīva bahuyatnasādhyam atīva cānityamityayamatra mahābhūtaśabdārthaḥ | tathā ca sati yata idaṃ saukhyaṃ mahābhūtam ata eva na tattvamiti |
tatkiṃ sahajānando 'pyanena ninditaḥ satyaṃ ninditaḥ | prāk tarhi kuto bahu varṇitaḥ paramasahajaṃ pratidṛṣṭāntatvena sahajasāmānyena prāg varṇitaḥ | dvividhaṃ hi sahajamkādācitkaṃ śāśvataṃ ca | yacchāśvataṃ tat paramam | tadeva paramaṃ tattvamakṣayatvāvyayatvāt || 40 ||

etadākhyātumāha sahajābhyām ityādi | sahajābhyāṃ prajñopāyābhyām na tu bāhyābhyām | yad iti yat sukham | sahajaṃ tad iti tat paramaṃ sahajam | kuta ityāha svabhāvam ityādi | svata eva bhāva upādānacittakṣaṇādeva kṣaṇāntaranirapekṣādutpattirasyeti svabhāvam | yad īdṛśaṃ tat sahajam uttarottaracittakṣaṇaiḥ sahaiva yāvadākāśaṃ jāyata iti kṛtvā | katamadityāha sarvetyādi sarvadharmāṇāmākāraḥ pratibhāsamātratayā pratibhāsanamasminniti sarvākāram ekam ekarasam dvayasaṅgṛhītānāṃ pratibhāsānām astaṅgamāt sammukhaṃ varaṃ śreṣṭham yathoktam praśāntamacalaṃ śreṣṭhaṃ vaśavarti samāsamam | nirvikalpaṃ sukham | iti | sacca tad varaṃ ca ekaṃ ca tat saṃvaraṃ ca sarvākāraṃ ca tadeva saṃvaraṃ ceti sarvākāraikasaṃvaram | sahajābhyāmityuktam || 41 ||

kau punaḥ prajñopāyau sahajāvityāha kṛpetyādi | sarvasattveṣvātmasamatāpratyavekṣaṇaṃ kṛpā sa upāyaḥ sa ca yogī yogidharmatvāt | mudrā prajñā so 'pi yogī pūrvavat | sarvadharmaprakāśamātratāpratyavekṣaṇaṃ prajñā | tat katham hetuviyogataḥ hetavo nimittāni dvayasaṅgṛhītāḥ pratibhāsāḥ teṣāṃ viyogena astaṅgamena nirābhāsīkṛtyetyarthaḥ | imau prajñopāyau bhāvanābalaniṣpannau sahajau punaryatnānapekṣatvāt tābhyāmutpannaṃ sarvākāraikasaṃvaraṃ sahajam | 
tadeva nirālambanaṃ bodhicittaṃ sphuṭīkartumāha śūnyatetyādi | sarvadharmeṣu dvayaśūnyatā'nubhavo nirābhāsaḥ śūnyatā śūnyatayaiva sarvasattveṣvātmasamatā'nubhavaḥ sahajasukhasaṃyojanaḥ karuṇā tābhyāṃ bhinnaṃ miśraṃ saṃyuktaṃ cittaṃ bodhicittam | 
idaṃ tad paramaṃ tattvaṃ viśuddhaṃ jñānarūpiṇam | mahāvajradharasvabhāvaṃ dārṣṭāntikam tadvadeva dṛṣṭānte 'pi bhaktiḥ karaṇīyā tatsiddhāvupāyatvāt samayatvācca || 42 ||

athaitat kevalamutpannakramayogī bhāvayan mantrajapādikaṃ kuryānnavetyata āha na mantretyādi | mantraḥ praṇavādiḥ tasya jāpo jalpanam | tapo 'vadyaviratitricelaparivarttādi | agnau ghṛtādīnāṃ havanaṃ homaḥ | hevajravajrāgauryādayo devatādehā māṇḍaleyāḥ | maṇḍalaṃ kūṭāgāraṃ | mantrajāpādi phalaṃ tarhi tasya yogino na syāditi cedāha sa ityādi | sa iti tadeva bodhicittam | 
tathāhi tadeva tattvārthamananājjagattrāṇācca mantraḥ prābandhikatvājjāpaḥ dhyānasaṃvareṇa anāsravasaṃvareṇa karuṇayā ca yogādavadyaviratiḥ ata eva tricelaparivartanaṃ kleśavikalpanimittamalānāmapakarṣaṇāt trisnānam | niṣprapañcajñānānalarūpatvāt kleśamalavikalpadahanācca tadeva homaḥ | bodhicittameva hevajraḥ tadeva prajñātmakatvād yoginīcakram tasmāttanmāṇḍaleyāḥ | teṣāmādhāraḥ samādhiḥ sthitihetutvāt sa ca cittadharmaḥ tasmāt tanmaṇḍalaṃ ca || 43 ||

samāsataḥ ityādirekapadī gāthā tayā pūrvaślokārthamupasaṃharati samāsata iti | uktena nyāyena mantrajāpādisarvānuṣṭheyasaṅgrahataḥ | cittasamājarūpī bhavediti śeṣaḥ | cittaṃ yathoktaṃ bodhicittam tadeva samājaḥ sarvadharmāṇāmekarasaṃ mīlanam tadrūpī bhaved yogī tadvyatiriktasyātmano 'nupalambhāt | ayamasya paramo 'bhiṣekaḥ kleśavikalpanimittamalānāṃ sākṣādanena kṣālanāt | abhiṣekadyotakaḥ paṭalo 'bhiṣekapaṭalaḥ || 44 ||

mahāpaṇḍitācāryaratnākaraśāntikṛtāyāṃ muktāvalyāṃ hevajrapañjikāyām abhiṣekapaṭalaḥ daśamaḥ ||

dṛṣṭipaṭalaḥ ekādaśaḥ vajragarbhābhisambodhiśca

śāsane sattvānāmavatāraṇāya catasro dṛṣṭayaḥ pātanā vaśyā ākṛṣṭiḥ stambhanā ceti | āsāṃ yathākramaṃ caturbhiḥ ślokārddhairlakṣaṇāni | tatra yā sammukhaprekṣaṇī krodharasā puttalībhyāṃ lalāṭāśritā sā pātanā yā vāmāśritābhyāṃ vāmaprekṣiṇī sā vaśyā yā ūrdhvāśritābhyāṃ dakṣiṇaprekṣiṇī sā ākṛṣṭiḥ yā tu nāsājaḍāśritābhyāṃ sammukhaprekṣiṇī sā stambhanā || 1  2 ||

nāsāśvāso nirgacchan recakaḥ praviśan pūrakaḥ pūritābhyantaraḥ kumbhakaḥ praviśya niścalībhūtaḥ praśāntaḥ || 3 ||

āsāmabhyāsāya yathākramaṃ catvāri lakṣaṇāni | sarasadrumaḥ kusumaṃ snuhītaruḥ pracalatṛṇaṃ ca || 4 ||

bhrāntiḥ saṃśayaḥ | buddharddhayo buddhādhiṣṭhānāni || 5 ||

nirantarāṇāṃ manuṣyajanmanāṃ saptānāmante vartamānaḥ saptāvartaḥ || 9 ||

viramānandasya dūṣakī bādhakī | susvaratvādīni pañcalakṣaṇāni || 10 ||

vaśyakarmaṇi kurukullā viśiṣyate | sā ca bhagavatī tāraiva | kīdṛśaṃ sādhanam saṃkṣiptam yat pūrvamuddiṣṭam | utkarṣeṇoktam | kvoktam dvādaśabhiḥ kalpairvistīrṇaṃ hevajratantre || 12 ||

iṣuḥ śaraḥ kārmukaṃ dhanuḥ sarvaṃ raktavarṇam || 13 ||

dṛṣṭipaṭalaḥ ekādaśaḥ ||

vajro vajradharaḥ tasya garbho hṛdayaṃ hevajraḥ tasyābhisambodhidyotakaḥ kalparājaḥ |

mahāpaṇḍitācāryaratnākaraśāntikṛtāyāṃ muktāvalyāṃ hevajrapañjikāyāṃ dṛṣṭipaṭalaḥ ekādaśaḥ vajragarbhābhisambodhiśca prathamaḥ kalparājaḥ samāptaḥ ||

dvitīyaḥ kalparājaḥ
homanirṇayapratiṣṭhāpaṭalaḥ prathamaḥ

pratimāsu devatānāmavasthānaṃ pratiṣṭhā | tasyā lakṣaṇaṃ svarūpam | vajrāṇi sarvabuddhānāṃ trīṇi guhyāni teṣāṃ sāraḥ sa ātmā yasya sa tathoktaḥ || 1 ||

homamiti vighnaghāntārthaḥ | pradoṣo rātrerārambhaḥ kṛtvā'dhivāsanādividhinetyarthaḥ || 2 ||

om ityādinā pūjāmantrānāha || 4 ||

nānā iti nānāprakārāt | pūrvatantreti vacanam asyottaratantratvāt || 5 ||

prasaṅgāt sarvahomānāha śāntikam ityādinā | atraiveti eṣveva triṣu yathāyogam || 6 ||

ekahastam ūrdhvam ardhahastam adhaḥ || 7 ||

śuklavarṇamiti sarvaśuklam | dveṣādau iti vidveṣaṇoccāṭanādayaḥ krūravidhayaḥ || 8  9 ||

hotavyamāha tilam ityādinā | 10 ||

tvaṃ devi iti pṛthivyā āvāhanamantro mantraprastāvāduktaḥ || 12 ||

arghādimantro 'gneḥ || 14 ||

mahāpaṇḍitācāryaratnākaraśāntikṛtāyāṃ muktāvalyāṃ hevajrapañjikāyāṃ dvitīyakalpe homanirṇayapratiṣṭhāpaṭalaḥ prathamaḥ ||

siddhinirṇayo nāma dvitīyaḥ paṭalaḥ

vajragarbha āha iti papraccha gaganavadityādi | yathā hyākāśamanādi tathaiva sarvasattvānāmakuśalāvyākṛtā dharmā āvaraṇasaṃgṛhītāḥ teṣāṃ pratipakṣaḥ svādhidaivatabhāvanā | ataśca sāgaropame vipakṣarāśau tumbikāsadṛśaḥ | pratipakṣo na paryāptaḥ sattvānāṃ tasmāduttāraṇāya tatkathaṃ te tadbhāvanāyāṃ sidhyantīti praśnārtham |

atrottaraṃ bhagavānāha nairātmanītyādi | yathā hi girigahvare sakṛtkṛtastailapradyotaścirakālasañcitaṃ tamaḥskandhaṃ kṣaṇāt kṣipati evamayamanāsravo mārgaḥ sakṛdutpanno 'nādikālopacitaṃ vipakṣarāśiṃ tatkṣaṇamayo 'syatīti bhāvaḥ | sa eva tarhi lokottaro mārgaḥ kathamacirājjāyata iti cet yogaviśeṣāt | tatra yogasyālambanaviśeṣa ātmaiva ākāraviśeṣo nairātmyayoginī heruko vā || 1  2 ||

bhāvanāviśeṣaḥ kṣaṇanairantaryam | ādau kathaṃ kṣaṇanairantaryamiti ced āha prathametyādi || 3 ||

niśākāla iti suptajane kāle | siddho 'hamiti adhimuktiviśeṣaḥ | yoginīm iti nairātmyām | evaṃ viśīthe samāhitayoga uktaḥ || 4 ||

jāgrajjane tu kāle nirantaramasamāhitayogamāha aṅghrītyādi | ācamanniti dīrgho na kṛtaḥ | pūgeti vibhakterluk | sevayediti ārādhayet | kathamityāha yoginīmityādi || 5  6 ||

kṣaṇamapītyāderayamarthaḥ | nairātmyāvilakṣaṇamātmano rūpaṃ kṣaṇamapi na draṣṭavyam | tadahaṃkārarahitaṃ ca svacittaṃ kṣaṇamapi na karttavyamiti || 7 ||

vajragarbhetyādinopasaṃhāraḥ | kilbiṣaṃ vipakṣarāśiḥ | yogaprabhāve dārḍhyotpādanārthamāha kautukenetyādi | pakṣamiti samāhitāsamāhitayogābhyām || 8 ||

dinamiti samāhitayogenaiva sarvacintāparityāgāvicchinnavacanāt || 9 ||

sakṛditi ekapakṣamekadinaṃ vā pūrvavat || 10 ||

bhayetyādinā ślokena pratyayaṃ darśayati | unmādo 'vinayaḥ || 11 ||

evamityādi | vimṛṣyamāṇā iti prekṣamāṇāḥ | hitodayaṃ tasmād yogāt ahitodayaṃ lokacaritāt | raurava iti lokacarite || 12 ||

pāpiṣṭhādīnāṃ ko 'vakāśa iti cet āha pañcetyādi || 13 ||

cintayeti nairātmyābhāvanayā | dhārmikāstarhi na sidhyantītyāha daśetyādi || 14 ||

atha cittasthairyādūrdhvamasti karaṇāya na vetyāha sātatyetyādi | siddhiścittasthairyaṃ devatākārātmapratibhāsatadahaṃkārayoraharahaḥ svarasavāhitā tāṃ labdhāa dhaḥ || 15 ||

guhyamiti guhyapūjāṃ hevajranairātmyākṛtibhyām caret vyākaraṇalābhārtham || 16 ||

bodhicitteneti śaraṇagamanādipūrvakeṇa | devatārūpacittaṃ devatāyogaḥ | ekacittatā samādhiparikarma ekāśayatā vā | bhāvyeti siddhibhājanam || 18  19 ||

śaktyeti samādhijena prabhāvena kṛṣṭveti ākṛśya || 20 ||

tāṃ ceti varalabdhāmākṛṣṭāṃ vā | dhairyapratyayāditi cittasthairyaṃ pratītya || 21 ||

kuta ityāha netyādi | bhogata iti bhogārtham | bhīmarūpiṇī kaṣṭataratvāt || 22 ||

mudrā tviti bāhyaprajñā anviṣyate | kathamiti kimarthaṃ gaveṣyate | mudrāsiddhiriti mudraṇasiddhiḥ || 23 ||

strī nairātmyā bhagavān hevajraḥ | stanamiti stanāvurasi | kathaṃ bolaṃ bhavedityāha tīretyādi | tīraṃ pārśvam | ghaṇṭā muṣkaḥ | kiñjalkaṃ nāīkā | mahārateriti mahāratasvabhāvasya || 24  25 ||

herukayoginastarhi kathaṃ puṃstvamityāha | heruketyādi | mudrāsiddhiriti mahāmudrāsiddhiḥ | śaktireva śaktaṃ prabhāvaḥ || 26 ||

nanu mahāmudrāsiddhirdevatāsiddhiḥ tadyathā brahmādīnāṃ dehaḥ saṃvarte vinaśyati vivarte punaḥ sambhavati dadvanmahāmudrā'pi devatādehatvājjanmamaraṇe ca saṃsāraḥ tasmādutpattikramo na muktimārga iti kasyacidāśaṅkā syādatastāmāpākartumāha utpattītyādi | prajñopāyamiti svavidyādehaḥ svadehaḥ | | na bādhyata iti na spṛśyate | kuta ityāha upāya ityādi | santataṃ bhāvaḥ sambhavaḥ | sambhārāvedhasāmarthyād yāvadākāśaṃ jagadarthakaraṇāya vapuṣādipratibhāsinaścittasya sātatyenotpattiḥ sa upāyaḥ | ata upāyaphalabhāvanāniṣpattau kutaḥ pralayaḥ | layo 'nupalambhaḥ | pratibhāsamānasyāpi dehasyālīkatvena prakhyānam sarojale śaraccandratārakavat | sa eva layaḥ prajñā | tasmādasau bhavāntakī | arthābhiniveśamūlasya bhavāntasyāntakarī || 27 ||

yenaivaṃ tena kāraṇena nāsya pralayo 'sti na cotpādaḥ anidhanatvāt api ca tattvataḥ pralayācca notpādaḥ | tathā hyasau mahāmudrādehaḥ svayamalīko 'līkatvena ca khyātīti | khyātāvapi tasya tattvataḥ pralaya eva notpādaḥ |
nanu pralayo 'pi saṃsāra evetyāha līyata ityādi | ayamarthaḥ mahāmudrāsiddhānāṃ madhye kaśca līyate svadehe 'bhiniviśate naiva kaścit | layābhāvācca na kṣayaḥ pralayaḥ | 
evaṃ manyate brahmādīnāmapi deho 'bhāva eva bhāvābhiniveśāttu bhāvaḥ syāt | sati bhāve pralayo 'pi naivaṃ mahāmudrāsiddhasya bhāvānabhiniveśāditi | tadevaṃ saṃsāranirvāṇabahirbhūtatvādapratiṣṭhitanirvāṇasvabhāvā mahāmudrāsiddhiriti sthitam | sā ca bhāvanālabhyaiva || 28 ||

bhāvanā tu kīdṛśītyāha utpattītyādi | prapañcamiti vistaraṃ nānākāratvāt | svapnavat kṛtveti svapnopamaṃ vibhāvya yathā hi svapne cittaṃ vitathairarthākāraiḥ prakhyāti tathedamityekarasenaiva jalpena virūpaṇāt | prapañcairiti nānātvajalpaiḥ | na prapañcayediti na vikalpayet || 29 ||

evamabhyasyataḥ kiṃ syādityāha yathetyādi | tathaiveti tathātvenaiva bhātīti nirjalpaniścayaṃ sātatyaṃ gacchati vastutvenaiva tu bālānām || 30 ||

evaṃ śūnyatāyāḥ khyātimuktvā mahāsukhakhyātimāha mahāmudretyādi | mudrā prajñā mudrābhiṣekaḥ prajñājñānam mahāmudrābhiṣekaścaturtho 'bhiṣekaḥ | vyaktibhedād bahuvacanam | yathājñānamiti yathāpratipannaṃ gurūpadeśāt | mahat sukhamiti sādhyasukhaṃ niṣprapañcam | tasyaiva prabhāva etanmaṇḍalamiti sambandhaḥ prabhāvajaudāryaṃ jagaddhitopāyātvāt | maṇḍalaṃ yoginīcakraṃ sanāyakam | nānyasambhavamiti nānyasvabhāvamayam || 31 ||

punarvistareṇāha sukhamityādinā | śyāmaṃ haritam nīlaṃ gaganaśyāmam varṇādibhedabhinnamapi maṇḍalasukharūpeṇa vyāptimityarthaḥ | caraṃ devatānāṃ śarīram acaraṃ vastrābharaṇādi || 32 ||

kathamasukhasvabhāvāt kāraṇāt sukhasvabhāvasya maṇḍalasyotpattiriti āha sukhaṃ prajñetyādi | prajñopāyau sukham ānandānāmākaratvād ādhāratvāt | sukhaṃ kundurujaṃ tatheti tayoḥsvasamāpattisukhaṃ tathaiva sukhameva sākṣādityarthaḥ | bhāvaḥ pañcabuddhātmakaṃ sukhaṃ mudrāvajradharākāraṃ paramasukhamayatvāt | abhāvastasyaiva dravatvam so 'pi sukhaṃ niṣprapañcasukhātmakatvāt tasmānmaṇḍalaheturapi sukhātmaka eva | 
bhavatu śrīherukamaṇḍālasya hetuḥ sukhātmako nairātmyamaṇḍalasya kathamityāha vajrasattvaḥ sukhaḥ smṛta iti | prajñopāyasvabhāvayoḥ candrasūryayoḥ saṃyogajabījodbhavaṃ devatācihnaṃ vajram tannābhijātaṃ bījaṃ sattvaḥ vajrasahitaḥ sattvo vajrasattvaḥ so 'pi sukhaḥ smṛtaḥ mahāsukhasvabhāvo buddhairktaḥ | tadudbhavaṃ ca nairātmyamaṇḍalam | tatastadapi sukhātmakameva || 33 ||

vajragarbha āheti kimarthamāha utpattikramasyāpi bhagavataiva praśaṃsanārtham | satsukhaṃ paramasukham mahāsukhaṃ tadeva sarvabhavaikarasam | tataḥ kimityāha utpanna ityādi | bhāvanā devatādehānāṃ manasotpādanā tayā hīno varjitaḥ | kimiti na kiñicit || 34 ||

śraddhā utpannakrame gauravam tayā āvegajamauddhatyam tena naṣṭo duṣṭa utpattikramapratikṣepāt | dehetyādinā tamevotpattikramaṃ stauti | vaktumiti taddeśanāmātreṇa dehādyupāyaśūnyena sādhakasantāneṣūtpādayitum | 
kuta ityāha vyāpyetyādi | yasmāt sukhena jagad vyāpitaṃ yaducyate na tad vyāpakarūpeṇaiva api tu vyāpyarūpeṇāpi | yathā sukhena vinā na dehādiḥ tathā sukhamapi na dehādinā vinetyarthaḥ | yathetyādinā dṛṣṭāntamāha || 35  36 ||

nanu dharmakāyasaṃgṛhītaṃ mahāsukhamatra sādhyam dharmakāye ca dehabhogapratiṣṭhānirbhāsānāṃ vijñānānāṃ parikṣayato dehādi katham | tatastasmin sādhye na yuktā dehabhāvanetyata āha bhāvo 'haṃ naiva bhāvo 'hamiti rūpādimānahaṃ saṃbhoganirmāṇakāyena dehādipratibhāsatvāttayoḥ | naiva rūpādimānahaṃ dharmakāyena nirābhāsatvāttasyetyarthaḥ |

yadi tarhi saṃbhoganirmāṇakāyena dehādipratibhāsau tadā bhāvasatpratibhāsatvād bhrāntau tatastābhyāṃ buddho 'pi na buddhaḥ syādityata āha buddho 'haṃ vastubodhanāditi | ayamarthaḥ vastūni sarvadharmāḥ teṣāṃ bodhaḥ sarvākārajñānam tato 'haṃ buddhaḥ | nirābhāsena ca jñānena dharmāṇāṃ sāmānyalakṣaṇameva yathatākhyaṃ dṛśyate na viśeṣalakṣaṇāni | anantāni tāni tatpratibhāsenādarśajñānena dṛśyante | tatparicchedakena ca pratyavekṣaṇājñānena paricchidyante cobhe jñāne saṃbhogakāyaḥ | tasmāt tribhiḥ kāyairahaṃ buddho naikena saṃbhoganirmāṇakāyau vinā svaparārhasampadoḥ paripūraṇābhāvānna ca tāvatyantaṃ bhrāntau yathāpratibhāsamasattayā māyopamāditvena prakhyānāt | ata eva śuddhalaukikavikalpaḥ saṃbhogakāyo dharmakāyaniṣyandaśca kathyata iti | tasmādahaṃ paramagambhīra iti darśayitumāha māmityādi  mūḍhā iti śrutamayaprajñayā rahitāḥ | kausīdyopahatāa iti cintāmayyā bhāvanāmayyā ca prajñayā rahitāḥ || 37 ||

tadevaṃ gāmbhīryaṃ vibhaktumāha vihare 'hamityādi | amitābhasya tathāgatasya pariśuddhaṃ buddhakṣetraṃ sukhāvatī | iha tu kākadadhirakṣānyāyena sarvāṇyeva pariśuddhakṣetrāṇi sukhāvatītyucyate | ahaṃ viharāmi sāmbhogikena kāyena paramādbhutatayā buddhasampadaḥ | tu śabdaścārthe bhinnakramaśca | nairātmyādiyoginī sadvajrayoṣit tasyāśca bhage vihare 'hamiti vartate | ekatā samatā tathatā sarvadharmāṇāmiti sūcanārthamekārākṛtirūpaḥ buddhā eva ratnāni teṣāṃ karaṇḍakaḥ tatraiva teṣāmekarasena kāyena mahāsukhasaṃvedanāt || 38 ||

itthambhutasyātmano māhātmyadyotanārthamāha vyākhyātetyādi | īdṛśasya dyotako yo dharmo hevajratantrādiḥ | yaśca tasya vyākhyātā yaśca śrotā śiṣyaguṇairyuktaḥ trayo 'pyete 'ham ahamiva pūjyā ityarthaḥ | mukhyavṛttyā kastvamityāha sādhyo 'ham iti | yau 'sau prādhānyena sādhyo mahāsukho dharmakāyaḥ so 'haṃ mukhyavṛttyā | jagataḥ śāsteti saṃbhoganirmāṇakāyau ca | iyatā yuktaiva dehabhāvaneti prasādhitam | api ca loko 'haṃ laukiko 'pyaham suratodbhavaḥ sattvo lokaḥ | yastu tasyaivāntarābhavadehaṃ sa laukikaḥ lokaḥ prayojanamasyeti kṛtvā tāvapyaham | yathā hi dharmakāyamahāsukhaniṣyandatvāt sambhogakāyo 'pyaham evaṃ mātāpitṛgandharvamahāsukhaniṣyandatvāt loko 'pyaham mahāsukhasaṃmūrcchanād gandharvo 'pyaham || 39 ||

katamalloke mahāsukhaṃ yanmukhyo bhavānityāha sahajetyādi | nanu sādhyaṃ mahāsukhaṃ mukhyo bhavān āsaṃsārasiddhaṃ tu sahajasukhaṃ vaitat sādhyam tat kasmāt dadeva mukhyo bhavānityāha tathā ca ityādi | caśabdo hetau | yasmāt tadeva mukhyasya tathāpratyayaṃ sādṛśyena dṛṣṭāntatvena pratītisādhanam tasmāt tadeva mukhyo 'hamityupacāraḥ andhakāre pradīpavaditi tadyathā ghaṭādīnāmandhakāre pradīpaḥ pratītisādhanaṃ vyañjanakatvena tathā dṛṣṭāntatvena sahajasukhameva sādhyasukhasya vihare 'hamityādikayā gāthayā || 40 ||

yadasphuṭamuktaṃ tadeva sphuṭīkartumāha dvātriṃśadityādi | lakṣaṇānuvyañjanojjvalaśarīrastatrotpannānāṃ bodhisattvānāṃ prabhuḥ dharmasambhogairbhartā | itthambhūto 'haṃ sukhāvatyāṃ sthitaḥ | yoṣid iti vajrayoṣit dṛṣṭāntayoṣicca tadbhage śukranāmā sthito 'ham | śukraṃ jñānaretaḥ dṛṣṭānte bāhyaretaḥ teneti śukranāmnā | sa iti śukranāmā | ataśca retasi dehasambhoge ca sāpekṣaṃ mahāsukham | tadabhāve tatkāraṇāntarāṇāmasāmarthyād devatāyogādeva tadutpadyate | tasmāt sādhyasukhārthinā devatāyogo 'vaśyaṃ bhāvya iti bhāvārthaḥ || 41  42 ||

evañca yasmānmārgo na bhāvo nābhāvaḥ tasmāt phalamapi buddho na bhāvaḥ syāt dharmakāyena tasyāśeṣasaṃkleśakṣayalakṣaṇatvāt | saḥ iti buddhaḥ | abhāvarūpo 'pi naiveti suviśuddhasamarasajñānarūpatvād dharmakāyasya | bhujamukhākārarūpī ceti sambhoganirmāṇakāyābhyām | arūpī ca kutaḥ paramasaukhyataḥ dharmakāyena dharmasambhogasukhena cetyarthaḥ || 43 ||

tadevaṃ yasmāt phalaṃ na bhāvo nābhāvaḥ tasmāt sahajaṃ jagat sarvam sahajena buddhatvena yogāt sahajam | jagat sarvamiti sarvasattvāḥ | buddhatvaṃ sahajamiti ko 'rthaḥ ityāha sahajam ityādi | svarūpamiti prakṛtim | prakṛtiḥ prakṛtiparyāyaḥ sahajaśabda iti bhāvaḥ | buddhatvaṃ ca prādhānyena dharmakāyaḥ | tamadhikṛtyāha svarūpameva nirvāṇamiti | kathamityāha viśuddhītyādi | viśuddhirmalābhāvaḥ prabhāsvaratā sā ākāraḥ prakṛtirasyeti tathoktam | viśuddhyākāraṃ ca taccetaśca tena hetunā | yasmād viśuddhirnirvāṇaṃ tasmānna bhāvaḥ | yasmāccittameva viśuddhyākāraṃ tasmānnābhāva iti bhāvaḥ | iyatā prakṛtiprabhāsvarataiva cittasya buddhatve bījamanādisiddhamityuktaṃ bhavati || 44 ||

sambhogakāyasya tarhi bījaṃ nāstyeva | prākṛtadeho hi tasyeva bījaṃ na devatādehasya tadvijātīyatvād | ata āha devatetyādi | atra ca devatārūpaśabdena tadbījamevoktam | tacca jātamātre dehini sthitam | kuta ityāha bhujetyādi dehasāmānyādityarthaḥ | yathā hi prakṛtiśuddhirāgantuakamalaśuddherbītajam tathā prākṛtadeha eva devatādehasya bījamiti bhāvaḥ | vyarthā tarhi devatādehasya bhāvanetyata āha kiṃ tvityādi | prākṛtadehasyāpi heturiti śeṣaḥ | tataśca tasyāḥ prahāṇāya svavāsanāyāścādhānaparipoṣaṇāya devatādehabhāvanā na vyartheti bhāvaḥ || 45 ||

dehabhāvanayaiva prākṛtadehaprahāṇamiti duḥsahametat | tata idaṃ bahubhirdṛṣṭāntaiḥ sādhayitumāha tenaivetyādi | kathaṃ māṣo vātaḥ | vātamūtrapurīṣāṇāṃ preraṇād viparītamauṣadham sajātīyatvāt | tasya kalpanaṃ vidhiḥ | 
bhavaḥ saṃsāraḥ sa śuddho kṣīṇo bhavati | bhavenaiveti laukikenaiva mārgeṇa | tathā hi catvāri smṛtyupasthānāni catvāri samyakprahāṇāni catvāraṛddhipādāḥ pañcendriyāṇi pañca balāni dvāviṃśatirdharmā laukiko mārgaḥ | tena vinā na lokottaro mārgaḥ | sa tu sapta bodhyaṅgāni aṣṭau ca mārgāṅgānīti pañcadaśa dharmāḥ | tena vinā nāsti bhavakṣayaḥ | tasmāt paramparayā bhavenaiva bhavakṣayo bhavati vikalpaśca vikalpataḥ śuddho bhavati paramparayā | tathā hi bhūtapratyavekṣaṇā'pi vikalpa eva | saiva ca bhāvanābalādhānavyavadhānena nirvikalpaṃ jñānaṃ janayati | tena ca vikalpāḥ kṣīyante || 46  47 ||

āviṣṭamiti praviṣṭam | kṛṣyata iti nikṛṣyate | bhāvavikalpaḥ pañcaskandhādivikalpaḥ | ākārairiti śāśvataratneśādidevatākāraiḥ | śodhyate kṣīyate || 48 ||

rāgaḥ kleśarāgaḥ sa evāgniḥ tena dagdhāḥ santaptāḥ durgatyādiduḥkhajananāt | rāgastattvarāgaḥ sa eva vahniḥ kleśaviakalpendhanadahanāt | tenāsvidyante paripācyante || 49 ||

raudraṃ karma dveṣajaṃ prāṇātipātādi | upāyo mahākaruṇā buddhaśāsanarakṣādiḥ || 50 ||

rāgeṇeti kleśarāgeṇa | rāgeṇaiveti tattvarāgeṇaiva | viparīteti sapakṣabhūtā sapakṣavatpratibhāsanāt | paramārthatastu pratipakṣabhūtaiva | buddhasya tīrthikā buddhatīrthaikāḥ | kathaṃ te buddhasya buddhasyaiva śāsturabhyupagamāt | kathaṃ tīrthikāḥ buddhaśāsanasāre 'pi vajrayāne pradveṣāt || 51 ||

iyatā ca sarveṇa vajradevīsambhogasyāvaśyabhāvanīyatvaṃ prasādhitam | tadeva tasyānantakulakāraṇatvena punaḥ prasādhayitumāha kundureṣvityādi | chāndasametvam | kunduravaḥ suratāni yāni vajradevīkamalasambhavāni teṣu kundureṣu | bhavediti bhavanti | pañceti pañca sparśāḥ pañcabhūtātmakāḥ | pañcabhūtasvarūpata iti pṛthivyaptejovāyvākāśadhāturūpeṇa | 
kiṃ punastāni bhūtānītyāha eka evetyādi | mahānanda iti suratānando vajradharaḥ | pañcatāmiti pañcakularūpatām | bhedanairiti bhūtabhedena | bhūtaṃ tattvaṃ tadeva mohādi vairocanādi ceti bhāvaḥ ayamuddeśaślokaḥ || 52 ||

asyaiva nirdeśaślokamāha boletyādīn | kāṭhinyavāsanaṃ kāṭhinyapratyayaḥ kāṭhinyaṃ hi pṛthivīdhātuḥ | mohadharmatvaṃ mohasvabhāvatvaṃ dṛḍhatvāt || 53 ||

abdhātukamiti abdhātuḥ saṃyogaḥ sambandhaḥ || 54 ||

teja ūṣmā | rāgastejasīti pākajo hi rāgaḥ kumbhādīnāmiva || 55 ||

kakkolaka iti kakkolake sañcarataḥ | samīraṇarūpaṃ gatimattvāt | ata eva īrṣyā īr gatāviti dhātupāṭhāt || 56 ||

sukhaṃ suratānandaḥ tadeva rāgam āsaktisthānatvāt tadeva raktaṃ tatrāsaktasya cittasya tasmādananyatvāt | raktirākāśalakṣaṇeti yā tasya sukhānmanasaścittasyātmani raktiḥ saktiḥ | svarūpamātrasaṃveditācitamityarthaḥ | sā ākāśalakṣaṇā sarvadharmānupalambhātmakamahāsukharūpatvāt | ākāśasādharmyād ākāśam | tadeva piśunavajro ratnasambhavaḥ | paramārthaprakāśanāt piśunaḥ || 57 ||

mahaccittaṃ mahānandarūpo vajradharaḥ | pañcarūpeṇeti pañcakularūpeṇa yathoktena | tatreti vajrayoṣitkundurau anekasahasraśa iti koṭiśaḥ kulāni || 58 ||

ekasvabhāva iti anantakulasādhāraṇarūpaḥ | kathaṃ bhedena rāgādipañcacetasā rāgadveṣerṣyādinā pañcavidhena cittena || 59 ||

iyatā mahāsukhasya bhedāḥ | pañcakulānīti prasādhitam | teṣāmapi prabhedo asaṃkhyāni kulānīti praśādhayituṃ gāthādvayenāha daśetyādi | bālukātulyā iti bālukābhistulyasaṃkhyāḥ | ekakuleṣviti ekaikasmin kule | saṃghakuleṣviti yāvantastathāgatasaṃghāstāvanti kulāni | tadarthameva pṛthak karaṇāt | ataśca saṃghasaṃkhyāni kulāni | saṃghakulāni pañcāśadgaṅgānadībālukopamāni | teṣu saṃghakuleṣu punaḥ prabhidyamāneṣu anekakulānīti atibahūni kulāni bhavanti | 
kathamityāha teṣvityādi | teṣu saṃghakuleṣu prathamaṃ vibhidyamāneṣu pratyekaṃ śatasaṃkhyāni kulāni bhavanti || 60 ||

tāni ca śatakulāni mahāntīti punaḥ prabhidyamānāni pratyekaṃ lakṣakulāni bhavanti | lakṣakuleṣu bhidyamāneṣu pratyekaṃ koṭikulāni koṭikuleṣvapi bhidyamāneṣu pratyekam asaṃkhyāni kulāni | tatra kuleṣviti koṭikuleṣu yāni pratyekamasaṃkhyāni kulāni tāni sarvāṇi paramānandakulodbhavāni paramānanda eva kulaṃ tadbhavāni tasyaikakulasya sarvaprabhedakulamūlātvāditi || 61 ||

ḍākinīnāṃ jālaṃ cakram tena saṃvaraṃ sukhaṃ caran tasmāt siddhiḥ tasmānnirṇayaḥ |

mahāpaṇḍitācāryaratnākaraśāntikṛtāyāṃ muktāvalyāṃ hevajrapañjikāyāṃ dvitīyakalpe siddhinirṇayapaṭalaḥ dvitīyaḥ |

hevajrasarvatantranidānasandhyābhāṣo nāma tṛtīyaḥ paṭalaḥ

athetyādi | vajrī vajradharaḥ | sarvatantraṃ kṛtsnaṃ hevajratantram | tasya nidānaṃ mūlakāraṇam taduddiśya tantradeśanāt | nāmeti anenaiva nāmnā prasiddham | upāyaṃ bodhiśāsanam tasyaiva uddeśagāthā 
saṃvaramityādi | tatra saṃvaraṃ sukhavaram | abhiṣekaścatvāro 'bhiṣekāḥ | sandhinā abhiprāyeṇa ābhāṣaṇaṃ sandhyābhāṣaṇaṃ sandhyābhāṣam | ānandaścatvāra ānandāḥ | kṣaṇabhedaḥ catvāraḥ kṣaṇāḥ || 1 ||

saṃvaraṃ mahatsukhamiti ādyantapadayoḥ sambandhaḥ | keṣāṃ mahat sukham sarvabuddhānām | samyagiti niṣprapañcajñānātmakam | kutaḥ yasmādekākāraṃ sarvabuddhānāṃ vilīya tathaikībhāvāt | kva sthitam evaṃkāre pratiṣṭhitam | abhiṣekāt sarvaprapañcanimittamalakṣālanāt | jñāyate saṃvedyate sarvabuddhairvilīnaiḥ prajñopāyābhyāṃ ca || 2 ||

ḍākinīnāmiti ḍai vaihāyasagamane | ḍānaṃ ḍā ṛddhyābhijñā tayā'ṅkituṃ śīlamāsāmiti ḍākinyaḥ aṅkanaṃ kuṭilā gatiḥ ṛddhyā yugapad daśasu dikṣu gatiśīlāḥ siddhayoginyo ḍākinya ityarthaḥ | tāsāṃ saṃvaram saṃvarāadhāraḥ || 3 ||

ekatā samatā sarvatathāgataguhyānāmiti sūcanārtham ekārākṛtiḥ | dīvyantyasminniti divyam | kathamālaya ityāha ānandā ityādi | kṣaṇa ānandānāṃ kālaḥ | sukhajñānam ānandādijñānam || 4  5 ||

kṣaṇānāṃ nāmasaṃkhyālakṣaṇamānandavibhāgaṃ ca vicitramityādinā ślokacatuṣṭayenāha | jānantīti kiṃ jānanti catu ānandān | sukhaṃ ca tanmahāsukhatvāt jñānaṃ ca samyag jñānatvāditi sukhajñānaṃ sahajānandam tasya bhuñjanam utpitsoḥ saṃlakṣaṇam | tadviparyāsamiti tad viparītaṃ sālambanatvāt | ālocanam anantaranaṣṭasya smaraṇam | sukhamiti mahāsukham | rāgo bhāvini sukhe sākāṅkṣatā ānande paramānade ca arāgo vighṛṣṭe sukhe tṛptasya nirākāṅkṣatā viramānande tābhyāṃ vivarjitam ciralipsitasya tasya tenaiva tadā saṃvedanāt || 6  7 ||

prathamānanda iti ānandamātram | iyatā saṃvaraṃ tatprasaṅgena ānandakṣaṇabhedau ca nirdiṣṭau || 9 ||

abhiṣekamāha ācāryetyādinā | ācāryatvena guhyena prajñayā ca yo 'bhiṣekaḥ sa yathākramam ācāryaguhyaprajñā ca | tatpunastatheti yat tat sādhyasukhaṃ tatpunastathā dṛṣṭāntasukhe samyagjñāte punaḥ paścād vācyam tatheti dṛṣṭāntasukhasādharmyeṇa yathopadeśam | eṣāaṃ tṛtīyaḥ prajñākhyah tat prabhedā api catvāro 'bhiṣekāh kramaśo dvividhāh santi | tān sārddhaślokenāha ānandetyādinā | saṃkhyā saṃjñā | catvāra ānandā yathākramam catvāro 'bhiṣekā ārambhacaraṇād dūragamanāt prakṛṣṭajñānāt paramārthatvāccetyarddhaślokārthaḥ || 10 ||

hasitasya śuddhiścāturakṣādubhayo riraṃsā yā tayā ācārya ārambhacaraṇāt | īkṣaṇaṃ cihnasaṃyogaḥ | pāṇyāptirāśleṣaḥ sā prajñā sarvasparśena prakṛṣṭajñānatvāt | dvandvatantraṃ mithunādhīnam ratamityarthaḥ || 11 ||

abhiṣekaśabdārthaṃ darśayitumāha sekamityādi | snāpyata iti prakṣālyate nirmalīkriyata ityarthaḥ || 12 ||

ghaṇṭāvajrasamāyogo hastayoḥ secanamiti yathopadeśam ācāryaḥ antarabhiṣeko guhyābhiṣekaḥ || 13 ||

śāstā guruḥ | kiṃ brūyāt mahāsattvetyādi | kiṃ kṛtvā brūyāt jñātvā śiṣyaṃ mahadbhūtamiti mahātmānaṃ mahāśayamityarthaḥ || 15  16 ||

kundarumiti suratam vajradhṛgiti hevajradhara | anunāthayediti yāceta || 17 ||

devatādvayayogeṣu sthitatvānmahāśānta vajrasya yogaḥ prayogaḥ tasminnekatatparaḥ atyantatatparaḥ || 18 ||

mudrāprasādhaketi vidyānāṃ paritoṣaka | vajrāḥ sarvabuddhāḥ teṣāṃ yogaḥ samatā mahāsukham tasya samudbhavaḥ | so 'bhedyasantato 'syeti tathoktaḥ | yatheti yena mahāsukhena yuktāḥ vibho prabho || 19 ||

saṃsāra eva paṅkasaṅghātaḥ paṅkarāśiḥ | trāhīti trāyasva | aśaraṇamiti māmiti śeṣaḥ | miṣṭaṃ svādu | balamiti mahābalaṃ mahāmadhu cetyarthaḥ || 20 ||

vilepanaṃ samālabhanam | ābhiḥpūjābhiriti yathoktābhiḥ | śiṣyaḥ pūjayediti sambandhaḥ | vajradhāriṇamiti gurum || 21 ||

paramānande sati tadbalāt samprāpte vartamāne sahajānandalakṣaṇe | nānātvavarjita iti tanmātre cittasyāvasthānāt | dhāraṇīyamiti etadeva cetasi sthirīkaraṇīyam || 22 ||

kiṃ tenetyāha yāvadityādi | kurviti aneneti śeṣaḥ | iti dīkṣayitvā | evaṃ vidhivat tribhirabhiṣekairabhiṣicya | vajrī guruḥ | śiṣyaṃ vadati | kriyācayamiti śiṣyāya karttavyarāśiṃ vadet | evamiti etacca vakṣyamāṇaṃ caturthābhiṣekaṃ vadet || 23 ||

etadeveti sahajam mahāsukham | mahājñānamiti yadādyapaṭale dehasthaṃ ca mahājñānamityādinā nirdiṣṭam | tatra tat khalu dvayaśūnyatā'nubhavarūpatvānmahājñānam tāvataiva mahāsukhamayācchūnyatādarśanādabhedāttadapi mahāsukham | sarvasattvānāṃ dehaḥ sarvadehaḥ | advayaṃ dvayasya grāhyagrāhakasya atyantamasattvāt | tathāpi dvayapratibhāsatvād dvayarūpam | bhāvo vijñāptimātrasya abhāvo dvayasya bhāvābhāvātmakasyeti bhāvābhāvātmakam | prabhuṃ vajradharaṃ bodhicittasvabhāvatvād advayaprakāśamātralakṣaṇatvād dharmāṇāṃ sarvaṃ vyāpya tiṣṭhati tathāpi dvayapratibhāsatvānmāyārūpīva bhāti || 24 ||

yadi tarhi dvayaśūnyatā'nubhavo 'nādiḥ sarvasattvānāṃ tadā teṣāmādita eva bodhiḥ syāt na syāt sato 'pyanubhavasyānupalakṣaṇatvāt | kutastarhi bodhiḥ tasyaivopalakṣaṇasātatyāt | 
tattarhi sātatyam asau kenopāyena yātītyata āha maṇḍalacakretyādi | ādiśabdena ekavīrādhimokṣayoḥyogayoḥ grahaṇam || 25 ||

mṛṣitvā iti kṣamayitvā | kimartham tāsāmeva māhātmyadyotanārtham | pūryate sarvabuddhairiti puram | kimiti kasmādityarthaḥ | bhrāntiriti vicikitsā || 26 ||

bodhicittaṃ mahāsukhamiti nairātmyāmaṇḍale candrasūryasamyakprayogotpannaṃ bījam tadutpannaṃ devīyonimadhye bījaṃ bodhicittam | śrīherukamaṇḍale tu pañcajñānavilīnaṃ bodhicittam | ubhayametanmahāsukham | tadeva sāraḥ maṇḍalam | lāti lātvā gṛhṇāti tatsvabhāvena kāyotpādastu sāragrahaṇād maṇḍalaṃ matamiti | mīlanamiti devatāḥ || 27 ||

cakramiti lakṣyam gaṇasya paryāyaḥ sarvaikībhāva ityarthaḥ | khadhātvādinā lakṣaṇamākhyātam | khasādharmyāt khadhāturiti tathatā | ataḥ khatve sati yogināṃ puṣṭikārī cāpi khadhātuḥ | viṣayādīnāṃ pratyekaṃ yā śūnyatā sā yoginīcakramityarthaḥ | ata eva viṣayādīnāṃ viśodhanamityāha | viṣayendriyādīni pratyekaṃ viśuddhasvabhāvānītyarthaḥ | 
atha viśuddhālambanatvena tadairśyeṇānuśerata ityevaṃ sati kiṃ tadaiśvaryamityāha cakramityādi | tad yoginīcakrasukhāvabodhanād bhogyam | vimānamiti taccakrasyādhārabhāvena cakram || 28 ||

āheti kimarthamāha | anyacca saṃvarādideśanārtham | 29 ||

ekacittamiti āveṇikacittam cittamātratājñānamityarthaḥ | tadevātra prāṇivadham | cittād bhinnasya sattvātmakāyasyānālambanakāmatetyetatparyantam | 
mṛṣāvādamiti sattvalokānupalambhāditi bhāvaḥ | adattamiti parebhyo grahaṇam | svābhasundarīti nairātmyādi | tāḥ kathaṃ paradārā tkṛṣṭāḥ || 30 ||

eṣāṃ kiṃ svabhāvamiti te viṣayādayaḥ | kiṃ svabhāvamiti tathatā | kena jñānena viśuddhir bhavatīti bhāvaḥ || 31 ||

dharmadhātusvabhāva iti dharmadhātvātmatā || 32 ||

mohavajrādibhiryuktā iti pūrvaṃ yā uktāḥ | ṣaḍetānīti cakṣurādīni || 33 ||

viṣayallikāḥ viṣayiṇaścakṣurādayaḥ | saṃskārāntā vijñānaskandhaṃ madhye paṭhitvā rūpaskandhaḥ vijñānaskandhaḥ vedanāskandhaḥ saṃjñāskandhaḥ saṃskāraskandhaścetyapyāha 
ekaṃ tu pratyabhijñānaṃ dvitīyaṃ copacārakam |
upacāraparicchedau cittādeva pravartitau || iti || 34 ||

svabhāvaṃ cādyanutpannamiti viṣayādisvabhāvamādyanutpannatvam | evaṃ viṣayādyābhāsavijñānatvam | te ca yathābhāsaṃ na santi nāstitvād ādyanutpannatvād anutpannāḥ | na satyamiti yathābhāsamabhāvāt | na mṛṣeti vijñāptimātrāstitvāt | udakacandropamamiti anyākārasya anyākāreṇa ābhāsitatvāt | jānateti parijñānam | 
icchayeti yuṣmadicchāyāṃ satyāṃ tathā jñānaṃ bhaviṣyatīti bhāvaḥ || 36 ||

kāṇḍam uttarāraṇī | mathanīyam adharāraṇiḥ | pratītyeti śeṣaḥ prāpyetyarthaḥ | akasmād iti niṣkatṛko nirīhaśca | nāstīti nopalabhyata ityarthaḥ | na satyam iti yathāpratibhāsamekānekasvabhāva virahāt | na mṛṣeti tadākārasya vijñaptimātrasya sattvāt | kuruta iti niveśayet || 37 ||

anurāgayantīti paritoṣayanti | pibācayantīti pāyayanti || 38 ||

tuṣṭe satīti tuṣṭau satyāṃ yenānuṣṭhitena vajrasattvo 'dhitiṣṭhati tadasya adhiṣṭhānam tad darśayati prakāśayati | 
pūjaiva vajraṃ dṛḍhatvāt tasya prabhāvena | icchayeti ādareṇa || 39 ||

bodhicitteneti māyopamādipratibhāsena nirābhāsena vā cittena | etadevāha advayajñānacetaseti advayasya jñānaṃ nirābhāsam ceto vikalpanam || 47 ||

aviṣuddhānīti devatākāreṇa na śodhitāni ṣaṭsaṃkhyā kṛtā yeṣāṃ tāni tathoktāni | ataḥ śudhireṣāmucyatāmiti bhāvaḥ | kasmādindriyāṇāmeva śuddhirmṛgyata iti cedāha śuddhirityādi | sarvaviṣayasyeti sarvasya jñeyasya viṣayāderdevatāśuddhiruktaiva prāk tato mṛgyata iti bhāvārthaḥ || 50 ||

cakṣurādīnāṃ śuddirādheyā svabhāvaśca mohavajrādiḥ ata ebhyastisro vibhaktayaḥ || 51 ||

sandhirabhisandhirabhiprāyaḥ īṣadbhāṣaṇam ābhāṣaḥ abhiprāyapradhānaṃ sūcanaṃ nākṣarapradhānamityarthaḥ | mahāsamayam iti gūḍhasaṅketam | nacchidritam iti na lakṣitam || 53 ||

etena guhyatoktā atiguhyatāmāha hasitetyādinā | caturṇāṃ kriyācaryāyogayotottāaṇāṃ yattatra hasitaprekṣitābhyām āliṅganadvandvakaiśca lakṣitam | 
tathā hi kvacit kriyāditantre devatānāṃ prajñopāyayoranurāgasūcakaṃ smitam kvacinmūrtau prekṣaṇam kvacidāliṅganam kvacid dvandvam | itthambhūtenāpi kriyāditantreṇa na śabditaṃ na kīrtitaṃ sandhyābhāṣam | kevalaṃ yoganirūttaratantraireva kīrtanīyam | tasmāt paramaguhyamiti bhāvaḥ | ekālambanaṃ ceta ekacetaḥ || 54  55 ||

kulaṃ pañcavidham iti sandhyābhāṣāḥ | varṇabhedeneti asparśaṃ pañcamaṃ kṛtvā | atra hi bījārthaḥ kulārthaḥ | buddhāḥ kaulikāḥ syuḥ | sandhyābhāṣata evaṃ kulodbhavatvāt || 61 ||

kulameva kulī vajrādīnāṃ kulī | kasmādetāḥ kulāni yasmāt susiddhidāḥ | kathamityāha āsām ityādi | vajram iti pañcavidhaṃ bodhicittam | pūjayitveti etā eva || 62  63 ||

dṛḍhīkartumāha vajragarbhetyādi | vidrohanaṃ khaṇḍanam || 64  65 ||

yadi na bhāṣayed buddho 'pi san || 66 67 ||

sarvatantranidānaṃ ca sandhyābhāṣaśca taddyotakaḥ paṭalastathoktaḥ || 
mahāpaṇḍitācāryaratnākaraśāntikṛtāyāṃ muktāvalyāṃ hevajrapañjikāyāṃ dvitīyakalpe sandhyābhāṣapaṭalaḥ tṛtīyaḥ ||

hevajrasarvatantramudraṇapiṇḍārtho nāma caturthaḥ paṭalaḥ

vajragarbhetyādi | pramukhāḥ pūrvaṅgamāḥ | sandeha iti | prākṛtayor gītanāṭyayorakuśalatvāt sandehaḥ || 1  2 ||

devatāsekata iti kva devatābhiṣekapaṭale abhiṣicyamāno mūrddhāyāṃ svakuleśo bhavatīti vacanāt | mudrāmiti mudraṇam || 3 ||

yat proktamiti akārādi aṃkāraparyantam || 4 ||

kollagiraṃ pīṭhaviśeṣaḥ | mummuniḥ kṣetraviśeṣaḥ | iyatā dūrasthayorapi tatkṣaṇaṃ mīlanaṃ sūcayati | ghaṇa a iti ghamakaṃ svārthe kaḥ | kipiṭṭā iti kṛpīṭaḥ ḍamaruka ityarthaḥ | ho iti āmantraṇe | karuṇam iti karuṇayā | ki a i na iti na kriyate | rolā ārāvaḥ kalakala ityarthaḥ | ma a ṇā iti mardanam | pijja a i iti pijjaśabdo dhātvantaram | śāli aśālijam | bharu pracuram || 6  7  ||

aṅga iti aṅgeṣu | caḍābī iti āropy | tahiṃ jeti tatra ca | sarāveti śrāyopi | paṇi a ha iti praveśyate | 
iyatā catasro gāthāścatuṣpādikāḥ arddhayorante sayamakā uktāaḥ | āsāṃ pāde pāde trayo gaṇāścaturmātrāḥ | dvayorgāthayoḥ prāgvādeṣu tṛtīyagaṇo dvimātraḥ | catasṛṇāmapi gāthānāmante dhruvakaṃ gātavyam tadevāha malayajetyādi || 8 ||

nāṭyamityādi | herukarūpeṇātmano yā smṛtirdṛḍhatvādamuṣitā tadyogena tadvattayā | tasyā eva smṛteḥ | prabandhavṛttirbhāvanā asyāṃ raktaṃ cittam satkṛtya prayogaḥ | aviratābhyāsena nirantarabhāvanā sātatyaprayogaḥ || 9 ||

vajradharmairiti padmanartteśvararūpeṇa taireva tribhiḥ | buddhairiti | vairocanarūpeṇa | mātṛbhiriti bhagavatībhiḥ nairātmyādirūpeṇetyarthaḥ | param iti atyartham | athavā ābhyāmeva param na prākṛtagītanṛttābhyām || 10 ||

vaśam iti vaśyam | anena tviti anenaiva || 11 ||

ghrāṇam iti gandham malayajaṃ candanam gītasya adhiṣṭhānaṃ yogiyoginībhiḥ tasya lakṣaṇaṃ cihnam || 12 13 ||

cihnāntaramāha rūtamityādi | bāhyodyāne 'pīti api śabdādākāśe 'pi | iyatā praśnaḥ pratyuktaḥ || 14 ||

dvitīyaṃ prativaktumāha mudraṇamityarthaḥ | mudraṇaṃ liṅganamaṅkaśceti paryāyāḥ | kasyā liṅganamityāha aṅgena lakṣyate kulam iti vyastaṃ kulaṃ kulāntaramudritam tasya bhāvanāyoge sati na siddhirnāpi sādhakaḥ syāt | yogabhramāt tasmānmudraṇaniyame yatnaḥ karttavya iti bhāvaḥ | 15 ||

nairātmyām ityādi | atra dveṣamohapaiśunyarāgerṣyā yathākramam akṣobhyavairocanaratnasambhavāmitābhāmoghasiddhyaḥ || 16  18 ||

icchayeti śraddhyā icchāmātreṇa vā || 19 ||

vyaktanirdeśāttṛtīyaṃ prativaktumāha ālerityādi | ālerādirakāraḥ | nairātmyeti nairātmyāyā bījam || 20 ||

dvipañcakam iti daśamam || 22 ||

caturthaṃ prativaktumāha kulapaṭala ityādi | dviṣoḍaśeti dvātriṃśat | nāḍīdvayadvayeti dve dve nāḍyau | ekaikayoginyaḥ kramaśa iti ekaikayoginī yathākramam || 24 ||

lalanetyādi | lalanādināḍītrayam ekā nairātmyayoginī | nanu dvātriṃśannāḍyaḥ tadarddhena ṣoḍaśa kalā āliḥ tatkutaḥ ṣoḍaśī kalā tyajyate ata āha sarvetyādi| sarvaśeṣāṃ sarvapaścimām aḥkāramityarthaḥ | kuta ityaha ṣoḍaśītyādi || 25 ||

na karotītyakāraṇam tathā hi tithikrame śuklapakṣe pañcadaśa candrakalāḥ prādurbhūya lokasyālokaṃ kurvanti | 
tataḥ kimityāha bodhicittam ityādi | aṃśakā iti kalāḥ | atra yathā''dyā yoginī tisro nāḍīkāstathoktyā'pīti sāmarthyāduktaṃ bhavati anyathā nāḍīdvayasya yoginībhiḥ saṃgraho na syāt || 26 ||

karpūram ityādi | ayamapūrvaḥ praśnaḥ | kiṃśabdaḥ praśne | avyayaṃ nityatvāt | pīvaraṃ vyāpitvāt | khagaṃ śūnyataikarasatvāt || 27 ||

yathā vadasīti na tyājyamityarthaḥ || 28 ||

maṇḍalacakrādīti ādiśabdādekavīrayogenāpi | svādhiṣṭhānakrama utpannakramo 'ṣṭamapaṭaloktaḥ || 29 ||

kvotpādanīyamityāha strītyādi || 30 ||

kathaṃ tatsukhāvatītyāha sukhasyetyādi | ava rakṣaṇagatiprītitṛptyavagamādiṣu | sukhamavati nityaṃ sthāpayatīti sukhāvatī | atirauṇādiko vasativat | kathaṃ vajradharasyādhāraḥ mahāsukhatvād vajriṇaḥ | kathaṃ buddhabodhisattvānām tena teṣāṃ saṃgrahāt || 31 ||

nanvetat sukhaṃ saṃsāra eva nirvāṇārthinastu vayam ata āha evamevetyādi | atra saṃsārastanmārgaśca saṃsāra ityuktaḥ nirvāṇaṃ tanmārgaśca nirvāṇamityuktam | pratipadyata iti jñāyate || 32 ||

upapattimāha saṃsāramityādinā | amī iti rūpavedanācakṣurdveṣādayaḥ | nirvāṇā iti paramārthataḥ advayaprakāśamātratvāt sarvadharmāṇām dvayapratibhāsānāmaśarīratvāt tatpratibhāsānāṃ bhrāntīnāmāgantukatvāt | kathaṃ tarhy etadeva saṃsāra ityata āha mohādityādi | mohād ajñānāt dvayabhrānterityarthaḥ | amūḍha iti abhrāntasya saṃsāramiti saṃsarataḥ | nirvṛtāyata iti nirvāṇavad bhavati || 33  34 ||

kathamityāha nirvṛtibodhicittaṃ hi vivṛti saṃvṛtirūpakam iti | yasmād amūḍhasya vivṛttirdharmakāyavat saṃvṛtiḥ sambhogakāyavat | iyatā karpūraṃ na tyajed iti samanvitam | kastasyātyāga ityāha cāruvaktrām ityādi || 35 ||

mudrām iti prakṛtāmeva || 37 ||

edhanāya iti varddhanāya || 39 ||

nairātmyarūpakam iti nairātmyārūpam | tasya iti nairātmyāyāḥ | saukhyam iti bolasukhaṃ herukasvabhāvahūṃkārākāraṃ nābhimaṇḍale || 40 ||

sā iti nairātmyā | dhī iti prajñā | prajñā iti prakṛṣṭajñānam | yogata iti yoge || 41 ||

na sā ityādi | nirābhāsajñānasvabhāvatvādasyā ākārasya cānutpādārthatvāditi bhāvaḥ | tasyāṃ tasyāḥ tayā iti yasmāt saiva sarvavidyāḥ mahāmudreti saiva | prajñayaiveti tayaiva || 42  44 ||

saiva maṇḍalacakram iti tasyāpi mahāsukhamayatvāt | pañcajñānasvarūpiṇīti ayamuddeśaḥ || 45 ||

asyaiva nirdeśaḥ ādarśetyādi | ahamiti śrīherukaḥ yoginya iti yoginīti | kimasyāstattvamityāha svarūpamityādi | iti pañcamapraśnottaram || 46  47 ||

vajragarbha āha iti | kimāha ṣaṣṭhaṃ praśnaṃ cakramityādi | utpattikrame 'yamarthaḥ cakram ādhārādheyamaṇḍalam | bhāvanāmārgastasyaivotpattiparipāṭiḥ | devatānāṃ sukhodayamiti | yathā tatra devatānāṃ sukhotpattiḥ | utpannakrame tvayamartha cakraṃ niṣprapañcasukham | bhāvanā parisyandaḥ mārgaṃ padmavajre | devatānāṃ sukhodayaṃ candradravaṃ sarvametadaṣṭame paṭale vistareṇa kathitam | nāpūrvaṃ saṃvaramiti kīdṛśamiti śeṣaḥ | iyatā praśnaḥ | kathayasveti prārthanā || 48 ||

āha iti | kimāha yoginyā ityādikam uttaram | dehamadhyaṃ nābhiḥ | akāramiti ādyasvaraḥ | sthitamiti sthirameva nityam | yoginyā iti nairātmyāyāḥ | saṃvaramiti saṃvaraḥ | saṃvaraśabdasyārthamāha yathetyādi | yathābāhyam adhyātmam api tathaiva draṣṭavyam na tasmādūnamityarthaḥ dehe saṃvṛtatvāt saṃkṣiptataratvād vā saṃvaram iti bhāvaḥ || tadiha yathaiva nairātmyāyā dehastathaiva nābhistho 'kāra ityuktaṃ bhavati || 49 ||

bolasaukhyam iti nābherakāre bolāgraṃ gate hṛdayādakārāgraṃ gato hūṃkāro bolasaukhyam sā mahāmudrā yogino herukadevasya saṃvara ityarthaḥ | tadeva vajrāyatanam bodhicittam sa evopāyaḥ | guhyayorakārahūṃkārayoḥ samāpattyā | bāhyadvandvaṃ nairātmyāherukadehayoḥ suratam | nidarśitaṃ nikṣipya darśitaṃ bhavatītyarthaḥ || 50 ||

trikāyamityādi | sarvabuddhānāṃ pratyekamanto nirmāṇakāyo 'nanto dharmakāyo 'nantaśca sambhogakāyastrikāyam | tad dehamadhyastham | kathaṃ tannidarśyate katamena saṃvareṇa cakrarūpeṇa nirmāṇādicakratrayarūpeṇa catuḥṣaṣṭidalāṣṭadalaṣoḍaśadalāmbujākāreṇa | tasyaiva kāyatrayasya parijñānaṃ samatājñānaṃ svābhāvikaḥ kāyaḥ | sa evānantaścaturtho buddhānāṃ kāyo mahāsukhacakram | mahāsukhacakrarūpeṇa saṃvareṇa dvātriṃśaddalakamalākāreṇa nidarśyata ityarthaḥ || 51 ||

cakrāṇāṃ nāmānyāha dharmetyādi | sthānānyāha yonītyādi | yonisthānaṃ yoniḥ strīpuruṣayornābheradhaḥ | trayaḥ kāyā iti saha caturtheneti śeṣaḥ || 52 ||

sthānasambandhe yuktiṃ darśayitumāha aśeṣāṇāmityādi | yatreti yonau | pragīyata iti prasiddhā | tatra syād iti nirmitisādhanatvena pratyāsatteḥ | api ca nirmāṇaṃ sthāvaraṃ yataḥ buddhavajradharāṇāṃ svakāyādinirmāṇaṃ yāvat tatkaraṇīyaḥ sattvārthastāvadavasthānāt sthāvaram | ataḥ sthāvaratvenāpi pratyāsatteryonireva tasya sthānam | kathaṃ yoniḥ sthāvaraḥ | trikoṇatvena pṛthvīsādharmyāt || 53 ||

nanu nirmāṇakāya utpattau kartā yonirapi karaṇam tato na tulyamanayorutpattisādhanatvamiti ced āha utpadyata ityādi nirmyaya iti nirmīyate | asyārtha utpadyata iti karmakartari prayogāt | nirmāṇakāyena buddhā jāyante yonijāḥ sattvā yoninā jāyante ya ta ccādhikaraṇaṃ karaṇamapi tadyathā sthālyāṃ pacati sthālyā pacatīti tadanayorutpattau karaṇatvaṃ tulyam | 
dharmamiti sarvadharmāṇāṃ samyak paricchedaḥ | cittasvarūpamiti cittādavyatiriktam | dharmakāyamiti dharmakāyasya sthānam cittasthānatvāt || 54 ||

rasarūpiṇāmiti rasānām | kaṇṭhaśabdaḥ pūrveṇābhisambadhyate | sambhogacakraśceti kaṇṭha iti vartate sambhogasāmānyāditi bhāvaḥ | kaḥ punaḥ sambhogakāyaḥ dharmarahasyadeśanā | mahāsukham iti caturthaḥ kāyaḥ | śirasi sthitam iti śirasi eva somasthānatvād uttamāṅgatvācceti bhāvaḥ || 55 ||

catvāri cakrāṇi yathā kāyānāṃ saṃvarastathā phalānāṃ nikāyānāṃ ceti darśayannāha evamityādi | evaṃkāra iti yonisthaṃ the nirmāṇacakre | 
kimetadityāha phalamityādi | vibheditaṃ viśeṣitaṃ niṣyandaphalaṃ vipākaphalaṃ puruṣakāraphalaṃ vaimalyaphalaṃ cetyarthaḥ | athaitāni phalāni ko bhuṅkte kaśca dadātītyāha karmabhug ityāha | karmaphalāanāṃ niṣyandīnāṃ bhoktrī prajaiva nātmā karmaiva dāyakaṃ neśvaraḥ || 56  57 ||

kāyacatuṣṭaye niṣyandādilakṣaṇaṃ kathaṃ jñeyamityāha yathetyādi | niṣyando hetusadṛśa iti lakṣaṇam taccāsti nirmāṇakāye | yathā hi hetvavasthāyāṃ kṛtaṃ karma dadāti tathā bhuṅkte phalaṃ nirmitaḥ kāyaḥ ubhayoravikalpatvād | vipākaṃ tadviparyāsaṃ sadṛśād viparītam adhikamityarthaḥ | etacca lakṣaṇaṃ dharmakāye 'sti sajalpatvāt | puruṣakāramupārjanaṃ kuśalānām tacca deśanādīnām | tasmāt sambhogakāyaḥ puruṣakāraphalam | caturthaṃ phalaṃ vaimalyam | tatra yogaviśuddhiḥ yogajaṃ jñānaṃ yogaḥ tena śuddhiḥ suviśuddhaṃ mahāsukham tasmād vaimalyaṃ mahāsukhacakram | nikāyaṃ kāyamiti vakṣyati | tasmānnirmāṇādikāyāscatvāro nikāyāḥ || 58 ||

sthāvaratvayogāt sthāvarī | sarvaḥ sat vādo 'smāditi sarvāstivādaḥ | vādānāṃ samudbhavaḥ kāraṇam || 59 ||

saṃvidyogāt saṃvidī | atikaṭhinatvān mahāsaṃghaṃ śiraḥ tadyogān mahāsaṃghī | ata evāha ke sthitaṃ yata iti sthāvaryādiśabdāḥ sthāvarītyādiśabdanāṃ paryāyāḥ | tatra guhyasamāpattyā mahāmudrāsiddhiruktā | cakracatuṣṭayena kāyacatuṣṭayasampattiḥ sarvakuśalaphalasampattiḥ śrāvakasampattirāryabodhisattvagaṇasampattiśca saṃkṣepeṇa tricatuṣkāyalābhāt || 60 ||

idānīṃ bodhisattvagaṇasampattiṃ vistareṇāha udaramityādinā | udaraṃ mātuḥ kukṣiḥ | vītarāgau go janmakāle | dharṣaṇe 'pi rāgābhāvājjarāyurulvaḥ | ujjvalam amlānam || 61 ||

ahamiti śvāsaḥ | tatheti yathāhamiti mantrajāpaḥ tathā'kāro haṃkāraśca || 62 ||

dhvanan mantram iti etadeva trayam | nagna iti abaddhakakṣaḥ || 63 ||

daśabhūmīśvara iti janmakāle tata ūrdhvaṃ sthiracalabodhād buddha iti bhāva | udarādayo 'pi bāhyānāṃ vihārādīnāṃ saṃvarāḥ parasattveṣu draṣṭavyāsteṣāṃ daśabhūmiṣu pratiṣṭhāpanāya || 64 ||

etāṃ bhāratīmiti sattvā buddhā evetyetad vacanam || 66 ||

kṣitijaletyādi | atrāyuktādau caturdaśamātrau yuktādau tu dvādaśamātrau | kasmāt dvipathakametat | kṣitijalapavanahutāśanānāṃ yūyaṃ bhāginyo devyaḥ | sunabhaḥ prapañcayāmi tattvaṃ meyaṃ naiva jānāti ko 'pītyarthaḥ | 
iha catvāri bhūtāni bodhimārgaḥ | pañcamaṃ bhūtaṃ bodhiḥ | tadubhayaṃ na kaṣcidanyaḥ sattvo jānāti | tasmānna sattvā buddhā eveti samudāyārthaḥ |
tatra dharmadhātorālambane prathamataḥ kāṭhinyajñānaṃ pṛthivīdhātuḥ | drutajñānamabdhātuḥ | bhāvanāparipākastejodhātuḥ | jñānadravasañcāro vāyudhātuḥ | eteṣāṃ bhāginyaścaturṇāmanyatamānyatamasvabhāvā yūyaṃ yathāyogam | nirābhāsaṃ mahāsukhaṃ sunabhaḥ nirmalanabhonibhatvāt | tato vajradharasya tattvaṃ prapañcayāmīti | udbhāvanāsaṃvṛtyā sattvebhyaḥ sūcayāmi | kutaḥ naivaṃ tattattvaṃ ko 'pi sattvo jānāti | pratyātmavedyasya tasya sattvairasākṣātkṛtatvāt | ataśca sattvā na buddhā eveti | śrutvā jīvaprāptāḥ || 67  68 ||

prāk tarhi kasmāduktaṃ sattvā buddhā eva | ityata āha bhagavān ityādi | sattvā buddhā eveti tathāhi tathataiva suviśuddhā buddhaḥ sā ca prakṛtyaiva suviśuddhā | kasmādevaṃ na pratīyata iti ced āha kintvityādi || 69 ||

evamityādivacanam devīnām | eva ityuddeśaḥ satyam iti nirdeśaḥ na mṛṣā iti pratinirdeśaḥ | yadi malairāvṛtāḥ || 70 ||

āvṛtā eva taiḥ kuta eṣāṃ bodhirityāha ghasma i ityādi ghūrṇate garalasya bhakṣaṇe lokaḥ yo niścetanaḥ | aviṣīkaraṇe manaskarma atra cetanā | mohavivarjito viṣatattvajñānāt | viṣahare tattve mano 'syeti tattvamanāḥ ya iti vartate tasya paraṃ truṭyati śokaḥ bhakṣitaviṣapīḍājanitaḥ | eṣa dṛṣṭāntaḥ || 71 ||

dārṣṭāntikamāha tathetyādinā | nirvṛtirmokṣaḥ | suṣṭhu kṛtaśramāḥ sukṛtaśramāḥ | akliṣṭamajñānam avidyā ādya śabdo 'tra mātsaryakrodhakausīdyādayaḥ avidyākhyāḥ | kleśo mohaḥ ādiśabdād dveṣarāgādayaḥ ta eva bandhanāni taiḥ || 72 ||

sattvā buddhā evetyatra yuktyantaramāha abuddha ityadinā | sattvaika iti eko 'pi sattvaḥ | saṃbodhād iti saṃvedanāt | svasyeti cittasya karttari ṣaṣṭhī jātāvekavacanam sarvacittairityarthaḥ | taiḥ kasya saṃvadenādityāha svasya ceti cakāro 'vadhāraṇe svarūpasyaivetyarthaḥ | svarūpaṃ ca sarvadharmāṇāṃ dvayaśūnyameva tasya darśanaṃ śūnyatādarśanameva | tadeva ca bodhiriti buddhā eva sarvasattvāḥ | na vai śūnyatādarśanamātraṃ bodhiḥ | kiṃ tarhi yanmahāsukham | na ca nārakādīnāṃ tatsukhamastīti ata āha naraketyādi || 73 ||

svabhāvata iti prakṛtyā samatayetyarthaḥ | śūnyatādarśanamātrasyābhedāditi yāvat | nanu yādṛśaṃ devāsurāṇāṃ sukhaṃ tādṛśaṃ nārakādīnāṃ sukhaṃ nāsti | mā bhūta | na jānanti yataḥ saukhyaṃ devasyāpyasurasya ca | na khalvāryāḥ surasurasukhaṃ sukhataḥ paśyanti anityatvena viyogaduḥkhatvāt sāsravatvena duḥkhāntarakāraṇatvācca | tasmānmahāsukhameva sukham | tacca yathā devānāṃ tathā nārakāṇāmapyasti nirvikalpasamatayā | 74 ||

yuktyāntaramāha na buddha ityādinā | anyatra iti svacittādanyaḥ | tasmād yathā'nte 'pi | cittameva bodhiḥ sattvānāṃ tathā prāgapi teṣāṃ cittasamatayā || 75 ||

caṇḍāletyādinā tantramāhātmyamāha hevajram iti | hekāreṇa karuṇāmahāsukhamityarthaḥ vajraṃ prajñā śūnyatādarśanamityarthaḥ | āgamyeti idaṃ hevajramanantaroktābhirupapattibhirāmukhīkṛtya | gagimiti nītiḥ || 76  77 ||

viśodhayanti viṣayān iti sarvadharmān bodhisādhanīkurvanti | iyatā sarveṇa saṃvarapraśnasyottaram | mudraṇapraśne dattamuttaraṃ mudraṇaṃ liṅgamaṅkaśca ityādinā | tatraivāṣṭau praśnāntarāṇi aṣṭau cottarāṇi bhavanti || 78 ||

tānyāha pṛthivītyādinā | atra praśnaślokāḥ vajragarbhasya | kakkhaṭatvaṃ hi pṛthivī tacca mohaḥ kāyaśca tau ca vairocanaḥ | tasmāttenaiva mudraṇaṃ yuktam na akṣobhyeṇeti praśnārthaḥ | nānyatra ādhāre lalitaṃ vilāsaḥ | vairocanamiti vairocanastham | tataḥ kāyamiti kāyasvabhāvam | pukkasīṃ cittenetyakṣobhyeṇa || 79  80  ||

śavarīmiti śavaryāḥ sthitirādhāro vyavasthādhikaraṇam | cittamiti cittastham | mohamiti kāyaḥ | ataśca cittamiti śavarīṃ mohena iti vairocanena | nānyena mudraṇaṃ nānyamudraṇam || 81  83 ||

raktañceti strīpuṣpam ataśca tejaso raktarūpatvād varṇataḥ | rāgamiti caṇḍālīm | piśunena ratnasambhavena || 84 ||

rāgasya mudreṇeti amitābhamahāmudrayā || 86 ||

mata iti pramāṇasiddho 'bhiṣeka ityarthaḥ | eṣa praśnaḥ | pūrvokteneti pukkasyāmuktena || 87 ||

idamuttaraṃ caurītyādi yāvad ghasmarīṃ ceti | tenaiva nyāyena tathaiva ceti śavarīcaṇḍālīḍombinī praśneṣūktena yathākramamiti praśnatrayam | tayā yuktyeti śavaryādyuttareṣūktyā | idam uttaratrayam || 88 ||

vajradhāriṇīti kuliśadharā || 89 ||

evamityādi hevajrasya vacanam | evaṃkāre samāsīnaḥ nairātmyāsamāpannaḥ | vajrasattva iti hevajrayogī | diśed iti dadyāt | praṇavo vyākhyātaḥ || 90 ||

inda jama jala jakkheti dikpatīkānāmāmantraṇam bhūta vahni vāyu rakkheti vidikpatīnām candeti candraḥ | sujjeti sūryaḥ | anayoreva viśeṣaṇaṃ yathākramaṃ māda bappa mātaḥ pitarityarthaḥ | athavā mādeti pṛthivī bappeti brahman | aṭṭhasappeti aṣṭau nāgāḥ | sāheti svāhāśabdaḥ śāntyarthaḥ || 91 ||

edamiti evaṃ baliṃ bhuñjeti bhuṅkṣva jiṃghreti jighra | kimityāha phulladhūpyeti puṣpadhūpāvityarthaḥ | kiṃ tenetyāha māṃsa viḍghyeti māṃsamāṃsīyaṃ bṛṃhaya varddhaya | evaṃ svārthaṃ kṛtvā ambhakajja savva sāha asmākaṃ sarvakāryaṃ sādhaya | kiñca khanti khuṇi pheḍa gāda asmākaṃ gātrāt kṣatiṃ kṣataṃ ca sphoṭaya || 92 ||

evaṃ balidāne 'nuśaṃsāṃ gāthādvyenāha anenetyādinā | bhūtān iti bhūtānām | teṣu iti teṣām | sukhamanāvilamiti nirmalā prītiḥ | devāśceti devatāśca | jagataḥ suṣṭhu bhūtiḥ sampattiḥ ebhya iti jagatsubhūtayaḥ | pañcakulamantradevatā ityarthaḥ | 94 ||

vaśyaṃ ca abhicāraśceti vaśyābhicāram | nāśanaṃ nāśaḥ | māraṇaṃ cākarṣaṇaṃ ceti māraṇākarṣaṇam | śāntiriti śāntikaṃ pauṣṭikaṃ caiveti pauṣṭikaṃ ca tasyeti bhavediti śeṣaḥ | yo dadyāt balimiti sambandhaḥ | iheti hevaje | bhūtā indrādayaḥ | śāścaditi nityam || 95 ||

vajragarbha āheti pṛṣṭavān | kasmāt prāgeva na pṛṣṭavān yuktibhedāt | khecarīti khecaryāḥ | bhūcarīti bhūcaryāḥ | kasya mudrata iti kayā mudrayā | prāk na jñātaṃ mayeti pūrvaṃ na jñātam || 96 ||

katham triguhyaṃ kāyavākcittabhedāt | tatkathaṃ cakramadhya ityāha adha ityādi | yathākramaṃ sambandhaḥ || 97 ||

yasmāt kāyavajriṇī kāyavajrasvabhāvā tasmāt kāyamudrī || 98 ||

madhyajeti madhye jātā || 99 ||

kulāni ṣaḍvidhānīti ṣaḍvidhaṃ kulam | akṣobhyavairocanaratnasambhavāstrayaḥ amitaprabherṣyau dvau atha vajrasattva ityekaḥ || 100 ||

ete kayā śuddhyā vibhāvyā ityāha dveṣamohapiśunarāgerṣyāsaukhyamiti samāhāre dvandvaḥ | īrṣyāyā ikārasya ādguṇaḥ ākārasya hrasvaḥ śuddhyā'nayeti dveṣādiśuddhyā | anukramata iti yathākramam | evaṃ ṣaṭkulāni || 101 ||

yathā'tra pañcatrīṇyekaṃ ca tadgāthādvayenāha vihāya ityādinā | ṣaṭ pañcakamiti ṣaṭkaṃ pañcakaṃ ca || 102  103 ||

sarvatantramiti etadeva kṛtsnaṃ hevajratantram | sarvatantraṃ ca mudraṇaṃ ca | mudraṇasya pṛthag grahaṇaṃ prādhānyasūcanārtham | tasya piṇḍārthaḥ saṃkṣepārthaḥ | taddyotakaḥ paṭalastathokta iti |

mahāpaṇḍitācāryaratnākaraśāntikṛtāyāṃ muktāvalyāṃ hevajrapañjikāyāṃ dvitīyakalpe mudraṇapiṇḍārthapaṭalaḥ caturthaḥ |

hevajrābhyudayaḥ pañcamaḥ paṭalaḥ

ṣoḍaśetyādinā herukābhyudayapaṭalaṃ prastauti | āsyāni mukhāni | urūjaṅghā'ṅghrisamudāyāścaraṇāḥ | kandharā grīvā || 3 ||

asmaccakramiti madīyaṃ maṇḍalam | pañcayoginyo garbhapuṭasthāḥ | daśabhirbāhyapuṭasthābhiḥ parivāritāḥ parivṛtā yasmiṃstattathoktam | prāk na jñātamiti devatāpaṭale 'pyanuktatvāt || 4 ||

kapālakaṃ padmasukhapālakatvāt | samprakāśate samyak prakāśayati || 5 ||

cakramiti madīyamādhāramaṇḍalam | yathā pūrvaṃ kathitamiti yathā tvadīyaṃ tathaivetyarthaḥ || 6 ||

ahamiti māṃ pañcākārābhisambodhikrameṇa vakṣyamāṇaśrīherukarūpāvirbhūtaṃ bhagavantaṃ vajrasattvamityarthaḥ | vidyāditi dhyāyāt | tvayā sārddham iti nairātmyārūpeṇāvirbhūtayā māmakyā sahitam | vicāraṇāparyantāt pūrvikā prītirānandākhyo mahārāgaḥ tasyānu paścād rāgaḥ prītiḥ anurāgaḥ vicāraṇāyāḥ paryantaḥ paramānandaḥ ityataḥ | tadubhayaṃ mahārāgānubhūtam tena lakṣitam | tadanu sahajānandasvarūpataḥ sahajānanda eva svarūpam asaṃvedanakālarūpānugasaṃvedanāt | tena tataḥ tanmātreṇaiva rūpeṇa lakṣitamityarthaḥ | 
a e taduttaro granthaḥ prāyeṇa bhinnakramaḥ sambandhakrameṇa vyākhyāsyāmo na pāṭhakrameṇa || 7 ||

sahajānandasvarūpata ityasmādanantaraṃ tato vajrītyādigāthāpañcakaṃ draṣṭavyam | tat iti tadanantaram | vajrīti tameva vajrasattvam | mahārāgād iti mahārāgajñāt sahajānandāt kāraṇāt | drutaṃ bhūtam iti jñānadravarūpatāmāpannam | svavidyayeti | ma sa hārthayoge tṛtīyā dhyāyāditi śeṣaḥ | ubhau vilīnau dhyāyādityarthaḥ | tata iti vilayānantaram | devya iti pukkasīśavarīcaṇḍalīḍombikāḥ svadigāgatāḥ svāsaneṣu nive vi ṣṭāḥ | codayantīti vilayasamādhervyutkrāntaṃ prerayanti nānāgītaiḥ | ekaikā gāthā tasyopahāro ḍhaukanaṃ tataḥ || 19 ||

tatrādau pukkasī codayati uṭṭha bharāḍo iti uttiṣṭha bhaṭṭāraka | karuṇamana karuṇāmanaskaḥ san | pukkasī mahu iti pukkasīṃ mām | paritāhīti paritrāyasva | kathamityāha mahāsuhetyādi mahāasukhaṃ mahāmokṣasukham  tadarthaṃ yogo dravodbhavā hevajramūrtiḥ tena yogena kāmayasva ramaya mām | chaḍḍahīti tyaja | suṇṇāsamāhīti śūnyākāraṃ samādhim dravarūpatāmityarthaḥ | chaḍḍahiṃ suṇṇasahāva ityapi pāṭhe dravarūpatāmityeṣa evārthaḥ kintu yamakaṃ vighaṭate | 20 ||

tataḥ śavarī | tojju iti tava | vihuṇṇe iti vihīnena bhāve ktaḥ viraheṇetyarthaḥ | marami havu iti mriye aham | uṭṭheti tuhuṃ hevajjeti uttiṣṭha tvaṃ hevajra | chaḍḍahi suṇṇasahāvaḍā iti tyaja śūnyasvabhāvam dravarūpatāmityarthaḥ | śavariha sijjaukajjeti śavaryāḥ sidhyatu kāryamiti || 21 ||

tataścaṇḍalī | lo a nimantīti sakalaṃ lokamarthakriyayā nimantrya | sura apahu iti he surataprabho | suṇṇe acchasi kīsa iti śūnyena dravarūpeṇa tiṣṭhasi | kasmāt ha uṃ caṇḍālī viṇṇamami iti ahaṃ caṇḍālī vijñāpayāmi | kiṃ vijñāpayasi ta i viṇṇa uhami na dīsa tvayā vinā na diśamabhyūhāmi andhakāramātraṃ paśyāmītyarthaḥ || 22 ||

tato ḍombī | indī ālī uṭṭha tuhuṃ iti he indrajālika uttiṣṭha tvam indrajālaṃ tavaitaditi bhāvaḥ | nāhaṃ māyāvīti cet āha ha uṃ jāṇami tuhu citta jānāmyahaṃ tava cittaṃ sakaitavam | ambhe ḍombī che a iti ḍombikā vayaṃ chekā nāgarikāḥ | maṇḍa iti evaṃ jānīha | aśakyā vayaṃ vañcayitum iti bhāvaḥ | ataśca mudhaiva mā karu mā kārṣīḥ | karuṇavicchitta iti karuṇāyā vicchittiṃ vicchedaṃ drutatayā | athavā mā kārṣīḥ karuṇāvikṣiptāṃ dravyarūpatayā nirastām | 23 ||

asya gāthāpañcakasyāntara aṃ hūṃ bhyāṃ ityādirekagāthā draṣṭavyā | mahāvajrī hevajraḥ | utthito dravamūrtita iti caturgīticodanānurodhena dravāvasthāṃ vihāya utthitaḥ | aṃ hūṃbhyāṃ iti aṃkārasahitena hūṃkāreṇa dravasaṃhārajena niṣpannaḥ | sphālayanniti āsphālayan | tarjayantamiti prathamārthe dvitīyā | evamaṣṭāsyamityādāvapi || 27 ||

asyā ekagāthāyā anantaram aṣṭāsyamityādikāḥ pañca gāthāḥ | 
āsyāni mukhāni | caraṇā urūjaḍghāḍghrasamudāyāḥ | catvāro mārāḥ samākrāntā aneneti tathoktam | bhayasyeti bhayānakasya || 8 ||

muṇḍamālayā kṛto hāro aneneti tathoktam | tāṇḍavaṃ raudranṛttam | bhayānakaṃ yathā bhavati tathā kṛṣṇavarṇam || 9 ||

sphārayed iti sphārayan | vigrahaḥ śarīram | ratiḥ paramānandaḥ saiva dvandvaṃ savikalpatvāt tatsamāpannam tasya pūrvaṃ sammukhīkaraṇāt | anena tattvena kiṃ mudramityāha nairātmyā saha sampuṭam nairātmyeti nairātmyayā || 10 ||

nistaraṅgaṃ niṣprapañcaṃ sukhaṃ sahajānandaḥ tadavāptaṃ prāpnuvantam | anena tattvena kiṃ mudram ityāha nistaraṅgasvarūpiṇam sarvaprapañcapratipakṣatvānnistaraṅgaṃ yat svarūpaṃ hevajrarūpam tadasyāstīti tathoktam | 
evamanayostattvaṃ hevajracakre viparyayeṇa nairātmyācakre nāyakabhedāt | 
aṣṭānāṃ mukhānāṃ katamaṃ kīdṛśamityāha mūletyādi | mahākṛṣṇam atyantakṛṣṇaṃ dehavat || 11 ||

vikarālinaṃ vikaṭadaṃṣṭram | caturviṃśatinetrādyam iti kim tanmukhāṣṭakaṃ trinetratvāt || 12 ||

asya gāthāpañcakasyānantaraṃ śṛṅgāretyādirekā gāthā | sarvamukheṣu śṛṅgāraḥ śvete śāntaḥ | aśveteṣu raudraḥ | śeṣeṣu yathāyogam || 26 ||

asyānantaraṃ hastyaśvetyādigāthādvayam | kharo gardabhaḥ | gāvo tauḥ | otuko viḍālaḥ | ete dvipādayordakṣiṇeṣu bhujeṣu yānyaṣṭau kapālāni teṣu cihnāni | 
pṛthivyādayo vāmeṣu bhujeṣu yadaṣṭakapālakaṃ tatra cihnāni | 
anena sarveṇa ādiyogo nāma samādhiḥ sūcitaḥ || 24  25 ||

asyānantaraṃ tvayā mayetyādigāthāṣaṭkam | pure ramye ramaṇīye maṇḍale | tvayā nairātmyayā saha mayā hevajreṇa krīḍateti mayi hevajre krīḍati sati | kathaṃ krīḍati ratinirbharaiḥ ratiḥ māyā suratam tasyā nirbharairatiśayaiḥ | niḥsṛtāḥ araṇinirmanthanāgninyāyena nirgatā satī taurī pūrvadvāre susaṃsthitā samyagavasthitā | indradig iti aṣṭāsvapi sambadhyate | indre svādhipatau dṛg dṛṣṭirasyā iti indradig ārṣa ikāraḥ || 13 ||

mathyata iti manthaḥ mathyate 'neneti manthānaḥ | punariti paścāt || 14 ||

mahādvandvaṃ mahāratam | śeṣaṃ sugamam || 16 ||

asya gāthāṣaṭkasyānantaraṃ gaṃ caṃ ityādirekagāthā | sṛjedāsām iti etā aṣṭau yoginī yathākramaṃ niḥsārayed | kuta ityāha adhipatītyādi | adhipatiḥ maṇḍaleśvaraḥ ratirnairātmyā tayorbījabhyām | kamalodaragatacittadravamayābhyāṃ hūṃ aṃ iti hūṃkārāṃkārabhyām jvālābhiḥ karālau danturau tau ca tau nīlau ca || 28 ||

asyā ekagāthāyā anantaraṃ gauryā ityādigāthā 'ṣṭakam | 
rohito matsyaḥ | kṛpīṭaṃ ḍamarukam | varāhaḥ śūkaraḥ || 30 ||

candramaṇiḥ candrakāntaḥ || 36 ||

upendro viṣṇuḥ | vaivasvato yamaḥ | vittanāyakaḥ kuveraḥ | viṣṭaram āsanam | yathākramam || 37 ||

asya gāthā'ṣṭakasyānantaraṃ mātṛcakra ityādirekagāthā | 
cakraṃ samūhaḥ | anena sarvena maṇḍalarājāgrī nāma dvitīyaḥ samādhiḥ sūcitaḥ | 
karmarājāgrī tṛtīyaḥ mantrayogavibhāgaḥ tantrānusāreṇa tadanyatantreṣu draṣṭavyaḥ | evamanena samādhitrayeṇa mantrajāpasahitena pūrvasevādikaṃ karttavyam || 29 ||

ataḥ prasaṅgena mantraṃ bhagavatī papraccha bhagavānuvāca tadubhayaṃ prastuvannāha bolakam ityādi | 
kīdṛśaṃ mantram ityāha strīṇāmityādi sugamam || 38  39 ||

tadaham ityādi bhagavato vacanam | tad iti yathābhīṣṭaṃ mantram || 40 ||

yaditi yatkarma | kṛṣṭeti ākṛṣṭā || 41  42 ||

anenaiva mantreṇa yogātmeti yogī | śeṣaṃ sugamam || 43  44 ||

mantramāha vedānāmityādi | ādimamakṣaraṃ praṇavaḥ | bhūṣitaṃ prakṛtyaiva || 45 ||

mantrānte hakārā dvādaśa svarasaṃyuktāḥ paryante phaṭ svāhā || 47 ||

pṛcchate maṇḍalam iti lekhyamaṇḍalam | tatreti pṛṣṭe sati śāstā babhāṣe iti śeṣaḥ | mahājñānī ācāryo maṇḍalaṃ svayaṃ likhet na citrakareṇa lekhayedādau || 48  49 ||

kalaśān likhediti citrayet | aṣṭāviti devīnām arthād vijayakalaśaṃ sārvākārmikakalaśaṃ ca | kena rajasā maṇḍalaṃ likhedityāha pañcaratnetyādi || 51 ||

tanmadhya iti bāhyapuṭasya madhye padmaṃ garbhapuṭasvabhāvam | puṣkaraṃ karṇikā || 52 ||

śarabham iti siṃham || 53 ||

devīnāmityādi | yathā devīnāṃ varṇastathā taccihnānāmityarthaḥ | madhye yacchuklakaroṭaṃ tad viśvavajrāṅkitaṃ likhet || 55 ||

vijayakalaśaṃ tato dadyādityarthād gamyate | paścād yathāsthānaṃ śeṣakalaśāniti || 56 ||

praveṣṭavyā iti praveśayitavyāḥ | dviraṣṭābdā iti ṣoḍaśābdāḥ || 58 ||

aṣṭau vidyā ityuktam kāstā ityāha jananītyādi | nāmādibhiretā grahyā na svarūpata eva | śvaśruketi śvaśrūḥ | āsām iti imāḥ || 59  60 ||

yathā kathitā iti abhiṣekapaṭale | stutipūjeti stutiḥ pūjā ca || 65 ||

viramādīti viramānandāt pūrvaṃ paramāntakamiti paramānandāt param | kiṃ punastadityāha antamiti prajñājñānamityarthaḥ | etacca sarvatantreṣu gopitam na vyaktīkṛtam | antaṃ prakāśitam iti sarvānte 'smiṃstantre prakāśitam | anena sarvatantrāṇām uttaratantrametaditi sūcayati || 66 ||

tatkṣaṇaṃ kīdṛśam iti atyantavyaktīkaraṇārthaḥ praśnaḥ || 67 ||

bhagavānāha āḍ neityādi | pañcānāṃ na u śavdānāṃ na cetyarthaḥ | ādyantau yathākramaṃ paramaviramau | bhavanirvāṇe api tāveva | rāgavirāgāvapi tāveva | anyatra tatra sahajāpekṣayā pūrvatvādādiḥ paramatvādantaḥ | sa bhavatyasmāditi bhavaḥ tannirodhatvānnirvāṇam | utpitsusahajālambanatvād rāgaḥ anantaraniruddhasahajālambanatvād virāgaḥ | tābhyāmapi hīnatvāt prathamānanda evaṃ kāṃkṣā madhyama ityucyate tadyathā madhyamaṃ śarīraṃ madhyamā vārtteti | ete trayo 'pi yo na bhavati viramādiparamāntakam iti cānantarameva prakāśitaḥ | ehu so paramamahāsuha u eṣo 'sau paramamahāsukhaḥ sahajānanda ityarthaḥ evamasya kṣaṇaniyama uktaḥ |


svarūpamāha na u para na u appāṇa yatkhyātau na paro grāhyaḥ khyāti na cātmā grāhakaḥ khyāti | uttamasukhamātramadvayaṃ nirābhāsamanantaṃ yat prakāśate so 'sau sahajānanda ityarthaḥ uktaṃ ca melāpakapaṭale 
ānandena sukhaṃ kiñcit paramānando tato 'dhikam | 
viramānande virāgaḥ syāt sahajānandaṃ tu śeṣataḥ || 
prathamaṃ sparśākākṣaṃ dvitīyaṃ sukhavāñchayā | 
tṛtīyaṃ rāganāśatvāccaturthaṃ tena bhāvyate || 
paramānandaṃ bhavaṃ proktaṃ nirvāṇaṃ ca virāgataḥ | 
madhyamānandamātraṃ tu sahajamebhirvivarjitam || iti || 
