viramasahajayostṛtīyacaturthatvamuktam tatkatham heyamānandatrayaṃ gaṇayitvā paścād upādeyasya sahajasya gaṇanāt taduktam notpattikramādityadoṣaḥ || 68 ||

yadi tarhi na u para na u appāṇa ityanena svarūpameva tattvasya kathitaṃ tadā svarūpeṇa tat kathyamānaṃ tadaivotpāditaṃ syāt na caivam ata āha svasavyetyādi | sambhoga iti vicāraṇāparipāke | pīḍayediti nāsāgram laharīdvayaṃ yathā bhavati āśu pīḍitaṃ dvau vārau muñcedityarthaḥ | athavā dvau kramau eko bāhyayā vidyayā dvitīyo 'dhyātmayā | tatra prathamaḥ prasiddha eva | dvitīyamāha svasavyetyādinā | tābhyāṃ pīḍayed iti tābhyāṃ kamaladvārīkṛtābhyāṃ gharṣayet | śeṣaṃ pūrvavat || 69 ||

paścādutpadyate jñānaṃ sahajākhyaṃ na prāgupadeśamātreṇa | kumārī surataṃ yathā iti tadyathā kumāryāḥ surataṃ sakhībhirupadiṣṭamapi na tadaivotpadyate | kiṃ tarhi paścāt sambhogakāla evotpadyate | yenāpi sākṣātkṛtaṃ sahajaṃ so 'pi sākṣāt tatkathanāya na śakta iti khyāpayitumāha kimapītyādi | tatra iti tasmin kāle | mūkasya svapnaṃ yathā iti tadyathā mūkaḥ spaṣṭadṛṣṭamapi svapnaṃ na śaktaḥ sākṣāt kathayituṃ tadvad guravaḥ sahajānandam | kiṃ punastat ityāha paramāntaṃ madhyaviramamiti paramāntaṃ paramānandāt param | madhyaṃ viramamasyeti madhyaviramam madhyāhnaṃ madhyadinavat | ubhayostanmadhyaṃ na kevalasya viramasyeti ceti yadubhayoḥ sambandhī so 'nyatareṇāpi vyapadiśyate tadyathā gaurīsutaḥ skando harasutaḥ skanda iti | evamihāpi paramaviramayor madhyaṃ viramasya madhyamityuktam | śūnyāśūnyam iti grāhyagrāhakavirahādadvayavijñaptimātraṃ śūnyam tato 'pi śūnyācchūnyam | nirābhāsaṃ vijñaptimātram tadeva herukam dvayagrāhyasya dvayapratibhāsasya ca tenaiva bhakṣaṇāt | tu śabdo viśeṣārthaḥ etāvattu tasya svarūpakathanam na punaḥ sākṣātkathanam ityarthaḥ | evaṃ tāvad dṛṣṭāntasahajo 'pi duravabodhaḥ kiṃ punardārṣṭāntikasahajaḥ | uktaṃ hi melāpakapaṭale 
nāntena kathyate sahajaṃ na kasminnapi kathyate | 
ātmanā jñāyate puṇyād guruparvopasevayā || iti || 
