ayamasya paṭalasya samāsato 'rthaḥ | vistaratastu hevajrābhyudayamaṇḍalopāyikāyāmasmatkṛtāyāṃ draṣṭavyaḥ || 70 ||

mahāpaṇḍitācāryaratnākaraśāntikṛtāyāṃ muktāvalyāṃ hevajrapañjikāyāṃ dvitīyakalpe hevajrābhyudayapaṭalaḥ pañcamaḥ ||

hevajrapaṭavidhānapaṭalaḥ ṣaṣṭhaḥ

devītyādi | kakṣāviti kakṣayoḥ | pañcamudrām iti pañcāṇāṃ dhāraṇeti sandhividhānamupāyaḥ kriyā ācāraḥ || 1  2 ||

samayīti samānasamayasthena | kurcyeti kūrcikayā || 7 ||

samayādhiṣṭhānayogo devīrūpabhāvanam || 8 ||

bhakṣayanniti bhakṣayatā | li le khanīyamiti pūrveṇa sambandhaḥ || 10 ||

rūpayauvanābhyāṃ saubhāgyaṃ yasyāḥ sā tathā || 11 ||

mahāpaṇḍitācāryaratnākaraśāntikṛtāyāṃ muktāvalyāṃ hevajrapañjikāyāṃ dvitīyakalpe hevajrapaṭavidhānapaṭalaḥ ṣaṣṭhaḥ ||

bhojanapaṭalaḥ saptamaḥ

athāhetyādi | katamamiti kīdṛśam || 1 ||

tailasthāne mahāmadhu tatkṛtenāñjanena masī tanmasī || 2 ||

na siddhiḥ syād iti sādhakasya | paraloko janmāntaram || 3 ||

sampradāyaprayuktaḥ pravṛttaḥ | kadācaneti kadācit | adhvagocara iti adhvagamane || 4 ||

ādiśed iti deśitavān | yatra iti gaṇamaṇḍale || 5  6 ||

puraṃ gṛham | navākhyāmiti navasaṃkhyam || 7  8 ||

samayasyeti śālijādeḥ || 10 ||

mahābhāge iti mahātmane || 12 ||

mahāpaṇḍitācāryaratnākaraśāntikṛtāyām muktāvalyāṃ hevajrapañjikāyāṃ dvitīyakalpe bhojanapaṭalaḥ saptamaḥ ||

vineyapaṭalo nāma aṣṭamaḥ

tatretyādi | saṃvṛtirdvairyādiḥ | ācāraḥ priyāvādādiḥ rūpaṃ varṇākārasaurabhādiḥ || 1 ||

mṛganābhiḥ kastūrikā tayā samaprabhaṃ tulyapratibhāsam | indīvaram utpalam | ivaśabdo 'trāpi sambadhyate | gandhamivācared udvahediti sambandhaḥ || 3 ||

sugandhaḥ śobhano gandhaḥ | vāyasāguruḥ kākatuṇḍaḥ || 4 ||

bhaveyam iti syām | janmajanmanīti janmani janmani || 6 ||

vaineyam iti vineyatvam || 8 ||

pauṣadhaṃ paurṇamāsyādau śvaḥ sūryodayāvadhikam aṣṭaśikṣāpadam | daśeti yāvajjīvāvadhikāni kāyavāgduścaritebhyaḥ saptabhyo viramaṇāni manoduścaritānāṃ ca trayāṇāmakaraṇam | virāgāya bhāṣā vibhāṣā saiva vaibhāṣyam tacca śrāvakayānam avadānaśatakatridaṇḍakamālādi | sūtram iti anatigambhīrāṇi mahāyānasūtrāṇi ekagāthācaturgāthādvaya dhāraṇīṣaṇmukhī bhadracaryācaturdharmakalalitavistaradaśabhūmakādīni || 9 ||

yogācāram iti cittamātramidaṃ viśvam asatyarthe 'rthapratibhāsaṃ cittameva vāsanābalādutpadyate yathā svapna iti | madhyamakam iti madhyamāṃ pratipadam tadapi cittaṃ na sat dvayarūpeṇa nāsat dvayaśūnyena rūpeṇeti | diśed iti deśayet | sarvamityādi | tadanviti vartate | sarvam iti pañcavidham kriyācaryāyogayogāntarayoganiruttarabhedena | vaibhāṣikādiprakārakārtsnyameva vivakṣitam na dravyakārtsnyam ānantyād | gṛhṇīyād iti kuryād ityarthaḥ || ādaramasmiṃstantre gauravam || 10 ||

mahāpaṇḍitācāryaratnākaraśāntikṛtāyāṃ muktāvalyāṃ hevajrapañjikāyāṃ dvitīyakalpe vineyapaṭalaḥ aṣṭamaḥ ||

mantroddhārapaṭalo navamaḥ

athāta ityādi | udghāṭanamudghāṭaḥ udghāṭayediti dhyānena || 1 ||

yoga eva pratiyogaḥ | adhyātmam atyantadṛptam krūraṃ tīvrakrodham | bhāvanā anantaroktā saiva kevalā tanmātram || 2 ||

apakārī nāśaka ityubhayatra || 3 ||

ya iti pareṇa sambandhaḥ tamiti yacchandanirdiṣṭam | dṛṣṭveti smṛtvā | yathārūpam iti svena rūpeṇa | udvamanam iti udvamantam || 4 ||

sūcīm iti vajrasūcīm | vahnirūpikām iti jvalantīm | dṛṣṭveti dhyātvā || 5 ||

avikalpam iti niḥsaṃśayam || 7 ||

mahāratnam iti cintāmaṇiḥ | viddhaḥ sanniti sa eva maṇiḥ | rucirabhipreto 'rthaḥ | pīyūṣam amṛtam || 7  9 ||

prabhuṃ samartham | rūpeṇeti tattvena | śṛṇvatām iti ye śṛṇvanti teṣām || 10 ||

prabhuṃ samartham | rūpeṇeti tattvena | śṛṇvatām iti ye śṛṇvanti teṣām || 10 ||

aṅghrayaḥ pādāḥ | vimokṣeti vimokṣaḥ | mātreṇeti mātrābhiḥ || 11 12 ||

mantroddhāram iti devyāḥ praśnagāthā || 14 ||

bhagavān iti saṃgītikārasya miśrakagāthā || 15 ||

vairocanaḥ praṇavaḥ | kīdṛśam caturthakam | pukkasīśobhitaṃ pukkasī ṣaṣṭhaḥ svara ū tena yojitamityarthaḥ | śūnyam ityanusvāram | kīdṛśam svāhāntam viniyojayet || 16 ||

tatraiva varṇādhipaḥ praṇavaḥ | khecarī pañcadaśaḥ svara aḥ || 17 ||

prathamasya dvitīyakaṃ kha dvitīyasya tṛtīyakaṃ ja | vāri caturthaḥ svara i || 18  19 ||

pañcamasya tṛtīyaṃ ba | ḍākinī pañcamaḥ svara u || 20 ||

varṇajyeṣaṭhaḥ praṇavaḥ | rambhā tilottame apsarasau || 21 ||

mohakulaṃ praṇavaḥ | ghuḥkāramiti prathamasya caturthaṃ vajraḍākīyojitaṃ savisargam || 22 ||

prathamasya prathamaṃ ka |antaḥsthānāṃ dvitīyaṃ ra | prathamasyāgrakaṃ ka | antaḥsthānāṃ tṛtīyaṃ la || 23  24 ||

tenaiva balenaiva | caurī ekādaśaḥ svaraḥ e || 25 ||

caturthasya tṛtīyaṃ da antaḥsthānāṃ caturthaṃ va || 26 ||

ūṣmāṇāṃ caturthaṃ ha | pañcamasya dvitīyaṃ pha | tṛtīyaṃ prathamaṃ ṭa || 27 ||

pañcamasya caturthaṃ bha | antaḥsthānāṃ prathamaṃ ya | ghasmarī trayodaśaḥ svaraḥ o || 28 ||

abhyantaragaurī tṛtīyaḥ svaraḥ i || 30 ||

dviguṇitamiti | kiṃ tat anantaroktaṃ padaṃ kiṭītyetat || 31 ||

caturthasya prathamaṃ ta | vetālī ai | vajrā ā || 32 ||

pañcamasya prathamaṃ pa || 33 ||

antaḥsthānāṃ dvitīyaṃ ra | kṣakāraśca dvayamiti samudāye dviguṇīkarttavya ityarthaḥ || 35 ||

tadanu vajrā iti savisargaḥ āḥ || 36 ||

ūṣmāṇāṃ tṛtīyakaṃ sa | antaḥsthānāṃ caturthaṃ va |

