jāpapaṭalo nāma daśamaḥ

athetyādi athetyānantarye | āhetyavadhāraṇe anantaramevetyartha | ekasaṃvaram iti advitīyaḥ saṃkṣepaḥ | japanaṃ jāpaḥ tad viṣaye tatsambandhaṃ vastu jāpamakṣasūtram | śeṣaṃ sugamam |

