sahajārthapaṭalo nāmaikādaśaḥ

gāḍhenetyādi | ityāheti idamāha || 1  2 ||

akṣobhyakulamiti akṣobhyastasya kulamityarthaḥ || 3 ||

vairocanasyeti vairocanakulinaḥ kulakulinorabhedopacārāt || 4 ||

