bodhayāmāseti āmantritavān || 10 ||

madanaṃ jñānodayam tadarthā aṅkā nakhakṣatādayāḥ akaroditi madanāṅkakaraḥ | bolavāniti stabdhabolaḥ | karmeti suratam || 13 ||

sahajārtho yogaḥ taddyotakaḥ paṭalaḥ |

mahāpaṇḍitācāryaratnākaraśāntikṛtāyāṃ muktavalyāṃ hevajrapañjikāyāṃ dvitīyakalpe sahajārthapaṭalaḥ ekādaśaḥ ||

mahātantrarājamāyākalpo dvitīyaḥ

athāheti anantarameva | vajrapratiṣṭhita iti vajradharatve susthitaḥ || 1 ||

bodhiḥ prajñā tasyāḥ putrakā bodhisattvāḥ || 2 ||

ratiḥ prītiḥ | sthānaṃ bodhicittasya | devī prajñā viśvanāryādi || 3 ||

mahāsūkṣmam anabhilāpyatvācca | vajrāstathāgatāḥ teṣāṃ maṇḍaṃ sāram | nabhopamaṃ nirābhāsatvāt | virajaskaṃ kleśakṣayatvāt | mokṣadaṃ bhavakṣayatvāt | śāntaṃ nirupadravatvāt | pitā te bījatvāt | tvamapi svayaṃ tanmayadehalābhāt || 4 ||

khagamukhamekarasaṃ ca bodhicittaṃ tathatālambanatvāt anābhāsatvācca | tatsvabhāvatvāt khagamukhaikaraso vajraḥ | kiñjalkaṃ padmasya || 6 ||

